#: src/games/ants/maps.md:49
msgid "The Water column is each shipped board's measured share of water. After turn zero, food arrives at the match's hidden rate ([the world](world.md#food)). Three of the five are rectangles, so never assume `rows == columns` in an adapter."
msgstr "“水域”一列是每张随发布版本附带的地图实测的水域占比。第 0 回合之后，食物按对局隐藏的速率出现（[世界](world.md#food)）。五张中有三张是长方形，所以适配器里绝不要假设 `rows == columns`。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:53
msgid "basic-tiny-2p"
msgstr "basic-tiny-2p"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:55
msgid "Open ground with short blocks of water, and dotted colonnades that shelter each hill and the food beside it. At 24 by 24 it has the smallest side a board may have, with two seats, one hill a seat and 18% water. 12 separate routes join a hill to the enemy's, 24 steps away. Each seat has 8 food at turn zero: a few beside its hill, the rest where the two seats contest it."
msgstr "开阔的地面上散布着短小的水块，点状的柱廊护住每个蚁丘和它旁边的食物。24 × 24 是地图允许的最小边长，两个席位，每席位一个蚁丘，18% 的水域。12 条互不相交的路线把一个蚁丘与敌方蚁丘相连，相距 24 步。每个席位在第 0 回合有 8 份食物：几份在蚁丘旁，其余在两个席位争夺的地带。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:62
msgid "The <code>basic-tiny-2p</code> board at turn zero: colonnade, 8-way, shift (12, 12)."
msgstr "第 0 回合的 <code>basic-tiny-2p</code> 地图：柱廊，8 向对称，偏移量 (12, 12)。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:69
msgid "basic-small-3p"
msgstr "basic-small-3p"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:71
msgid "Rock masses fill the ground between the three territories. Each hill sits in an open grotto, with passages between the grottos. The board is 36 by 36 with 40% water, three seats and one hill a seat, and 8 separate routes join a hill to the nearest enemy one, 24 steps away. Each seat has 11 food at turn zero: a few beside its hill, the rest anywhere on land."
msgstr "三块领土之间的地面被大片岩石填满。每个蚁丘坐落在一个开阔的洞窟里，洞窟之间有通道相连。地图为 36 × 36，40% 的水域，三个席位，每席位一个蚁丘，8 条互不相交的路线把一个蚁丘与最近的敌方蚁丘相连，相距 24 步。每个席位在第 0 回合有 11 份食物：几份在蚁丘旁，其余在陆地上任意位置。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:78
msgid "The <code>basic-small-3p</code> board at turn zero: grotto, two diagonal mirrors, shift (12, 12)."
msgstr "第 0 回合的 <code>basic-small-3p</code> 地图：洞窟，两条对角镜像，偏移量 (12, 12)。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:85
msgid "basic-medium-4p"
msgstr "basic-medium-4p"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:87
msgid "Long straight walls run in bands broken by regular gaps: a braided maze with many ways through and no dead ends. The board is 48 by 64 with 19% water and four seats. Each seat has two hills, one above the other and half the board apart. 18 separate routes join a hill to the nearest enemy one, 20 steps away. Each seat has 18 food at turn zero: a few beside its hills, the rest anywhere on land."
msgstr "长长的直墙成带状排列，被规律的缺口打断：一座辫状迷宫，通路众多，没有死路。地图为 48 × 64，19% 的水域，四个席位。每个席位有两个蚁丘，上下排列，相隔半张地图。18 条互不相交的路线把一个蚁丘与最近的敌方蚁丘相连，相距 20 步。每个席位在第 0 回合有 18 份食物：几份在蚁丘旁，其余在陆地上任意位置。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:95
msgid "The <code>basic-medium-4p</code> board at turn zero: braid, two mirrors, shift (24, 16)."
msgstr "第 0 回合的 <code>basic-medium-4p</code> 地图：辫状，两条镜像，偏移量 (24, 16)。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:102
msgid "basic-large-6p"
msgstr "basic-large-6p"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:104
msgid "A lattice of pillars and crosses covers the ground, and each hill stands in a hall walled above and below and open at both ends. The board is 80 by 96 with 20% water, six seats and one hill a seat. 12 separate routes join a hill to the nearest enemy one, 32 steps away. Each seat has 18 food at turn zero: a few beside its hill, the rest on ground that seat reaches first."
msgstr "地面上布满由柱子和十字组成的格栅，每个蚁丘立在一座上下有墙、两端敞开的厅堂里。地图为 80 × 96，20% 的水域，六个席位，每席位一个蚁丘。12 条互不相交的路线把一个蚁丘与最近的敌方蚁丘相连，相距 32 步。每个席位在第 0 回合有 18 份食物：几份在蚁丘旁，其余在该席位能最先到达的地面上。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:111
msgid "The <code>basic-large-6p</code> board at turn zero: halls, two mirrors, shift (40, 16)."
msgstr "第 0 回合的 <code>basic-large-6p</code> 地图：厅堂，两条镜像，偏移量 (40, 16)。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:118
msgid "basic-xlarge-8p"
msgstr "basic-xlarge-8p"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:120
msgid "Long ridges of rock run on the diagonal between the territories, with open ground round each hill. The board has the largest side the game allows: 120 by 124, with 30% water, eight seats and two hills a seat. 15 separate routes join a hill to the nearest enemy one, 46 steps away. Each seat has 24 food at turn zero: a few beside its hills, the rest anywhere on land. For an adapter, eight seats on 14,880 squares is the worst case on two counts: it sees every owner number from 1 to 7, and it has the most squares to encode."
msgstr "长长的岩脊沿对角线横亘在各领土之间，每个蚁丘周围是开阔地。这张地图有游戏允许的最大边长：120 × 124，30% 的水域，八个席位，每席位两个蚁丘。15 条互不相交的路线把一个蚁丘与最近的敌方蚁丘相连，相距 46 步。每个席位在第 0 回合有 24 份食物：几份在蚁丘旁，其余在陆地上任意位置。对适配器来说，14,880 格上的八个席位在两方面都是最坏情况：它会看到从 1 到 7 的每一个所有者编号，而且要编码的格子最多。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:129
msgid "The <code>basic-xlarge-8p</code> board at turn zero: grotto, half-turn, shift (15, 93)."
msgstr "第 0 回合的 <code>basic-xlarge-8p</code> 地图：洞窟，半周旋转，偏移量 (15, 93)。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:136
msgid "What every board guarantees"
msgstr "每张地图的保证"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:138
msgid "Every board keeps these properties, whatever its terrain. The cartridge refuses a board that breaks any of the first three, including one you write yourself, both at a season's upload and again before every match. Boards made the way the next section describes keep the last three as well."
msgstr "不论地形如何，每张地图都保持以下性质。违反前三条中任何一条的地图，卡带都会拒绝，包括你自己编写的地图；在赛季上传时检查一次，每场对局之前再检查一次。按下一节描述的方式制作的地图还保持后三条。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:142
msgid "**Every seat has the same board.** Seat `k`'s board is seat 0's moved by `k` times the board's _shift_, which the map file names as `symmetry: {dr, dc}`. Water, hills and turn-zero food all follow the shift to the square."
msgstr "**每个席位的地图都相同**。席位 `k` 的地图是席位 0 的地图按地图的<em>偏移量</em>移动 `k` 次得到的，地图文件把偏移量记为 `symmetry: {dr, dc}`。水域、蚁丘和第 0 回合的食物都精确到格地跟随这个偏移。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:145
msgid "**An ant can walk from every square of land to every other.** Ants move in four directions, so two land squares that touch only at a corner are no path, and the board has no sealed pockets for food to fall into."
msgstr "**蚂蚁可以从任何一格陆地走到任何另一格陆地**。蚂蚁只向四个方向移动，所以两格仅在角上相接的陆地不构成通路，而地图上没有食物可能落入的封闭死角。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:148
msgid "**Every hill has a way off it**, and every seat has the same number of hills."
msgstr "**每个蚁丘都有出路**，而且每个席位的蚁丘数量相同。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:149
msgid "**Every hill has room**: at least two open neighbours, in a clearing that reaches at least two squares in every direction."
msgstr "**每个蚁丘都有空间**：至少两个开放的相邻格，并处在向各个方向至少延伸两格的空地中。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:151
msgid "**No enemy hill is in view at turn zero**: every other seat's hills lie more than squared distance 77 away."
msgstr "**第 0 回合看不到任何敌方蚁丘**：其他每个席位的蚁丘都在距离平方 77 之外。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:153
msgid "**A seat's hills stand apart.** Each has its own part of the territory and a base of its own. The shortest walk between two of them is at least ten squares, and at least two fifths of the walk to the nearest enemy hill."
msgstr "**同一席位的蚁丘彼此分开**。每个蚁丘都有自己的一片领土和自己的基地。其中两个之间的最短步行距离至少十格，并且至少是到最近敌方蚁丘步行距离的五分之二。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:157
msgid "How a board is made"
msgstr "地图如何制作"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:159
msgid "`mapgen`, a tool in the Ants repository, draws each board as a **design**, and a person picks it. A designer makes a season's boards and the basic ones the same way; the two differ only in where they go."
msgstr "Ants 仓库中的工具 `mapgen` 把每张地图作为一个**设计**绘制出来，再由人来挑选。设计者用同样的方式制作赛季的地图和基础地图；两者只是去处不同。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:163
msgid "**Drawn under two symmetries.** The first is fairness: seat `k`'s board is seat 0's moved by the board's shift `k` times, and the cartridge checks it. The second only shapes how the board looks: a mirror or a turn about the centre of each seat's territory, which the Design column names. Two seats take the full eight-way symmetry of a square, and five a four-way spin. Three, six and seven seats take mirrors or a half-turn, because their centres cannot sit on a square grid. `mapgen` places shapes on that symmetry by territory: rings, keeps, pillars and halls round each hill, rivers along the borders, and lakes and outposts where three territories meet. The same idea stands in the same kind of place on every board."
msgstr "**在两种对称下绘制**。第一种是公平性：席位 `k` 的地图是席位 0 的地图按地图偏移量移动 `k` 次得到的，卡带会检查这一点。第二种只决定地图的外观：围绕每个席位领土中心的镜像或旋转，即“设计”一列所写的。两个席位采用正方形完整的八向对称，五个席位采用四向旋转。三个、六个和七个席位采用镜像或半周旋转，因为它们的中心无法落在方格网上。`mapgen` 按领土在这种对称上放置形状：每个蚁丘周围的环、堡、柱子和厅堂，沿边界的河流，以及三块领土交汇处的湖泊和前哨。同一种构思在每张地图上都出现在同一类位置。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:172
msgid "**Chosen from hundreds.** A designer names a slot (a size, a terrain of open, cave, maze or rooms, a seat count and a hill count), and `mapgen explore` draws hundreds of candidates for it. It keeps the playable ones: water within the terrain's range, more than one route between neighbours, few dead ends, hills spread. The designer plays the promising ones with every seat under the same policy (`mapgen playtest`) and throws out any board whose seats grow at different rates. `mapgen adopt` writes the pick down as a recipe, and the recipe is the board: no seed regenerates it, so an improved sampler never redraws a board somebody chose."
msgstr "**百里挑一**。设计者指定一个槽位：一种大小，一种地形（开阔 open、洞穴 cave、迷宫 maze 或房间 rooms），一个席位数和一个蚁丘数；`mapgen explore` 为它绘制数百个候选。它保留可玩的那些：水域在该地形的范围内，相邻席位之间不止一条路线，死路少，蚁丘分散。设计者让每个席位都用同一策略试玩有希望的候选（`mapgen playtest`），淘汰各席位扩张速度不一致的地图。`mapgen adopt` 把选中的地图记为一份配方，而配方就是地图：没有任何种子能重新生成它，所以改进后的采样器绝不会重画一张已被选中的地图。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:180
msgid "**Named by what it is**, by the designer's convention: `<size>-<terrain>-<N>p-<H>h`. A large maze board for four seats with two hills a seat would be `large-maze-4p-2h`. A season's upload checks that the name has that shape and that `N` and `H` match the file; the size and terrain words are the designer's, and the platform promises nothing by them."
msgstr "**以其本身命名**，按设计者的约定：`<size>-<terrain>-<N>p-<H>h`。一张四个席位、每席位两个蚁丘的大型迷宫地图就是 `large-maze-4p-2h`。赛季上传时会检查名称是否符合这个形式，以及 `N` 和 `H` 是否与文件一致；大小和地形两个词是设计者自己的说法，平台不对它们作任何承诺。"

