#: src/games/ants/maps.md:193
msgid "A board is never wider than four thirds of its height. Seat count depends on size: a board may not show you an enemy hill at turn zero, so more seats need more ground between the hills. The game's limit caps a season's board at 124 a side, whatever the size class allows."
msgstr "地图的宽度绝不超过高度的三分之四。席位数取决于大小：地图在第 0 回合不能让你看到敌方蚁丘，所以席位越多，蚁丘之间需要的地面就越多。不论大小等级允许多少，游戏的限制把赛季地图的每边封顶在 124。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:199
msgid "Each board has two or three food within two to six steps of each hill (two a hill when a seat has three hills or more), and places the rest by one of three rules, which the table names:"
msgstr "每张地图在每个蚁丘的两到六步之内放两到三份食物（席位有三个或更多蚁丘时，每个蚁丘两份），其余按三种规则之一放置，即表中所写的："

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:202
msgid "The rest goes"
msgstr "其余放在"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:204
msgid "home"
msgstr "主场"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:204
msgid "where your walk to it is shorter than any opponent's by more than 6 steps"
msgstr "你走到它的距离比任何对手都短 6 步以上的地方"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:205
msgid "contested"
msgstr "争夺"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:205
msgid "where your walk to it and the nearest opponent's are within 6 steps of each other"
msgstr "你和最近的对手走到它的距离相差不超过 6 步的地方"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:206
msgid "uniform"
msgstr "均匀"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:206
msgid "anywhere on land"
msgstr "陆地上任意位置"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:208
msgid "On some boards, a quarter of it goes first to the middles of the borders and the corners where territories meet. The amount grows with the ground a seat owns and with its hills: from 8 a seat on `basic-tiny-2p` to 24 on `basic-xlarge-8p`."
msgstr "在一些地图上，其中四分之一先放到边界的中点和领土交汇的角落。数量随席位拥有的地面和蚁丘增加：从 `basic-tiny-2p` 上的每席位 8 份到 `basic-xlarge-8p` 上的 24 份。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:212
msgid "A seat opens with one ant and one point for each hill it has, so four hills mean four ants, four points and four homes to defend. A colony that loses one hill keeps spawning from the others."
msgstr "席位开局时每有一个蚁丘就有一只蚂蚁和 1 分，所以四个蚁丘意味着四只蚂蚁、4 分和四个要守的家。失去一个蚁丘的蚁群仍然从其余蚁丘出生蚂蚁。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:215
msgid "The shift, and who your neighbours are"
msgstr "偏移量与你的邻居"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:217
msgid "A board of `p` seats has a shift that brings you home in `p` steps. On two seats it puts the other seat half the rows away, half the columns away, or both; on more, the seats sit at equal spacing on a lattice. The distance to the nearest enemy hill varies more than the board size suggests: from 20 steps on `basic-medium-4p` to 46 on `basic-xlarge-8p`."
msgstr "`p` 个席位的地图有一个偏移量，移动 `p` 次就回到原处。两个席位时，它把另一个席位放在相隔半数行、半数列或两者兼有的位置；更多席位时，各席位在一个点阵上等距分布。到最近敌方蚁丘的距离变化比地图大小所暗示的更大：从 `basic-medium-4p` 上的 20 步到 `basic-xlarge-8p` 上的 46 步。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:222
msgid "Observations [number opponents relative to you](../../models/observation.md#ownership-labels), and the numbering follows the shift: **opponent `j` is the seat `j` shifts along from you**. Opponent 1 is always at your hills plus the shift, so each number means the same neighbour whichever seat you sit in. Opponent `j` and opponent `p − j` sit the same distance away in opposite directions, so on three seats both opponents border you. Opponent numbers run from 1 to 7."
msgstr "观测[相对于你给对手编号](../../models/observation.md#ownership-labels)，而编号跟随偏移量：**对手 `j` 就是从你出发移动 `j` 个偏移量的席位**。对手 1 总是在你的蚁丘加上一个偏移量的位置，所以不论你坐在哪个席位，每个编号指的都是同一个邻居。对手 `j` 和对手 `p − j` 在相反方向上相距同样远，所以三个席位时两个对手都与你接壤。对手编号从 1 到 7。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:228
msgid "Walls do not hide anything"
msgstr "墙挡不住视线"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:230
msgid "Vision and attacks both reach through water. A wall blocks walking and leaves sight open, and it blocks a fight only when it is at least two squares thick: two ants on either side of a one-square wall stand two apart, inside the attack radius. Most walls are one or two squares thick. Some room and fortress walls are three, and cave rock has no set thickness."
msgstr "视野和攻击都能穿过水域。墙挡住行走，却挡不住视线；只有至少两格厚的墙才能挡住战斗：一格厚的墙两侧的两只蚂蚁相隔两格，在攻击半径之内。大多数墙一到两格厚。一些房间和堡垒的墙有三格厚，洞穴岩石则没有固定的厚度。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:235
msgid "Numbers each board carries"
msgstr "每张地图携带的数据"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:237
msgid "`mapgen` records what it measured on each board it makes, under `generator.metrics`, from seat 0's first hill (the shift makes every seat's the same): `routes` (square-disjoint routes from the ground around that hill to the ground around the nearest enemy hill, counted up to 32), `enemy_walk` and `open_walk` (the walk to that enemy hill, and the same walk with no water), `detour_pct` (the first as a percentage of the second), `home_view_land` (the land its ant sees at turn zero), `dead_end_pm` (land squares with at most one land neighbour, per thousand land squares), `water_pm` (water per thousand squares), `water_runs` (run-length pairs in the board's water mask) and `food_per_seat`. `generator` also names the recipe `mapgen` drew the board from, its `family` and its decorative `symmetry`. The cartridge ignores all of these; a season's uploaded board carries them only because `mapgen` wrote them."
msgstr "`mapgen` 把它在每张所制作地图上测得的数据记录在 `generator.metrics` 下，以席位 0 的第一个蚁丘为基准（偏移量使每个席位的都相同）：`routes`（从该蚁丘周围的地面到最近敌方蚁丘周围的地面之间格子互不相交的路线数，最多计到 32）、`enemy_walk` 和 `open_walk`（走到那个敌方蚁丘的距离，以及没有水域时的同一段距离）、`detour_pct`（前者占后者的百分比）、`home_view_land`（它的蚂蚁在第 0 回合看到的陆地）、`dead_end_pm`（至多只有一个陆地邻格的陆地格数，每千格陆地）、`water_pm`（每千格中的水域数）、`water_runs`（地图水域掩码的游程对）和 `food_per_seat`。`generator` 还记录 `mapgen` 绘制该地图所用的配方、它的 `family` 和装饰性的 `symmetry`。卡带忽略所有这些；赛季上传的地图携带它们，只是因为 `mapgen` 写下了它们。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:248
msgid "Train across the limits"
msgstr "面向全部限制训练"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:250
msgid "The seed and the engine together determine a match, and the board is part of the match. A replay carries its board, so keep the replay to reproduce a match; the board's name alone does not reproduce it. The matchmaker spreads play across the season's boards in play **that the pool can seat**. Each seat of a match is a different competitor, baselines included, so an eight-seat board waits until eight competitors have versions to pair."
msgstr "种子和引擎共同决定一场对局，而地图是对局的一部分。回放携带它的地图，所以要重现一场对局就保留回放；仅凭地图名称无法重现。配对把对局分散到赛季启用中、**且参赛池坐得满**的地图上。一场对局的每个席位都是不同的参赛者（基线也算），所以八席位的地图要等到有八个参赛者有版本可配对时才会使用。"

#: src/games/ants/maps.md:256
msgid "Train and validate on every seat count from two to eight and every size up to 124 a side. The basic boards span that range, a season's boards are public once uploaded, and `tinybrains maps check` tells you whether a board you drew is one a season could play. Group your results by what boards share (a seat count, a size, a terrain) before you conclude that a change improves the model overall. A fixed-size graph needs explicit padding, or another representation that fits every size, with its outputs mapped back to real coordinates."
msgstr "在从两个到八个的每一种席位数、每边最大 124 的每一种大小上训练和验证。基础地图覆盖这个范围，赛季的地图一经上传就公开，而 `tinybrains maps check` 会告诉你自己绘制的地图是否是赛季能使用的。在断定某项改动整体上改进了模型之前，先按地图的共同点（席位数、大小、地形）给结果分组。固定大小的计算图需要显式填充，或者另一种适应所有大小的表示，并把输出映射回真实坐标。"

#: src/models/observation.md:3
msgid "The Ants observation is a JSON object for one colony on one turn. Each adapter in your [manifest](adapters.md) receives this object as its whole document. The game sends no setup message and no terminal observation: once a seat stops playing, its model gets no more calls."
msgstr "Ants 的观测是一个 JSON 对象，对应一个蚁群在一个回合里的所见。你[清单](adapters.md)中的每个适配器都把这个对象当作自己的完整文档来接收。游戏不发送任何初始化消息，也不发送终局观测：一个席位一旦停止参赛，它的模型就不会再被调用。"

