msgstr "`memory_flat_bytes`"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:18
msgid "`memory_cell_bytes`"
msgstr "`memory_cell_bytes`"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:20
msgid "Nano (`nano`)"
msgstr "Nano（`nano`）"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:20
msgid "16 KiB = 16,384 bytes"
msgstr "16 KiB = 16,384 字节"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:21
msgid "Micro (`micro`)"
msgstr "Micro（`micro`）"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:21
msgid "128 KiB = 131,072 bytes"
msgstr "128 KiB = 131,072 字节"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:22
msgid "Mini (`mini`)"
msgstr "Mini（`mini`）"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:22
msgid "1 MiB = 1,048,576 bytes"
msgstr "1 MiB = 1,048,576 字节"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:23
msgid "Small (`small`)"
msgstr "Small（`small`）"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:23
msgid "8 MiB = 8,388,608 bytes"
msgstr "8 MiB = 8,388,608 字节"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:24
msgid "Large (`large`)"
msgstr "Large（`large`）"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:24
msgid "64 MiB = 67,108,864 bytes"
msgstr "64 MiB = 67,108,864 字节"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:26
msgid "The last two columns are the class's [memory](#memory). 0 and 0 is no memory, and that is the default."
msgstr "最后两列是该重量级的[记忆](#memory)。0 和 0 表示没有记忆，这也是默认值。"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:29
msgid "Limits are inclusive. Under the table above, an entry of 16,384 bytes is Nano and one of 16,385 bytes is Micro. An entry over the largest class the season offers is too large for that season."
msgstr "限制包含边界值。按上表，16,384 字节的作品是 Nano，16,385 字节的是 Micro。超过赛季开放的最大重量级的作品，对该赛季来说就太大了。"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:32
msgid "**Your class limits size and the memory it allows.** No class caps compute or rations how much arithmetic your graph may do. The game's turn deadline bounds that: 1,000 ms for Ants, **yours alone**, since each seat is its own call. A graph too slow to answer in time misses the turn and takes a [strike](../competing/matches.md). Admission reports your inference time on the reference set, and rejects you for time only when its probe at your `probe_dims` does not fit a turn at all."
msgstr "**重量级限制的是大小和允许的记忆**。没有哪个重量级限制算力，或配给你的计算图可以做多少运算。约束它的是游戏的回合时限：Ants 为 1,000 ms，而且**只属于你**，因为每个席位是各自独立的调用。来不及作答的计算图会错过该回合并受到一次[判罚](../competing/matches.md)。审核会报告你在参考集上的推理时间，只有当它在你的 `probe_dims` 下的探测根本放不进一个回合时，才会因时间拒绝你。"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:38
msgid "The size limits belong to the season, so **a class result is comparable within its season, and across seasons only when their limits match.** Two seasons with different Nano limits ran two different competitions, and the standings say which limits each one played under."
msgstr "大小限制属于赛季，所以**重量级内的成绩在同一赛季内可比，跨赛季只有在限制相同时才可比**。Nano 限制不同的两个赛季是两场不同的比赛，排名会注明各自是在什么限制下进行的。"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:44
msgid "A class may let a model carry a [memory](memory.md) from one turn to the next. Two numbers in the season's class table set how much, and on a board of `rows × cols` cells the cap is"
msgstr "重量级可以允许模型在回合之间携带[记忆](memory.md)。赛季重量级表中的两个数字规定能带多少，在 `rows × cols` 个格子的地图上，上限为"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:51
msgid "**A season sets them, and both default to 0**, which is no memory: admission refuses a model that declares a memory output in such a class with `MEMORY_NOT_ALLOWED`. In the API, each entry of a season's `weight_classes` carries `memory_flat_bytes` and `memory_cell_bytes` beside `max_bytes`, and an entry without them means 0. The site shows a class's memory beside its size limit wherever it shows the limit, and the maps page shows what that allows on each board. A season's classes are fixed once it opens, so a model admitted under a cap plays the whole season under it."
msgstr "**它们由赛季设定，默认都是 0**，即没有记忆：在这样的重量级里声明了记忆输出的模型，审核会以 `MEMORY_NOT_ALLOWED` 拒绝。在 API 中，赛季 `weight_classes` 的每一项在 `max_bytes` 旁带有 `memory_flat_bytes` 和 `memory_cell_bytes`，缺少它们的项表示 0。网站凡是显示重量级大小限制的地方，都会在旁边显示它的记忆，地图页面则显示这在每张地图上允许多少。赛季一旦开始，重量级就固定下来，所以在某个上限下通过审核的模型整个赛季都在该上限下比赛。"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:58
msgid "A season may allow at most 262,144 flat bytes and 16 bytes a cell. Admission prices your memory at the smallest board and the largest, as [the cap](memory.md#the-cap) explains, and **memory does not count toward your size**: your class is still decided by the two files' bytes."
msgstr "赛季最多允许 262,144 字节的固定部分，外加每格 16 字节。审核会按最小和最大的地图计算你的记忆开销，详见[上限](memory.md#the-cap)；而且**记忆不计入你的大小**：重量级仍由两个文件的字节数决定。"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:62
msgid "How many parameters fit"
msgstr "能装下多少参数"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:64
msgid "The metric counts raw bytes, with no compression in between, so the number of parameters that fit depends on the dtype you export in:"
msgstr "度量统计的是原始字节，中间没有压缩，所以能装下的参数数量取决于你导出时使用的 dtype："

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:67
msgid "Initializer dtype"
msgstr "初始化器 dtype"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:67
msgid "Bytes per parameter"
msgstr "每个参数的字节数"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:67
msgid "Relative capacity"
msgstr "相对容量"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:69
msgid "`float32`"
msgstr "`float32`"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:69
msgid "1.00x"
msgstr "1.00x"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:70
msgid "`float16`"
msgstr "`float16`"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:70
msgid "**2.00x**"
msgstr "**2.00x**"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:71
msgid "`int8`"
msgstr "`int8`"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:71
msgid "4.00x"
msgstr "4.00x"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:73
msgid "**Exporting float16 weights doubles the model your class holds**, at no cost you would notice. Keep the graph's compute in float32 by casting each initializer back at its use; the runtime folds that cast away when it optimises the plan. You need no new operator, since `Cast` is on the allowlist. In a measured comparison, the float16 graph chose the same move as the float32 one on every ant of three matches."
msgstr "**以 float16 导出权重能让重量级容纳的模型翻倍**，而代价小到你察觉不到。在每个初始化器的使用处把它转换回来，让计算图的计算保持在 float32；运行时优化执行计划时会把这次转换折叠掉。不需要新的算子，因为 `Cast` 在允许列表上。在一次实测对比中，float16 计算图在三场对局的每一只蚂蚁上都选出了与 float32 相同的走法。"

#: src/models/weight-classes.md:79
msgid "Subtract your manifest first. The baselines' manifest is 930 bytes: 6% of a Nano budget, and negligible in the larger classes."
msgstr "先减去你的清单。基线的清单是 930 字节：占 Nano 预算的 6%，在更大的重量级里可以忽略不计。"

