msgstr "`\"orion:model@1.0.0\"`。平台拒绝任何其他值"

#: src/models/adapters.md:52
msgid "`name`"
msgstr "`name`"

#: src/models/adapters.md:52
msgid "Yours, for your own records. **The platform registers your model under an id of its own**, so this name documents the model and identifies nothing"
msgstr "你自己起的，供你自己记录。**平台用它自己的 id 登记你的模型**，所以这个名字只是说明模型，不标识任何东西"

#: src/models/adapters.md:53
msgid "`inputs`"
msgstr "`inputs`"

#: src/models/adapters.md:53
msgid "One entry per graph input, each with `name`, `dtype`, `shape` and `adapter`. The name must be the graph's own input name"
msgstr "计算图的每个输入一项，各带 `name`、`dtype`、`shape` 和 `adapter`。名字必须是计算图自己的输入名"

#: src/models/adapters.md:54
msgid "`outputs`"
msgstr "`outputs`"

#: src/models/adapters.md:54
msgid "One entry per graph output, each with `name`, `dtype` and `shape`, and no adapter: the platform reads it"
msgstr "计算图的每个输出一项，各带 `name`、`dtype` 和 `shape`，没有适配器：由平台读取"

#: src/models/adapters.md:55
msgid "`probe_dims`"
msgstr "`probe_dims`"

#: src/models/adapters.md:55
msgid "The size admission probes each named dimension at. See [below](#probe-at-the-biggest-board)"
msgstr "审核探测时每个具名维度取的大小。见[下文](#probe-at-the-biggest-board)"

#: src/models/adapters.md:56
msgid "`result`"
msgstr "`result`"

#: src/models/adapters.md:56
msgid "**Not allowed.** The platform refuses a manifest carrying one with `RESULT_NOT_ALLOWED`"
msgstr "**不允许**。平台会以 `RESULT_NOT_ALLOWED` 拒绝带有它的清单"

#: src/models/adapters.md:58
msgid "The platform ignores other top-level keys, but they are still bytes: they change the hash and count toward your size."
msgstr "平台忽略其他顶层键，但它们仍然是字节：会改变哈希，也会计入你的大小。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:61
msgid "A dimension may be a name"
msgstr "维度可以是名字"

#: src/models/adapters.md:63
msgid "A shape is a list, and each entry is **a positive integer or a name**:"
msgstr "形状是一个列表，每一项是**正整数或名字**："

#: src/models/adapters.md:69
msgid "A name binds on its first occurrence in a call, in an input's shape or an output's, and every later occurrence must equal that binding. An axis you write as a number must equal that number."
msgstr "名字在一次调用中首次出现时绑定，不论是出现在某个输入的形状里还是某个输出的形状里，之后每次出现都必须等于那次绑定的值。写成数字的轴必须恰好等于那个数字。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:72
msgid "Names let one entry play every board a season runs. A season's Ants boards can be any size from 24 to 124 a side, up to 14,880 squares, and a season can add a board while it runs. A fully convolutional network names `H` and `W`, and one admitted session serves every board. An entry with fixed spatial dimensions is legal and plays only the boards it declared; the node refuses it at the first observation of any other size."
msgstr "名字让一个参赛模型能打赛季里的每一张地图。一个赛季的 Ants 地图边长可以是 24 到 124 之间的任意值，最多 14,880 格，而且赛季进行中还可以新增地图。全卷积网络把 `H` 和 `W` 写成名字，一个通过审核的会话就能应对所有地图。空间维度固定的参赛模型也是合法的，只是只能打它声明的那些地图；节点一收到其他尺寸的观测就会拒绝它。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:78
msgid "**A graph that computes its own indices cannot name its axes.** If your network computes a flat index from `H` and `W` inside itself (a `Shape` → `Mul` → `Gather` chain, the usual export of a `tensor[batch, idx]` lookup), the runtime cannot type-check it against a symbol and refuses to build a plan. Either declare concrete spatial dimensions and play one board size, or move the indexing out of the graph. Admission reports a failed plan with the runtime's own message."
msgstr "**自己计算索引的计算图无法给轴起名字**。如果你的网络在内部用 `H` 和 `W` 计算扁平索引（`Shape` → `Mul` → `Gather` 这条链，也就是 `tensor[batch, idx]` 查找的常见导出形式），运行时就无法用符号对它做类型检查，从而拒绝构建执行计划。要么声明具体的空间维度、只打一种地图尺寸，要么把索引计算移出计算图。审核会报告执行计划构建失败，并附上运行时自己的报错信息。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:84
msgid "Probe at the biggest board"
msgstr "在最大的地图上探测"

#: src/models/adapters.md:86
msgid "Admission runs five inferences on zero-filled inputs, and the median must fit the game's turn deadline, 1,000 ms for Ants. It runs them at `probe_dims`, which **you declare**. Declare `{\"H\": 24, \"W\": 24}` and you get a verdict on a 24×24 board, while a season may also play you at 120×124, the size where a slow turn would strike you. Declare the largest board the game allows: 14,880 squares, the 120×124 basic board. A season can add a board while it runs, so its largest board today can be outgrown ([The maps](../games/ants/maps.md#the-limits-every-board-is-inside)). Admission probes a name with no `probe_dims` entry at 1."
msgstr "审核会在全零输入上运行五次推理，中位数必须在游戏的回合时限之内，Ants 是 1,000 ms。推理按 `probe_dims` 运行，而它**由你声明**。声明 `{\"H\": 24, \"W\": 24}`，你得到的是 24×24 地图上的结论，而赛季还可能让你打 120×124 的地图，那正是慢回合会让你吃判罚的尺寸。请声明游戏允许的最大地图：14,880 格，也就是 120×124 的基础地图。赛季进行中还可以新增地图，所以它今天最大的地图以后可能被超过（[地图](../games/ants/maps.md#the-limits-every-board-is-inside)）。`probe_dims` 里没有的名字，审核按 1 探测。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:94
msgid "The adapter"
msgstr "适配器"

#: src/models/adapters.md:96
msgid "Each input has one adapter, and the node evaluates it against **the observation as the game sends it**: `{\"var\": \"mine\"}` is your ants and `{\"var\": \"size.1\"}` is the board's width. The adapter must produce a tensor whose dtype and shape match the input's declaration, with names bound as above."
msgstr "每个输入有一个适配器，节点拿它对**游戏发来的原样观测**求值：`{\"var\": \"mine\"}` 是你的蚂蚁，`{\"var\": \"size.1\"}` 是地图的宽度。适配器必须生成一个数据类型和形状都与输入声明一致的张量，名字按上文的方式绑定。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:100
msgid "An adapter may not read `{\"secret\": …}`, `now` or `random`, and registration refuses a manifest that tries. An adapter also has no filesystem and no network. What it knows of earlier turns is what your model wrote into its [memory](memory.md), which arrives on the observation like any other field. The same adapter on the same observation costs the same on any machine."
msgstr "适配器不能读取 `{\"secret\": …}`、`now` 或 `random`，注册时会拒绝尝试这么做的清单。适配器也没有文件系统和网络。它对之前回合的了解，只有你的模型写进[记忆](memory.md)的内容，而记忆像其他字段一样随观测一起到达。同一个适配器处理同一个观测，在任何机器上的开销都相同。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:105
msgid "Two halves: JSON, and tensors"
msgstr "两个部分：JSON 与张量"

#: src/models/adapters.md:107
msgid "A program is JSONLogic (`var`, `map`, `filter`, `reduce`, arithmetic, comparisons) over plain JSON values, plus **tensor operators** that cross into tensors and back. The split between the two decides what you can write:"
msgstr "程序是作用于普通 JSON 值的 JSONLogic（`var`、`map`、`filter`、`reduce`、算术、比较），外加跨入张量再回来的**张量操作符**。两者之间的分界决定了你能写什么："

#: src/models/adapters.md:111
msgid "**A tensor is opaque.** A program can read its shape and its dtype and nothing else: it cannot index into a tensor, `map` over one, or do arithmetic on one."
msgstr "**张量是不透明的**。程序只能读它的形状和数据类型，别的都不行：不能对张量做索引、不能 `map` 遍历它、不能对它做算术。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:113
msgid "**Into tensors**: `tensor`, `zeros`, `full`, `scatter`, `rle_expand` and `one_hot` build one from JSON."
msgstr "**进入张量**：`tensor`、`zeros`、`full`、`scatter`、`rle_expand` 和 `one_hot` 从 JSON 构建一个张量。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:115
msgid "**Between tensors**: `stack`, `concat`, `unstack`, `reshape`, `transpose`, `pad`, `crop`, `cast`, `normalize` and `gather`."
msgstr "**张量之间**：`stack`、`concat`、`unstack`、`reshape`、`transpose`、`pad`、`crop`、`cast`、`normalize` 和 `gather`。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:117
msgid "**Back to JSON**: `argmax`, `to_list`, `shape` and `dtype`."
msgstr "**回到 JSON**：`argmax`、`to_list`、`shape` 和 `dtype`。"

#: src/models/adapters.md:119
msgid "The JSON half selects and rearranges the observation (which lists, which fields, which coordinates), and the tensor half packs the result into the shape your graph expects. Put anything that _computes_ with the numbers in the graph, where it runs compiled. The expression language leaves out matrix multiply and convolution by design ([why](adapters/dialect.md#what-the-language-will-not-do))."
msgstr "JSON 部分负责从观测中挑选和重排（哪些列表、哪些字段、哪些坐标），张量部分把结果打包成你的计算图期望的形状。凡是要对数字做<em>计算</em>的，都放进计算图，在那里它是编译执行的。表达式语言有意不提供矩阵乘法和卷积（[原因](adapters/dialect.md#what-the-language-will-not-do)）。"

