msgid "A minimal manifest"
msgstr "最小清单"

#: src/models/adapters.md:127
msgid "The smallest complete manifest feeds two planes, your ants and the water you have seen, to a fully convolutional graph:"
msgstr "最小的完整清单向一个全卷积计算图送入两个平面：你的蚂蚁，和你见过的水域："

