msgid "The Studio evaluates the JSON half and stops at the tensor half. It shows each tensor call with its arguments worked out (the points, the shape, the dtype), the same arguments the node's operator receives, and it never builds the tensor. [Seeing it in DataLogic Studio](studio.md) says what to look at, and where the Studio and the arena disagree."
msgstr "Studio 会对 JSON 部分求值，到张量部分就停下。它展示每个张量调用及其算好的参数（那些点、那个形状、那个数据类型），也就是节点上的操作符会收到的参数，但从不真正构建张量。[在 DataLogic Studio 中查看](studio.md)说明了该看什么，以及 Studio 与竞技场在哪些地方不一致。"

