msgstr "`{\"rle_expand\": [{\"var\": \"vis.rle\"}, {\"var\": \"size\"}, \"i8\"]}`"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:114
msgid "Every cell you can see this turn"
msgstr "本回合你能看到的每一格"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:116
msgid "`scatter` starts from a grid of zeros in the given shape and writes `1` at each `[row, col]` point. The shape is `{\"var\": \"size\"}`, which the adapter reads from the observation. An adapter that writes `[80, 80]` into itself fails on every other board size."
msgstr "`scatter` 从一张给定形状的全零网格开始，在每个 `[row, col]` 点写入 `1`。形状是 `{\"var\": \"size\"}`，由适配器从观测中读取。把 `[80, 80]` 写死在自己里面的适配器，在其他每一种地图尺寸上都会失败。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:120
msgid "Stripping the owner"
msgstr "去掉所有者"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:122
msgid "A foe arrives as `[row, col, owner]`, and `scatter` reads a third element as **the value to write**. On a two-seat board every foe is labelled `1`, so a scatter of the raw triples writes the right value by accident. On boards with more seats the label runs up to 7, and the scatter writes that label into the plane. Strip the owner, so a `1` in the plane means \"a foe is here\" for every foe. A `map` rebuilds each triple as a pair:"
msgstr "敌方蚂蚁以 `[row, col, owner]` 的形式到达，而 `scatter` 把第三个元素当作**要写入的值**。在两席位的地图上，每只敌方蚂蚁都标为 `1`，所以直接散布原始三元组碰巧写入了正确的值。在席位更多的地图上，标签最大可到 7，散布就会把这个标签写进平面。去掉所有者，让平面里的 `1` 对每只敌方蚂蚁都表示“这里有敌蚁”。用一个 `map` 把每个三元组重建为二元组："

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:135
msgid "Inside the `map` body the document is one foe, so `{\"var\": \"0\"}` is its row and `{\"var\": \"1\"}` its column."
msgstr "在 `map` 的主体里，文档是一只敌方蚂蚁，所以 `{\"var\": \"0\"}` 是它的行，`{\"var\": \"1\"}` 是它的列。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:138
msgid "Splitting hills by owner"
msgstr "按所有者拆分蚁丘"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:140
msgid "`hills` holds both sides' standing hills, and owners are **relative to you**: `0` is always yours, and `1` upward is an opponent ([ownership labels](../observation.md#ownership-labels)). A `filter` on the third element selects one side, and the same `map` strips the owner:"
msgstr "`hills` 包含双方尚存的蚁丘，所有者是**相对于你**的：`0` 永远是你，`1` 往上是对手（[所有权标签](../observation.md#ownership-labels)）。对第三个元素做 `filter` 选出一方，再用同一个 `map` 去掉所有者："

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:154
msgid "The enemy plane is the same expression with `!=`. Two planes take two expressions, because an adapter returns one tensor, and an object holding two is not a tensor ([why](dialect.md#expressions-and-the-one-rule-about-objects))."
msgstr "敌方平面是同一个表达式换成 `!=`。两个平面要两个表达式，因为适配器只返回一个张量，而装着两个张量的对象不是张量（[原因](dialect.md#expressions-and-the-one-rule-about-objects)）。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:158
msgid "Water, and what you can see"
msgstr "水域与你能看到的"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:160
msgid "Both are run-length masks in row-major order, `[value, count, value, count, …]`, and `rle_expand` unrolls each into a plane with no JSON loop over the cells. The runs must not add up to more than `H × W`, and the game's runs always add up to `H × W`."
msgstr "两者都是行优先顺序的游程掩码，`[value, count, value, count, …]`，`rle_expand` 把每一个展开成平面，不需要用 JSON 循环遍历格子。各段游程之和不得超过 `H × W`，而游戏给出的游程之和总是恰好等于 `H × W`。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:164
msgid "You need both planes to read a `0` in `water`. It means known land **or never seen**, and the game does not tell those apart. `vis` answers the half of that question the observation can: under a `1` for visible, a `0` for water is land you are looking at; under a `0`, it means only that no water is known there."
msgstr "要读懂 `water` 里的 `0`，两个平面都需要。它表示已知的陆地**或从未见过**，游戏不区分这两者。`vis` 回答了观测所能回答的那一半：在可见的 `1` 之下，水域的 `0` 是你正看着的陆地；在 `0` 之下，它只表示那里没有已知的水域。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:169
msgid "**The game sends `vis`, and your adapter cannot derive it.** Deriving it means marking every cell within squared radius 77 of one of your ants on a board that wraps. **This language cannot express that**: it is a disk drawn per ant, and an inner iterator cannot see the enclosing ant ([scope](dialect.md#reaching-outwards-and-the-one-place-you-cannot)). The engine computes the mask anyway and sends it, and one `rle_expand` turns it into the plane."
msgstr "**`vis` 由游戏发来，你的适配器推导不出来**。推导它意味着在一张环绕的地图上，标出你每只蚂蚁距离平方 77 以内的每一格。**这门语言表达不了这件事**：这是逐只蚂蚁画出的圆盘，而内层迭代器看不到外层的那只蚂蚁（[作用域](dialect.md#reaching-outwards-and-the-one-place-you-cannot)）。引擎反正会计算这个掩码并发过来，一个 `rle_expand` 就把它变成平面。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:175
msgid "Stacking, and the batch axis"
msgstr "堆叠与批次轴"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:184
msgid "`stack` on axis 0 turns seven `[H, W]` planes into one `[7, H, W]` tensor. `reshape` adds the leading axis of `1`, with the shape built at run time (`merge` of `[1, 7]` and the size is `[1, 7, 64, 96]`), and costs a single operation, because a reshape moves no elements."
msgstr "在第 0 轴上 `stack`，把七个 `[H, W]` 平面变成一个 `[7, H, W]` 张量。`reshape` 加上前导的 `1` 轴，形状在运行时拼出（`[1, 7]` 与尺寸 `merge` 得到 `[1, 7, 64, 96]`），只花一次操作，因为 reshape 不移动任何元素。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:188
msgid "The leading `1` is the batch axis. The manifest declares it as the literal `1`, because a match runs one seat per call and nothing batches. You can still export the graph with a dynamic axis there: it costs nothing and keeps the artifact usable in a trainer that batches."
msgstr "前导的 `1` 是批次轴。清单把它声明为字面量 `1`，因为一场对局每次调用只跑一个席位，没有任何批处理。你仍然可以在导出计算图时把这一轴设为动态：这不花任何代价，还能让模型文件在带批处理的训练器里继续可用。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:192
msgid "**The adapter's result is the tensor itself.** The input's `name` in the declaration names it. An adapter that returned `{\"board\": …}` would call an operator named `board`."
msgstr "**适配器的结果就是张量本身**。声明里输入的 `name` 就是它的名字。返回 `{\"board\": …}` 的适配器，是在调用一个名为 `board` 的操作符。"

#: src/models/adapters/walkthrough.md:195
msgid "What it costs"
msgstr "开销"

