msgid "`tinybrains adapt` runs the manifest over the cartridge's reference observations and prints what each one charged. Measured on 1 October 2026 over the five basic boards the reference set is drawn on, this adapter charged the following on the smallest, one in the middle and the largest:"
msgstr "`tinybrains adapt` 用这份清单跑一遍卡带的参考观测，并打印每一个的计费。在参考集所取自的五张基础地图上，2026 年 10 月 1 日测得这个适配器在最小、中等和最大地图上的计费如下："

