msgstr "键不是操作符的单键对象"

#: src/models/adapters/studio.md:46
msgid "Data, as in the Studio. `tinybrains` warns about it, which is how you catch a misspelt operator"
msgstr "是数据，与 Studio 一致。`tinybrains` 会对此发出警告，拼错的操作符就是这样被抓到的"

#: src/models/adapters/studio.md:47
msgid "A `$`\\-escaped key, `{\"$shape\": [6, 7]}`"
msgstr "用 `$` 转义的键，`{\"$shape\": [6, 7]}`"

