msgstr "**必填**：每场对局都需要一张地图，没有什么会替你挑选"

#: src/models/testing.md:197
msgid "**`vars` override the cartridge, and only where you write one.** An absent `max_turns` or `turn_ms` falls through to the game's limits, an absent `budget_ops` to its adapter budget, and an absent `strike_ceiling` to five; a run that plays a model prints the turn and the budget it used. A starter writes `max_turns: 300`, to keep a local match short, and nothing else: a number you write down stops tracking the platform. A file may also name the `engine_digest` it expects, and the CLI warns when the cartridge it plays is another."
msgstr "**`vars` 会覆盖卡带的设置，且只覆盖你写了的那些**。缺少 `max_turns` 或 `turn_ms` 时回落到游戏的限制，缺少 `budget_ops` 时回落到它的适配器预算，缺少 `strike_ceiling` 时回落到五次；运行模型的一次运行会打印它所用的回合时限和预算。入门套件只写了 `max_turns: 300`，为了让本地对局短一些，别的都没写：你写下的数字就不再跟随平台变化。文件还可以指定它期望的 `engine_digest`，当实际运行的卡带不是它时 CLI 会发出警告。"

#: src/models/testing.md:204
msgid "A row's `map` names the board one of three ways: the id of a board the release ships (`tinybrains maps` lists them: the five basic boards); a path ending `.json`, which resolves against the match file's own directory like a seat's weights (play a season's board this way, saved from its maps listing); or the board itself, inline. The CLI refuses a row that names a `preset`: the format has no presets. On the ladder you never choose the board; pairing picks it from the season's boards in play, with the seed. `seat_count` must equal the board's `players`. One command plays every row in a file, and rows may use different boards as long as they seat the same number. The ladder plays one row at a time, so a long file adds volume without rehearsing how production batches."
msgstr "行的 `map` 可以用三种方式之一指定地图：发布版本自带地图的 id（`tinybrains maps` 会列出它们：五张基础地图）；一个以 `.json` 结尾的路径，像席位的权重一样相对于对局文件所在目录解析（想打某个赛季的地图就用这种方式，从该赛季的地图列表保存下来）；或者直接内联地图本身。CLI 拒绝指定了 `preset` 的行：这种格式没有预设。在天梯上你从不选择地图；配对会连同种子一起，从赛季启用中的地图里挑选。`seat_count` 必须等于地图的 `players`。一条命令会运行文件中的每一行，只要席位数相同，各行可以使用不同的地图。天梯一次只运行一行，所以长文件只是增加了对局数量，并不能演练生产环境的批量方式。"

#: src/models/testing.md:213
msgid "Train against the real engine"
msgstr "用真实引擎训练"

#: src/models/testing.md:219
msgid "A training loop needs to step the world. Write a second implementation of the rules in Python and your model ends up strong against your copy of the game and weak against the real one. `env` puts the real cartridge behind a JSON Lines protocol on stdin and stdout, one object per line. The first line out is a `hello` carrying the engine digest, the evaluator's version, the boards in the pool, the game's limits and budgets, and the pool's own settings. After it, `{\"op\": \"observe\"}` returns every live seat's observation and `{\"op\": \"step\", \"actions\": [...]}` advances them; `env` reports finished matches in `ended` and replaces them from the pool."
msgstr "训练循环需要推进世界。如果你用 Python 再写一份规则实现，你的模型最终会在你那份游戏复制品上很强，而在真实游戏上很弱。`env` 把真实的卡带放在一个基于标准输入和标准输出的 JSON Lines 协议之后，每行一个对象。输出的第一行是 `hello`，带有引擎摘要、求值器版本、池中的地图、游戏的限制和预算，以及池本身的设置。之后，`{\"op\": \"observe\"}` 返回每个存活席位的观测，`{\"op\": \"step\", \"actions\": [...]}` 推进它们；`env` 在 `ended` 中报告已结束的对局，并从池中补上新的对局。"

#: src/models/testing.md:227
msgid "```jsonc\n← {\"ok\":true,\"hello\":{\"game\":\"ants\",\"engine_digest\":\"sha256:…\",\"evaluator\":\"datalogic …\",\"maps\":[{\"id\":\"basic-tiny-2p\",\"players\":2,\"rows\":24,\"cols\":24},…],\"waves\":4,\"matches_per_wave\":16,…}}\n→ {\"op\":\"observe\"}\n← {\"ok\":true,\"turn\":0,\"seats\":[{\"w\":0,\"m\":0,\"ep\":0,\"seat\":0,\"turn\":0,\"obs\":{…}},…],\"scores\":[…],\"ended\":[]}\n→ {\"op\":\"step\",\"actions\":[\"NNE-\",\"-W\",…]}\n← {\"ok\":true,\"turn\":1,\"seats\":[…],\"scores\":[…],\"ended\":[{\"w\":0,\"m\":3,\"ep\":3,\"turns\":…,\"ranks\":[1,2],\"reason\":\"lone_survivor\",\"map\":\"basic-tiny-2p\",…}]}\n→ {\"op\":\"close\"}\n```"
msgstr "```jsonc\n← {\"ok\":true,\"hello\":{\"game\":\"ants\",\"engine_digest\":\"sha256:…\",\"evaluator\":\"datalogic …\",\"maps\":[{\"id\":\"basic-tiny-2p\",\"players\":2,\"rows\":24,\"cols\":24},…],\"waves\":4,\"matches_per_wave\":16,…}}\n→ {\"op\":\"observe\"}\n← {\"ok\":true,\"turn\":0,\"seats\":[{\"w\":0,\"m\":0,\"ep\":0,\"seat\":0,\"turn\":0,\"obs\":{…}},…],\"scores\":[…],\"ended\":[]}\n→ {\"op\":\"step\",\"actions\":[\"NNE-\",\"-W\",…]}\n← {\"ok\":true,\"turn\":1,\"seats\":[…],\"scores\":[…],\"ended\":[{\"w\":0,\"m\":3,\"ep\":3,\"turns\":…,\"ranks\":[1,2],\"reason\":\"lone_survivor\",\"map\":\"basic-tiny-2p\",…}]}\n→ {\"op\":\"close\"}\n```"

#: src/models/testing.md:236
msgid "It runs a pool of waves so a batch of matches advances together, and refills a wave once every match in it has ended. `--waves`, `--matches-per-wave`, `--max-turns`, `--seed` and `--scores` (`every` turn, or at the `end`) set the pool. Every error is fatal: `env` writes one `{\"ok\": false, \"error\": …}` line and exits. A loop that has lost the seat order has no correct way to carry on, and a failure that looked recoverable would let your run train on misaligned actions with no sign of it. Record the `hello` line's digest in your model card: you cannot reproduce an entry that cannot name the engine it trained against."
msgstr "它运行一个由多个波次组成的池，让一批对局一起推进，并在某个波次中的所有对局都结束后重新填满它。`--waves`、`--matches-per-wave`、`--max-turns`、`--seed` 和 `--scores`（`every` 回合都给分数，或只在 `end` 时给）设置这个池。每个错误都是致命的：`env` 写出一行 `{\"ok\": false, \"error\": …}` 然后退出。丢失了席位顺序的循环没有任何正确的继续方式，而一个看似可恢复的失败会让你的训练在错位的动作上继续，且没有任何迹象。把 `hello` 那一行的摘要记进你的模型卡：说不出训练时所用引擎的参赛模型，是无法复现的。"

#: src/models/testing.md:244
msgid "**You choose the pool of boards here**, since training plays no ranked match: `--maps` takes ids (`--maps basic-tiny-2p,basic-small-3p`) or paths, or a directory of board files, a season's included, and defaults to the basic boards. Each wave plays one board, so a wave's observations share one size and stack into one tensor. The next wave takes the next board in turn, and a finished match reports the `map` it ran on."
msgstr "**在这里由你选择地图池**，因为训练不打排名对局：`--maps` 接受 id（`--maps basic-tiny-2p,basic-small-3p`）或路径，或者一个装有地图文件的目录（赛季的地图也可以），默认是基础地图。每个波次只用一张地图，所以一个波次的观测大小相同，可以堆叠成一个张量。下一个波次轮到下一张地图，结束的对局会报告它所用的 `map`。"

#: src/models/testing.md:250
msgid "**`env` is not the referee.** It has no turn deadline, no strike ceiling and no adapter evaluation: it steps the world and nothing else. Do not read its outcomes as results; `tinybrains check` and a played match are the gates."
msgstr "**`env` 不是裁判**。它没有回合时限、没有判罚上限、也不对适配器求值：它只推进世界，别的什么都不做。不要把它的结果当作成绩；`tinybrains check` 和一场真正打完的对局才是把关的关卡。"

#: src/models/testing.md:254
msgid "Get the boards"
msgstr "获取地图"

#: src/models/testing.md:257
msgid "# the basic boards, their sizes and seats, and the limits a season's must fit\n"
msgstr "# 基础地图、它们的大小和席位数，以及赛季地图必须满足的限制\n"

#: src/models/testing.md:258
msgid "# write them out, byte-for-byte as the release ships them\n"
msgstr "# 把它们写出来，与发布版本中的字节完全一致\n"

#: src/models/testing.md:259
msgid "# would this board be accepted by a season's upload?\n"
msgstr "# 这张地图能通过赛季的上传检查吗？\n"

#: src/models/testing.md:262
msgid "The release does not carry a season's own boards. Each is public from the moment an admin uploads it: `GET /v1/games/ants/seasons/{slug}/maps?boards=true` returns every one, and `tinybrains` plays each as a board file from a path. `maps check` runs the checks an upload runs (the header, the game's limits and the engine's own validation), so you can check a board your trainer generated against what a season could play. It also checks the name rule a season's board is uploaded under: the id is `size-terrain-Np-Hh`, `N` equals the file's `players`, and `H` × players equals the length of its `hills`. A failure prints the code Soma refuses with (`map_name_pattern`, `map_name_players` or `map_name_hills`). A `basic-*` board only gets a warning, since those ship in the release and are never uploaded under that name."
msgstr "发布版本不包含赛季自己的地图。每张地图从管理员上传那一刻起就是公开的：`GET /v1/games/ants/seasons/{slug}/maps?boards=true` 返回全部地图，`tinybrains` 可以把每一张当作路径指向的地图文件来打。`maps check` 运行上传时的那些检查（文件头、游戏的限制和引擎自己的校验），所以你可以检查训练器生成的地图是否符合赛季可用的条件。它还检查赛季地图上传时的命名规则：id 为 `size-terrain-Np-Hh`，`N` 等于文件的 `players`，`H` × 玩家数等于其 `hills` 的长度。失败时会打印 Soma 拒绝所用的代码（`map_name_pattern`、`map_name_players` 或 `map_name_hills`）。`basic-*` 地图只会得到一个警告，因为它们随发布版本提供，从不以那种名字上传。"

#: src/models/testing.md:272
msgid "Prove a replay reproduces"
msgstr "验证回放可复现"

#: src/models/testing.md:278
msgid "`conform` rebuilds a match from its replay envelope alone, plays it on your machine, and compares the board, the seed, the ending, the ranks, the scores and every turn's actions with the recording, stopping at the first turn that differs. It needs each seat's model in the local store, and it refuses a replay played on another engine. The platform runs it to keep its own local runner and its match workflow in agreement on the same seeds. Run it on a replay of your own entry too: a difference means the two engines disagree, and that is a bug to report."
msgstr "`conform` 仅凭回放的封包信息重建一场对局，在你的机器上重打一遍，并把地图、种子、结束方式、名次、得分和每回合的动作与录像比较，在第一个不同的回合停下。它需要每个席位的模型都在本地存储中，并且拒绝在另一个引擎上打的回放。平台自己也运行它，以确保本地运行器和对局工作流在相同种子下结果一致。也拿你自己参赛模型的回放跑一次：出现差异就意味着两个引擎不一致，这是一个应该报告的 bug。"

#: src/models/testing.md:285
msgid "What you cannot check here"
msgstr "本地无法检查的事"

#: src/models/testing.md:287
msgid "Why"
msgstr "原因"

#: src/models/testing.md:289
msgid "Your weight class"
msgstr "你的重量级"

#: src/models/testing.md:289
msgid "Admission decides it against **your season's** table, which your machine does not have. `check` prints the metric; the season turns it into a class"
msgstr "审核是对照**你所在赛季**的表来判定的，而你的机器上没有这张表。`check` 打印的是指标；赛季才把它变成重量级"

#: src/models/testing.md:290
msgid "Whether your files are where the platform expects"
msgstr "你的文件是否在平台期望的位置"

#: src/models/testing.md:290
msgid "The platform reads them from the bucket you upload to, and never from your disk"
msgstr "平台从你上传到的存储桶读取它们，从不读你的磁盘"

#: src/models/testing.md:291
msgid "Whether a late-game turn fits the budget"
msgstr "对局后期的回合是否在预算之内"

#: src/models/testing.md:291
msgid "The reference set is three turns of each basic board. A crowded board can cost more than any of them"
msgstr "参考集只是每张基础地图的三个回合。拥挤的地图可能比其中任何一个都费"

#: src/models/testing.md:292
msgid "How your entry rates"
msgstr "你的参赛模型评分如何"

#: src/models/testing.md:292
msgid "Only the ladder measures that, over many matches against many opponents"
msgstr "只有天梯能测出来，要靠对阵众多对手的许多场对局"

#: src/models/testing.md:293
msgid "Whether your head is a shape the referee can read"
msgstr "你的策略头是否是裁判能读取的形状"

#: src/models/testing.md:293
msgid "Covered: `check` decodes it, and only `check` does. `env` evaluates no manifest"
msgstr "已覆盖：`check` 会解码它，但也只有 `check` 会。`env` 不对清单求值"

#: src/models/testing.md:295
msgid "Check the actions too"
msgstr "也要检查动作"

#: src/models/testing.md:297
msgid "`check` confirms that your head decodes to a valid action on every reference observation. It cannot tell you whether the action is any _good_: the platform reads your head with a fixed channel order, so a graph trained against a rotated order produces valid moves in the wrong directions and passes everything. Play a match and count the moves. A model whose hold channel wins everywhere plays valid actions and never moves:"
msgstr "`check` 确认你的策略头在每个参考观测上都能解码成有效动作。它说不了这个动作<em>好不好</em>：平台按固定的通道顺序读取你的策略头，所以按错位顺序训练的计算图会朝错误的方向给出有效走法，并通过所有检查。打一场对局，数一数走法。原地不动通道处处胜出的模型，动作全部有效，却从不移动："

#: src/models/testing.md:304
msgid "\"import json,collections; d=json.load(open('replays/self-play.json')); \\\n  [print('seat', i, collections.Counter(c for t in d['deltas'] for c in t['a'][i])) \\\n   for i in range(len(d['deltas'][0]['a']))]\""
msgstr "\"import json,collections; d=json.load(open('replays/self-play.json')); \\\n  [print('seat', i, collections.Counter(c for t in d['deltas'] for c in t['a'][i])) \\\n   for i in range(len(d['deltas'][0]['a']))]\""

#: src/models/testing.md:309
msgid "Count it **per seat**. A total across seats lets one seat's moves hide the other's, and a colony that never moved passes for part of a busy match."
msgstr "**按席位分别**统计。把各席位合计会让一个席位的走法掩盖另一个席位的，从未移动过的蚁群会被当成一场激烈对局的一部分蒙混过去。"

#: src/models/testing.md:314
msgid "Seat 1 answered all six turns and moved nothing. Its ant stands on the square it started on, and the food beside its hill went into a hive it cannot spend, because that ant occupies the only square a new ant of its can appear on. Seat 0, on the same board under the same rules, gathered twice, spawned twice and has three ants walking east along its row. On this replay the count above gives seat 0 eleven easts, one west and its holds, and seat 1 six holds and nothing else."
msgstr "1 号席位六个回合都有应答，却一步未动。它的蚂蚁站在出生的那一格上，蚁丘旁的食物进了它无法消耗的蚁巢，因为那只蚂蚁占着它的新蚂蚁唯一能出现的格子。同一张地图、同样规则下的 0 号席位采集了两次、出生了两次，有三只蚂蚁沿着它那一行向东走。在这份回放上，上面的统计给出 0 号席位十一次向东、一次向西和若干次原地不动，1 号席位则是六次原地不动，别无其他。"

#: src/models/testing.md:327
msgid "Before submitting"
msgstr "提交之前"

#: src/models/testing.md:329
msgid "Confirm your shapes on every basic board, every adapter's budget on the largest, the channel order, the size metric and the turn timing. **Hash the final files after every edit**: reformatting a manifest changes its hash and its size, and admission checks the upload against the hash you declare. Keep both hashes with your training notes, so you can trace any result to the version that produced it."
msgstr "确认你的形状在每张基础地图上都成立、每个适配器的预算在最大地图上够用，并确认通道顺序、大小指标和回合用时。此外，还要**每次编辑后都重新计算最终文件的哈希**：重新格式化清单会改变它的哈希和大小，而审核会按你声明的哈希核对上传的文件。把两个哈希和训练笔记放在一起，这样任何结果都能追溯到产生它的版本。"

#: src/competing/models.md:3
msgid "A **model** is a lineage: a name you chose, and every version you have entered under it. A **version** is one submission: two files and their two hashes."
msgstr "**模型**是一条版本线：一个由你起的名字，以及你在这个名字下提交的每一个版本。而**版本**是一次提交：两个文件及其两个哈希。"

#: src/competing/models.md:6
msgid "Versions of one model replace one another. A new one that passes its trial supersedes the previous one, inherits its rating, and takes its place on the ladder. Different models never replace each other: they are separate entries with separate ratings, they can sit on the same ladder at the same time, and one of yours beating another of yours is an ordinary result."
msgstr "同一个模型的各个版本相互替换：新版本通过试赛后会取代上一个版本，继承它的评分，并接替它在天梯上的位置。不同的模型之间从不相互替换：它们是各自独立的参赛模型，各有各的评分，可以同时出现在同一个天梯上，你的一个模型击败你的另一个模型也只是一场普通的结果。"

#: src/competing/models.md:12
msgid "A season may limit how many of your models enter it."
msgstr "一个赛季可以限制你有多少个模型参加它。"

#: src/competing/models.md:14
msgid "The name is the key, and it is yours"
msgstr "名字是键，归你所有"

#: src/competing/models.md:16
msgid "Your model's name identifies it, and must be unique among _your own_ entries for a game. The site addresses its page by id:"
msgstr "模型的名字用来标识它，在同一个游戏里，它在<em>你自己的</em>参赛模型中必须唯一。网站用 id 来定位它的页面："

#: src/competing/models.md:24
msgid "**Two competitors may hold the same name.** The platform decides nothing on a name. Your account is your identity: signing in with any of the site's sign-in providers establishes it, and that is the only thing a provider does here."
msgstr "**两位参赛者可以使用同一个名字**。平台不会根据名字做任何判断。你的账户才是你的身份：用网站支持的任何一种登录方式登录即可确立它，而登录服务商在这里只做这一件事。"

#: src/competing/models.md:27
msgid "**You can edit the name at any time.** The name is a label and the id is the address, so a rename breaks no link and moves no rating."
msgstr "**你可以随时修改名字**。名字只是标签，id 才是地址，所以改名不会让任何链接失效，也不会改动任何评分。"

#: src/competing/models.md:29
msgid "**No repository is involved.** A model is tied to no GitHub repository: every ceiling on a competitor is a season rule, none of them mentions one, and creating a model never waits on GitHub."
msgstr "**不涉及任何仓库**。模型不与任何 GitHub 仓库绑定：对参赛者的每一项上限都是赛季规则，其中没有一条提到仓库，创建模型也从不需要等待 GitHub。"

#: src/competing/models.md:33
msgid "Creating one"
msgstr "创建模型"

#: src/competing/models.md:36
msgid "'/v1/games/ants/models'"
msgstr "'/v1/games/ants/models'"

#: src/competing/models.md:37 src/competing/submitting.md:59 src/competing/seasons.md:187
msgid "'POST'"
msgstr "'POST'"

#: src/competing/models.md:38 src/competing/submitting.md:60 src/competing/seasons.md:188
msgid "'same-origin'"
msgstr "'same-origin'"

#: src/competing/models.md:39 src/competing/submitting.md:61 src/competing/seasons.md:189
msgid "'Content-Type'"
msgstr "'Content-Type'"

#: src/competing/models.md:39 src/competing/submitting.md:61 src/competing/seasons.md:189
msgid "'application/json'"
msgstr "'application/json'"

#: src/competing/models.md:40
msgid "'Nano probe'"
msgstr "'Nano probe'"

#: src/competing/models.md:44
msgid "The platform refuses a name you already hold in this game with `model_name_taken`, whatever its case; a name another competitor holds does not matter."
msgstr "如果这个名字你在这个游戏里已经用过，平台会以 `model_name_taken` 拒绝，大小写不同也算重名；别的参赛者用了这个名字则无妨。"

#: src/competing/models.md:47
msgid "**Nothing on this path reaches GitHub**, so creating a model works even while GitHub is down."
msgstr "**这条路径上没有任何环节会访问 GitHub**，所以即使 GitHub 宕机，创建模型也照常可用。"

#: src/competing/models.md:50
msgid "**Creating a model enters nothing.** It starts no clock, costs no attempt, and puts nothing on a ladder; [submitting a version](submitting.md) does that."
msgstr "**创建模型并不等于参赛**。它不启动任何计时，不消耗任何尝试次数，也不会把任何东西放上天梯；[提交版本](submitting.md)才会。"

#: src/competing/models.md:53
msgid "Version numbers restart per model"
msgstr "版本号按模型各自计数"

#: src/competing/models.md:55
msgid "Your second model's first version is v1. Numbering across models would start a new lineage at v4 because of an unrelated earlier model, and no page could explain that number."
msgstr "你的第二个模型的第一个版本是 v1。如果跨模型连续编号，一条新版本线会因为一个不相干的旧模型而从 v4 开始，没有哪个页面能解释这个数字。"

#: src/competing/models.md:59
msgid "The platform assigns the number, one past this model's highest; you do not choose it."
msgstr "版本号由平台分配，是这个模型当前最大版本号加一；你无法自行选择。"

#: src/competing/models.md:62
msgid "Retiring one"
msgstr "退役模型"

#: src/competing/models.md:64
msgid "A retired model takes no new versions and frees its slot against a season's limit on how many models one competitor may enter. Retiring withdraws nothing: every version keeps its rating, its rank and its place in every match it played, since a standing records what happened. You can reverse a retirement, and it does not restart the version series."
msgstr "已退役的模型不再接受新版本，并在赛季对每位参赛者可参赛模型数的限制中让出名额。退役不会撤回任何东西：每个版本都保留它的评分、名次，以及它在每一场打过的对局中的位置，因为排名记录的是已经发生的事。退役可以恢复，恢复后版本号也不会重新计数。"

#: src/competing/models.md:70
msgid "What is per model, and what is per competitor"
msgstr "哪些按模型计，哪些按参赛者计"

#: src/competing/models.md:72 src/reference/api.md:274
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: src/competing/models.md:74
msgid "Version numbers"
msgstr "版本号"

#: src/competing/models.md:74 src/competing/models.md:77
msgid "per model"
msgstr "按模型"

#: src/competing/models.md:75
msgid "One version in admission at a time"
msgstr "同一时间只有一个版本在审核中"

#: src/competing/models.md:75
msgid "per model, per season"
msgstr "按模型、按赛季"

#: src/competing/models.md:76
msgid "Duplicate weights refused"
msgstr "拒绝重复的权重"

#: src/competing/models.md:76
msgid "against other competitors' models in the game or the season, or against every other model, and the season's to set"
msgstr "与游戏或赛季中其他参赛者的模型比对，或与所有其他模型比对，由赛季设定"

#: src/competing/models.md:77
msgid "One active version per season"
msgstr "每个赛季一个参赛中的版本"

#: src/competing/models.md:78
msgid "How many models you may enter"
msgstr "你可以参赛的模型数"

#: src/competing/models.md:78 src/competing/models.md:79
msgid "per competitor, and the season's to set"
msgstr "按参赛者，由赛季设定"

#: src/competing/models.md:79
msgid "How many versions may be in admission at once"
msgstr "同时在审核中的版本数"

#: src/competing/models.md:80
msgid "How many versions you may enter in a season"
msgstr "一个赛季内你可以提交的版本数"

#: src/competing/models.md:80
msgid "per model or per competitor, and the season's to set"
msgstr "按模型或按参赛者，由赛季设定"

#: src/competing/models.md:81
msgid "How often you may submit"
msgstr "提交的频率"

#: src/competing/models.md:81
msgid "per model, and the season's to set"
msgstr "按模型，由赛季设定"

#: src/competing/models.md:83
msgid "The five rows the season sets are season rules, and all are absent by default. A season's own page shows the ones it sets. `GET /v1/games/{game}/submission` reports your standing against the model limit, the admission limit, the version caps and the submission interval before you make a request. The submission itself answers the duplicate-weights rule, since it needs your weights' hash. A season may also declare how many of your models may sit in one weight class, and the platform does not enforce that one yet."
msgstr "由赛季设定的那五行是赛季规则，默认都不设。赛季自己的页面会显示它设定了哪些。在你发出请求之前，`GET /v1/games/{game}/submission` 会报告你相对模型数限制、审核中版本数限制、版本数上限和提交间隔的状态。重复权重规则由提交本身来回答，因为它需要你的权重哈希。赛季还可以声明你在同一个重量级里最多可以有几个模型，不过平台目前还没有强制执行这一条。"

#: src/competing/models.md:90
msgid "More"
msgstr "延伸阅读"

#: src/competing/models.md:92
msgid "[Submitting a version](submitting.md): putting a version under a model"
msgstr "[提交版本](submitting.md)：在模型下放入一个版本"

#: src/competing/models.md:93
msgid "[The life of a version](version-life.md): what happens to it after that"
msgstr "[版本的生命周期](version-life.md)：之后它会经历什么"

#: src/competing/models.md:94
msgid "[Seasons](seasons.md): the rules a season may declare"
msgstr "[赛季](seasons.md)：赛季可以声明的规则"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:3
msgid "A submission declares the two files you are entering, by hash, and says which of your [models](models.md) it is a version of. The API records a new version and answers with **two one-shot upload URLs**. You `PUT` the files to them, then [admission](admission.md) and an unrated [trial](trial.md) decide whether the version becomes that model's active one."
msgstr "一次提交以哈希声明你要参赛的两个文件，并说明它是你的哪个[模型](models.md)的版本。API 会记录一个新版本，并返回**两个一次性的上传 URL**。你把文件 `PUT` 到这两个 URL，然后由[审核](admission.md)和一场不计分的[试赛](trial.md)决定这个版本是否成为该模型的参赛中版本。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:8
msgid "**The platform stores no bytes of its own and downloads nothing from you**, so you upload the files yourself, and no process on the platform needs a fetch allowlist."
msgstr "**平台自己不保存任何字节，也不从你那里下载任何东西**，所以文件由你自己上传，平台上也没有任何进程需要抓取允许列表。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:11
msgid "Create the model first. A submission never creates one: the platform refuses an unknown model with `unknown_model`, so a typo cannot start a second lineage with its own version numbers and its own rating."
msgstr "先创建模型。提交从不创建模型：平台会以 `unknown_model` 拒绝未知的模型，这样一个拼写错误就不会开出第二条版本线，带着它自己的版本号和评分。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:15
msgid "Prepare the two files"
msgstr "准备两个文件"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:17
msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:17
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:19
msgid "Self-contained ONNX model"
msgstr "自包含的 ONNX 模型"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:20
msgid "What your graph takes and returns, and one adapter per input"
msgstr "计算图的输入与输出，以及每个输入对应的一个适配器"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:22
msgid "**There is no release to cut and no repository to own. The audit trail is the artifact.** The platform holds your bytes under `models/<version_id>/model.onnx`, a key it generates from the version id. No one can retag that key, you cannot delete it, and every reader of that version resolves the same one."
msgstr "**不需要打任何发布版本，也不需要拥有任何仓库。模型文件本身就是审计记录**。平台把你的字节保存在 `models/<version_id>/model.onnx` 下，这个键由平台根据版本 id 生成。没有人能给这个键改标签，你也无法删除它，读取该版本的每一方解析到的都是同一个文件。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:27
msgid "The short way: the site's form"
msgstr "捷径：网站的表单"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:29
msgid "**Sign in and go to [`/submit`](/submit).** Pick the model, pick the two files, press the button. The form submits to the season the site is showing. With no model yet, it sends you to the New model form on your profile first. The page then:"
msgstr "**登录后打开 [`/submit`](/submit)**。选择模型，选择两个文件，按下按钮。表单会提交到网站当前显示的赛季。如果你还没有模型，它会先把你带到个人主页上的“新建模型”表单。然后页面会："

#: src/competing/submitting.md:33
msgid "reads each file and computes its SHA-256 with the browser's own `crypto.subtle`;"
msgstr "读取每个文件，并用浏览器自带的 `crypto.subtle` 计算它的 SHA-256；"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:34
msgid "POSTs those two digests as the submission;"
msgstr "把这两个摘要作为提交 POST 出去；"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:35
msgid "`PUT`s both files from your browser to the object store. **Nothing passes through the site**, which holds no bytes of its own."
msgstr "从你的浏览器把两个文件 `PUT` 到对象存储。这一步**没有任何东西经过网站**，网站自己不保存任何字节。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:38
msgid "**The digest and the bytes come from one read**, so they cannot disagree: the page hashes a buffer and uploads that same buffer. The page shows both digests as you pick the files, since they are the contract and a rejection would name them."
msgstr "**摘要和字节来自同一次读取**，所以两者不可能不一致：页面对一个缓冲区计算哈希，然后上传的就是同一个缓冲区。你选择文件时页面会显示两个摘要，因为它们就是契约，若被拒绝，原因中会指明它们。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:42
msgid "If a transfer fails (a blocked request, a proxy, a firewall), **the platform still records the version**, and the page hands you the two `curl` commands for the URLs it was using."
msgstr "如果传输失败（请求被拦截、代理、防火墙），那么**平台仍然会记录这个版本**，页面会把它正在使用的两个 URL 对应的 `curl` 命令交给你。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:45
msgid "The long way: the API"
msgstr "完整做法：API"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:47
msgid "To script a submission, make the same calls yourself."
msgstr "要用脚本提交，就自己发出同样的调用。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:49
msgid "Compute the SHA-256 of each final file with `sha256sum model.onnx manifest.json` on Linux or `shasum -a 256 model.onnx manifest.json` on macOS, and prefix each digest with `sha256:` in the request. A whitespace change in JSON changes the hash too."
msgstr "对最终的两个文件分别计算 SHA-256：Linux 上用 `sha256sum model.onnx manifest.json`，macOS 上用 `shasum -a 256 model.onnx manifest.json`，并在请求中给每个摘要加上 `sha256:` 前缀。JSON 里改动一个空白字符也会改变哈希。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:53
msgid "The API authenticates with the HttpOnly `soma_session` browser cookie and has no standalone API tokens, so a script runs same-origin in the browser, and not from a shell. Replace the model id and both illustrative hashes:"
msgstr "API 通过 HttpOnly 的 `soma_session` 浏览器 Cookie 认证身份，没有独立的 API 令牌，所以脚本要在浏览器里同源运行，而不是在 shell 中。把模型 id 和两个示例哈希替换掉："

#: src/competing/submitting.md:58
msgid "'/v1/submissions'"
msgstr "'/v1/submissions'"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:63 src/competing/seasons.md:191
msgid "'ants'"
msgstr "'ants'"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:64
msgid "'summer-2026'"
msgstr "'summer-2026'"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:64
msgid "// the season's slug; left out, the featured season\n"
msgstr "// 赛季的 slug；省略则为精选赛季\n"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:65
msgid "'<the model_id the create call returned>'"
msgstr "'<创建调用返回的 model_id>'"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:66 src/competing/submitting.md:67
msgid "'sha256:<64 hexadecimal digits>'"
msgstr "'sha256:<64 个十六进制字符>'"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:68
msgid "'wider second layer'          // optional\n"
msgstr "'wider second layer'          // 可选\n"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:76
msgid "`model` is the `model_id` the create call returned, and `GET /v1/models` lists yours. `season` is the slug of the season you enter; without it the version enters the game's featured season, which is not always the one you mean while several seasons run. A `note` is yours to read back on the version's page, at most a short paragraph."
msgstr "`model` 是创建调用返回的 `model_id`，`GET /v1/models` 会列出你的所有模型。`season` 是你要参加的赛季的 slug；不填时版本会进入该游戏的精选赛季，而在多个赛季同时进行时，那不一定是你想要的那个。`note` 是留给你自己在版本页面上回看的备注，最多一小段。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:81
msgid "The hashes must be real 64-digit values; the placeholders are invalid on purpose. A successful response has status `201` and the fields `version_id`, `model_id`, `model`, `version`, `status`, `season`, `weights_hash`, `manifest_hash` and **`upload`**. Store the version ID to follow this version."
msgstr "哈希必须是真实的 64 位值；占位符是故意写成无效的。成功的响应状态为 `201`，带有字段 `version_id`、`model_id`、`model`、`version`、`status`、`season`、`weights_hash`、`manifest_hash` 和 **`upload`**。记下版本 ID，以便跟踪这个版本。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:86
msgid "Upload the two files"
msgstr "上传两个文件"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:88
msgid "The site's form does this step for you. The `201` carries:"
msgstr "网站的表单会替你完成这一步。`201` 响应中带有："

#: src/competing/submitting.md:91
msgid "\"upload\""
msgstr "\"upload\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:92
msgid "\"model_onnx\""
msgstr "\"model_onnx\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:92
msgid "\"https://…/models/<version_id>/model.onnx?X-Amz-…\""
msgstr "\"https://…/models/<version_id>/model.onnx?X-Amz-…\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:93
msgid "\"manifest_json\""
msgstr "\"manifest_json\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:93
msgid "\"https://…/models/<version_id>/manifest.json?X-Amz-…\""
msgstr "\"https://…/models/<version_id>/manifest.json?X-Amz-…\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:94
msgid "\"expires_in\""
msgstr "\"expires_in\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:94
msgid "\"30m\""
msgstr "\"30m\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:98
msgid "`PUT` each file to its URL with the file as the whole body, and no headers or credentials:"
msgstr "把每个文件 `PUT` 到它的 URL，以文件作为完整的请求体，不带任何请求头或凭据："

#: src/competing/submitting.md:101
msgid "\"$MODEL_URL\""
msgstr "\"$MODEL_URL\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:102
msgid "\"$MANIFEST_URL\""
msgstr "\"$MANIFEST_URL\""

#: src/competing/submitting.md:105
msgid "Your version has **thirty minutes from its first POST** for both files to land. POST the submission again with **the same two hashes** inside that window and the same version answers `200` with fresh URLs that expire when the window does, so a failed `PUT` costs you no version number. After the window, or with a _different_ hash while one is in flight, the platform answers `version_in_flight`."
msgstr "从第一次 POST 起，你的版本有**三十分钟**让两个文件落地。在这个窗口内用**相同的两个哈希**再次 POST 提交，同一个版本会以 `200` 响应并给出新的 URL，它们与窗口同时过期，所以一次失败的 `PUT` 不会浪费你的版本号。窗口过后，或者在一个版本处理中时用<em>不同的</em>哈希提交，平台会以 `version_in_flight` 响应。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:111
msgid "**Nothing happens until both files land.** Admission waits out the window for them. A version still missing a file when the window closes is rejected with `ARTIFACT_MISSING` or `MANIFEST_MISSING`. A first-time entrant is most likely to make this mistake."
msgstr "**两个文件都落地之前，什么都不会发生**。审核会在窗口期内一直等它们。窗口关闭时仍缺少文件的版本会被以 `ARTIFACT_MISSING` 或 `MANIFEST_MISSING` 拒绝。初次参赛的人最容易犯这个错误。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:115
msgid "**The platform re-hashes what arrives.** Admission refuses a file whose SHA-256 differs from what you declared. The re-hash makes a signed upload URL safe to hand out, and the platform checks your declaration twice: the node against the graph's digest, and the database against the manifest's."
msgstr "**平台会对收到的文件重新计算哈希**。SHA-256 与你声明不符的文件会被审核拒绝。正是重新计算哈希让签名上传 URL 可以放心发放，而且平台会核对你的声明两次：节点核对计算图的摘要，数据库核对清单的摘要。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:119
msgid "**Version numbers restart per model, and the platform assigns them.** Your second model's first version is v1. A lineage whose history began at 4 because you had an earlier model would carry a number the Version screen could not explain."
msgstr "**版本号按模型各自计数，由平台分配**。你的第二个模型的第一个版本是 v1。如果一条版本线因为你之前有过另一个模型而从 4 开始，它的版本号就会让版本页面无法解释。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:123
msgid "Season and candidate restrictions"
msgstr "赛季与候选版本的限制"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:125
msgid "A version enters the season its submission names, or the featured one; a season that is not `open` refuses it with `season_not_open`. A restricted season admits only its participants, and a season's own administrators may not enter it ([Seasons](seasons.md#who-may-see-a-season-and-who-may-enter-it)). Each season declares its other restrictions itself ([Seasons](seasons.md) has the whole list), and the platform reports each limit on models, versions and cooldown before the request as well as after it, in the same words."
msgstr "版本进入其提交所指定的赛季，或者精选赛季；不处于 `open` 状态的赛季会以 `season_not_open` 拒绝它。受限赛季只接受它的参与者参赛，而赛季自己的管理员不能参加它（[赛季](seasons.md#who-may-see-a-season-and-who-may-enter-it)）。其他限制由各赛季自行声明（[赛季](seasons.md)列出了完整清单），模型数、版本数和提交间隔的每一项限制，平台在请求前和请求后都会用同样的措辞报告。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:132
msgid "**One `testing` or `verified` version per model per season may exist at a time.** A competitor with three models may have three versions in admission at once, and one model may have a version in admission in each of two seasons; a season can also cap how many of yours are in flight together. A model's active version does not block a replacement submission to it."
msgstr "**每个模型在每个赛季同一时间只能有一个 `testing` 或 `verified` 版本**。有三个模型的参赛者可以同时有三个版本在审核中，一个模型也可以在两个赛季各有一个版本在审核中；赛季还可以限制你同时处理中的版本总数。模型的参赛中版本不会阻止向它提交替换版本。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:137
msgid "`GET /v1/games/{game}/submission` reports your standing against every one of those rules before you make a request, in the same words the refusal would use. It reads the featured season, or the one `?season=<slug>` names."
msgstr "在你发出请求之前，`GET /v1/games/{game}/submission` 会报告你相对上述每一条规则的状态，措辞与拒绝时相同。它读取精选赛季，或 `?season=<slug>` 指定的那个赛季。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:141
msgid "Re-entering from an earlier season"
msgstr "从先前的赛季重新报名"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:143
msgid "An entry that stood in one season can enter another with the same files and no upload: `POST /v1/submissions/reenter` with `{game, model, season, from}`. The new version is `testing`, and admission and a trial judge it again under the new season's rules, classes, memory and engine. [Moving to a new season](seasons.md#moving-to-a-new-season) has the details."
msgstr "在某个赛季参过赛的条目可以用相同的文件进入另一个赛季，无需上传：`POST /v1/submissions/reenter`，带上 `{game, model, season, from}`。新版本为 `testing`，审核和试赛会按新赛季的规则、重量级、记忆和引擎重新判定它。详见[进入新赛季](seasons.md#moving-to-a-new-season)。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:148
msgid "What happens next"
msgstr "接下来会发生什么"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:150
msgid "Watch the version's page, or read `GET /v1/me/versions/{version_id}`, which is yours alone and never cached. The status starts at `testing`, with phase `queued` or `verifying`. Passing admission moves it to `verified` and `awaiting_trial`; passing the trial promotes it to `active`, and from then on the public `GET /v1/versions/{version_id}` shows it too (in a private season, only `GET /v1/private/versions/{version_id}` does)."
msgstr "关注版本的页面，或读取 `GET /v1/me/versions/{version_id}`，它只属于你，并且从不缓存。状态从 `testing` 开始，阶段为 `queued` 或 `verifying`。通过审核后变为 `verified` 和 `awaiting_trial`；通过试赛后晋级为 `active`，从那时起公开的 `GET /v1/versions/{version_id}` 也会显示它（在私有赛季中，只有 `GET /v1/private/versions/{version_id}` 会显示）。"

#: src/competing/submitting.md:156
msgid "A request error and a later rejection are separate things. Missing hashes return `400`; season or duplicate/candidate conflicts return `409`; an invalid session returns `401`. Fix the request before retrying. If the request succeeded and a later check fails, read `reject_reason` and the [rejection reference](../reference/rejection-reasons.md). Verification is asynchronous, so wait for it; submitting again will not hurry it."
msgstr "请求错误和之后的拒绝是两回事。缺少哈希返回 `400`；赛季冲突或重复/候选版本冲突返回 `409`；会话无效返回 `401`。先修正请求再重试。如果请求成功而之后的检查失败，请读取 `reject_reason` 和[拒绝原因参考](../reference/rejection-reasons.md)。审核是异步的，请耐心等待；再次提交并不会让它更快。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:3
msgid "Admission checks whether the arena can use the model and manifest you uploaded. It starts once a submission has created a `testing` version **and both files are in the bucket**. It does not judge whether your strategy is strong enough to win."
msgstr "审核检查的是竞技场能否使用你上传的模型和清单。它在提交创建了 `testing` 版本**且两个文件都已进入存储桶**后开始。它不评判你的策略是否强到足以获胜。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:7
msgid "What is checked"
msgstr "检查什么"

#: src/competing/admission.md:9
msgid "The platform runs these stages in order:"
msgstr "平台按顺序执行以下阶段："

#: src/competing/admission.md:11
msgid "Confirm both objects are in the bucket at your version's keys. Admission waits for a missing one until the upload window closes, thirty minutes after your POST; after that the version gets `ARTIFACT_MISSING` or `MANIFEST_MISSING`, which means the [upload step](submitting.md#upload-the-two-files) did not happen."
msgstr "确认两个对象都已按你的版本的键存入存储桶。如果缺少一个，审核会一直等到上传窗口关闭，也就是你 POST 之后三十分钟；之后版本会得到 `ARTIFACT_MISSING` 或 `MANIFEST_MISSING`，这表示[上传步骤](submitting.md#upload-the-two-files)没有完成。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:15
msgid "Re-hash the manifest against `manifest_hash`. Its length is one of the two terms of your size metric."
msgstr "重新计算清单的哈希并与 `manifest_hash` 比对。清单的长度是你的大小指标的两项之一。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:17
msgid "Register the model on the node from your manifest and a reference to the artifact."
msgstr "根据你的清单和模型文件的引用，在节点上注册模型。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:18
msgid "Fetch the artifact through that reference, **re-hash it against the digest you declared**, read the graph from the protobuf (parameters, nodes, operators, IR version, opset), build a plan, and run five inferences on zero-filled inputs at your `probe_dims`. Their median must fit the game's turn, 1,000 ms for Ants."
msgstr "通过该引用获取模型文件并**重新计算哈希、与你声明的摘要比对**，从 protobuf 中读取计算图（参数、节点、算子、IR 版本、opset），构建执行计划，并以你的 `probe_dims` 在全零输入上运行五次推理。它们的中位数必须在游戏的回合时限之内，Ants 为 1,000 ms。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:22
msgid "Assign a size class from `artifact_bytes + len(manifest)` against **your season's** table, and apply its opset, operator and parameter policy."
msgstr "按**你所在赛季**的表，根据 `artifact_bytes + len(manifest)` 划定重量级，并应用该重量级的 opset、算子和参数策略。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:24
msgid "Run your manifest over the game's reference observations under the operation budget, and check that the head decodes to a valid action every time."
msgstr "在算子预算内，用你的清单处理游戏的参考观测，并检查策略头每次都能解码出有效动作。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:26
msgid "Record either `verified` or `rejected`."
msgstr "记录为 `verified` 或 `rejected`。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:28
msgid "No stage rejects a graph for being expensive. The turn deadline deals with cost during play, as a strike against the seat that missed it."
msgstr "没有任何阶段会因为计算图开销大而拒绝它。开销的问题由对局中的回合时限来处理：错过时限的席位会被判罚。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:31
msgid "Each adapter must produce a tensor of the dtype and shape your manifest declares, and the graph must accept it. Keep your own action checks: the platform confirms that your head _decodes_, and says nothing about whether it decodes to good moves."
msgstr "每个适配器都必须生成清单所声明的数据类型和形状的张量，而且计算图必须接受它。请保留你自己的动作检查：平台只确认你的策略头<em>能解码</em>，并不评判它解码出的是不是好的走法。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:35
msgid "Watching progress"
msgstr "查看进度"

#: src/competing/admission.md:37
msgid "`GET /v1/me/versions/{id}` returns `phase` and, during testing, `admit_attempt`. `queued` means verification has not started; `verifying` means the admit clock has taken it up, or a runner has claimed it, or its report is waiting to be judged. The public `GET /v1/versions/{id}` answers 404 until the version is on the ladder. The admission clock runs every 20 seconds and processes a bounded batch. The object fetch, the graph build, queueing and retries all add to the elapsed time, and nothing guarantees that a submission finishes in one clock period."
msgstr "`GET /v1/me/versions/{id}` 返回 `phase`，在审核期间还返回 `admit_attempt`。`queued` 表示审核尚未开始；`verifying` 表示审核时钟已经接手，或某个运行器已经认领了它，或它的报告正在等待判定。公开的 `GET /v1/versions/{id}` 在版本登上天梯之前都回答 404。审核时钟每 20 秒运行一次，每次处理有限的一批。获取对象、构建计算图、排队和重试都会增加耗时，没有什么能保证一次提交在一个时钟周期内完成。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:44
msgid "A version can also sit in `queued` because there is no admitting runner up for its season at all. That spends none of its attempts, so it is not held against the model — but it cannot wait for ever. [`/status`](/status) says how many machines could serve the queue, and a season's own page says it for that season."
msgstr "版本也可能因为它所在赛季根本没有审核运行器在线而停留在 `queued`。这不消耗它的尝试次数，所以不会算在模型头上——但它也不能无限期等下去。[`/status`](/status) 会说明有多少台机器可以处理这个队列，赛季自己的页面则会针对该赛季说明。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:49
msgid "A runner's admission claim lasts 600 seconds, and a version gets at most three attempts. Both are deployment values, separate from the match's turn deadline. Each reference inference allows 5,000 ms; an Ants turn allows 1,000 ms a seat."
msgstr "运行器的审核认领持续 600 秒，一个版本最多有三次尝试。这两个都是部署值，与对局的回合时限无关。每次参考推理允许 5,000 ms；Ants 的一个回合给每个席位 1,000 ms。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:53 src/reference/glossary.md:53
msgid "Verified"
msgstr "已通过审核"

#: src/competing/admission.md:55
msgid "`verified` means the checks passed and the version is waiting for its trial. It plays no regular rated matches yet. Once the platform queues a trial, the version response carries the latest `trial`: its match ID, status, board, queue time, and, while it is pending, its waiting seconds."
msgstr "`verified` 表示检查已通过，版本正在等待试赛。它还不参加常规的计分对局。平台安排好试赛后，版本响应中会带有最新的 `trial`：它的对局 ID、状态、地图、入队时间，以及在它待处理期间已等待的秒数。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:60
msgid "No timer expires a version that waits too long for its trial. If it stays `verified`, inspect its trial state: admission is over."
msgstr "等待试赛太久的版本不会被任何计时器作废。如果它一直停在 `verified`，请查看它的试赛状态：审核已经结束了。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:63
msgid "Rejected"
msgstr "已拒绝"

#: src/competing/admission.md:65
msgid "A fault in your submission (a hash mismatch, an unsupported operator, a shape the graph will not take, an adapter over budget, a missing upload) produces a rejection reason. Correct the files, check them on your machine, and submit them as the next version. [Rejection reasons](../reference/rejection-reasons.md) lists every reason."
msgstr "提交中的问题（哈希不匹配、不支持的算子、计算图不接受的形状、适配器超出预算、缺少上传）会产生一个拒绝原因。修正文件，在你自己的机器上检查，然后作为下一个版本提交。[拒绝原因](../reference/rejection-reasons.md)列出了所有原因。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:70
msgid "A rejection leaves that model's previous active version in place and your other models untouched. While you fix the candidate, keep using that version's matches to evaluate your next change."
msgstr "被拒绝不会影响该模型之前的参赛中版本，你的其他模型也不受影响。在你修正候选版本期间，继续用那个版本的对局来评估你的下一次改动。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:73
msgid "When the platform cannot complete the check"
msgstr "平台无法完成检查时"

#: src/competing/admission.md:75
msgid "A temporary storage or capacity failure sends the version back to the queue while it stays `testing`. A failure while it waited for a runner spends nothing; a failure on the runner that had claimed it (it could not fetch the artifact, reach its node or report in time) spends one of the three attempts. Such a failure says nothing about your model. If admission keeps failing to finish, the version ends `TIMED_OUT`. To ask the operator to investigate, report the version ID and the phase and reason you saw; do not change working weights to work around an unavailable service."
msgstr "临时的存储或容量故障会把版本送回队列，它仍保持 `testing`。在等待运行器期间发生的故障不消耗任何次数；在已认领它的运行器上发生的故障（无法获取模型文件、无法连接它的节点或未能及时报告）会消耗三次尝试中的一次。这类故障与你的模型无关。如果审核一直无法完成，版本最终会变为 `TIMED_OUT`。要请运营方调查，请报告版本 ID 以及你看到的阶段和原因；不要为了绕过暂时不可用的服务而改动本来正常的权重。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:82
msgid "**A slow probe is retried, and a slow probe on every attempt is yours.** The runner that measures the probe may be busy, so a median over the turn sends the version back to be tried again and spends an attempt. If the probe is over the turn on all three attempts, the version is rejected `PROBE_TOO_SLOW`, and its `infer_us` holds the last median. `tinybrains check` runs the same probe."
msgstr "**探测过慢会重试，而每次尝试都过慢就是你的问题了**。测量探测的运行器可能正忙，所以中位数超过回合时限时，版本会被送回重试，并消耗一次尝试。如果三次尝试探测都超过回合时限，版本会被以 `PROBE_TOO_SLOW` 拒绝，其 `infer_us` 保存最后一次的中位数。`tinybrains check` 运行的是同一个探测。"

#: src/competing/admission.md:87
msgid "**`ARTIFACT_MISSING` is not one of these.** An empty bucket belongs to your submission, and no retry can make bytes appear, so the platform rejects the version. Submit again for a new version and fresh URLs, and `PUT` both files."
msgstr "**`ARTIFACT_MISSING` 不属于这一类**。存储桶为空是你的提交的问题，重试再多次也不会凭空出现字节，所以平台会拒绝这个版本。请再次提交以获得新版本和新的 URL，然后 `PUT` 两个文件。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:3
msgid "A trial is one ordinary match a verified candidate plays before it becomes active. It has a match ID, a board, results, and a replay if the recording succeeds, and **it updates no ladder**, the opponent's included."
msgstr "试赛是通过审核的候选版本在成为参赛中版本之前打的一场普通对局。它有对局 ID、地图、结果，录制成功的话还有回放，而且**它不更新任何天梯**，对手的也不更新。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:7
msgid "Who you play"
msgstr "对手是谁"

#: src/competing/trial.md:9
msgid "The matchmaker seats the candidate against the platform baselines in play in the same season: the ones its administrators uploaded and switched on. It picks the board by trial-attempt order from the season's boards in play that those baselines can fill, in the order an admin added them. You choose neither the opponent nor the board. A trial on a board of `n` seats needs `n − 1` runnable baselines with different owners, so a season whose baselines have three owners trials candidates on boards of up to four seats. A season with no board in play, or no baseline in play, trials nobody: the candidate waits, `verified`, until there is one of each. Runners take trial work first when they claim queued games, and a trial still needs compatible capacity and those baseline assets."
msgstr "配对器让候选版本与同一赛季中启用的平台基线对战：也就是赛季管理员上传并开启的那些。它按试赛尝试的次序，从赛季中启用的、这些基线能坐满的地图里依次挑选地图，顺序即管理员添加它们的顺序。对手和地图都不由你选择。在 `n` 个席位的地图上试赛需要 `n − 1` 个可运行且所有者各不相同的基线，所以一个基线来自三位所有者的赛季，会在最多四个席位的地图上试赛候选版本。没有启用地图或没有启用基线的赛季不会试赛任何版本：候选版本以 `verified` 状态等待，直到两者都有。运行器认领排队中的对局时优先接下试赛，但试赛仍然需要兼容的容量和那些基线文件。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:20
msgid "A candidate has at most one live trial at a time. If a trial fails for a reason the platform does not attribute to the candidate, the platform can schedule a replacement."
msgstr "一个候选版本同一时间最多只有一场进行中的试赛。如果试赛失败的原因平台不归咎于候选版本，平台可以安排一场替代试赛。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:24
msgid "Why losing is fine"
msgstr "为什么输了也没关系"

#: src/competing/trial.md:26
msgid "A completed trial passes when the candidate's strike count is below the forfeit limit, whatever its finishing rank. A loss or draw with valid turn answers is enough; the ladder estimates playing strength after promotion."
msgstr "只要候选版本的判罚次数低于判负上限，完整打完的试赛就算通过，无论它最终名次如何。每回合都给出有效答复的输局或平局就足够了；晋级之后，天梯会估计它的实力。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:30
msgid "Five failed answers in total, unless the season sets another limit, forfeit the match and reject the candidate with `FORFEIT`, and the failures need not be consecutive. An ordinary match ending, such as a food stalemate, does not fail the trial."
msgstr "累计五次未能作答（除非赛季另设上限）就会判负并以 `FORFEIT` 拒绝候选版本，这些失败不必连续发生。普通的对局结束方式，比如食物僵局，不会让试赛失败。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:37
msgid "A trial checks that a version answers every turn with valid actions. This scripted match opens on its first board. Press the right arrow twice: both seats answer both turns, the two ants kill each other, and the match has an end reason. A trial needs nothing more."
msgstr "试赛检查的是版本每一回合都以有效动作作答。这场脚本对局从它的第一张地图开始。按两次右方向键：两个席位都答复了两个回合，两只蚂蚁互相击杀，对局便有了结束原因。试赛需要的仅此而已。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:47
msgid "When a trial fails"
msgstr "试赛失败时"

#: src/competing/trial.md:49
msgid "Outcome"
msgstr "结果"

#: src/competing/trial.md:49
msgid "Candidate consequence"
msgstr "对候选版本的后果"

#: src/competing/trial.md:51
msgid "Finished below the strike limit"
msgstr "打完，判罚次数低于上限"

#: src/competing/trial.md:51
msgid "Promote to active"
msgstr "晋级为参赛中"

#: src/competing/trial.md:52
msgid "Finished at the forfeit limit"
msgstr "判罚次数达到判负上限"

#: src/competing/trial.md:52
msgid "Reject with `FORFEIT`"
msgstr "以 `FORFEIT` 拒绝"

#: src/competing/trial.md:53
msgid "No runner could load your model in time (`MODEL_UNAVAILABLE`)"
msgstr "没有运行器能及时加载你的模型（`MODEL_UNAVAILABLE`）"

#: src/competing/trial.md:53
msgid "Attempt another trial, outside the repair limit"
msgstr "再试一场，不计入重试上限"

#: src/competing/trial.md:54
msgid "That happens as many times as the repair limit"
msgstr "这种情况发生的次数达到重试上限"

#: src/competing/trial.md:54
msgid "Reject with `RUNNER_UNAVAILABLE`"
msgstr "以 `RUNNER_UNAVAILABLE` 拒绝"

#: src/competing/trial.md:55
msgid "Cancelled or failed for another reason"
msgstr "因其他原因取消或失败"

#: src/competing/trial.md:55
msgid "Attempt another trial within the repair limit"
msgstr "在重试上限内再试一场"

#: src/competing/trial.md:56
msgid "Repeated unsuccessful trial attempts exhaust the limit"
msgstr "多次试赛未成功，用尽上限"

#: src/competing/trial.md:56
msgid "Reject with `UNPLAYABLE`"
msgstr "以 `UNPLAYABLE` 拒绝"

#: src/competing/trial.md:58
msgid "The repair limit is three trial rows. A trial for which no runner could load your model was never played, so it does not count toward them. The platform counts those apart, and running out of them is `RUNNER_UNAVAILABLE`, a failure of the platform's: submit the same files again. Other infrastructure failures can still use up the repair limit, and they say nothing about your strategy, so read the failure attribution before you change your model."
msgstr "重试上限是三条试赛记录。没有运行器能加载你的模型的试赛从未真正打过，所以不计入其中。平台把这类情况单独计数，用尽后就是 `RUNNER_UNAVAILABLE`，这是平台的故障：再次提交相同的文件即可。其他基础设施故障仍然会用掉重试上限，但它们与你的策略无关，所以在改动模型之前先看看失败归因。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:65
msgid "How long you wait"
msgstr "要等多久"

#: src/competing/trial.md:67
msgid "The version stays `verified` while its trial is queued and played. Read its `trial.status`: `pending` is queued, `claimed` means a runner has taken it, and `running` is in progress. `finished` can show for a moment before the verdict, because the platform counts results on a separate clock. A verified candidate keeps that model's one in-flight slot, and counts against any per-competitor limit the season sets."
msgstr "试赛排队和进行期间，版本保持 `verified`。读取它的 `trial.status`：`pending` 是排队中，`claimed` 表示运行器已接手，`running` 表示正在进行。裁定之前可能会短暂显示 `finished`，因为平台在另一个时钟上计算结果。通过审核的候选版本仍占着该模型的那一个处理中名额，也计入赛季设定的任何按参赛者计的限制。"

#: src/competing/trial.md:74
msgid "A trial can take many turns, and a busy or unavailable arena can add queue time. If the wait runs long, keep the candidate and trial IDs and ask the operator to check the queue and the compatible runners. Submitting again does not speed up a trial already queued."
msgstr "试赛可能要打很多回合，繁忙或不可用的竞技场还会增加排队时间。如果等得太久，记下候选版本和试赛的 ID，请运营方检查队列和兼容的运行器。再次提交不会加快已经排队的试赛。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:3
msgid "Each submission creates a model version with its own hashes, season, status, matches and ratings. A later upload makes a new version and leaves the admitted one as it is."
msgstr "每次提交都会创建一个模型版本，带有它自己的哈希、赛季、状态、对局和评分。之后的上传会创建新版本，已通过审核的版本保持原样。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:6
msgid "The five states"
msgstr "五种状态"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:8 src/competing/matches.md:41
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:8
msgid "API phase"
msgstr "API 阶段"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:10
msgid "`testing`"
msgstr "`testing`"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:10
msgid "Waiting for admission, or in it"
msgstr "等待审核，或正在审核中"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:10
msgid "`queued` or `verifying`"
msgstr "`queued` 或 `verifying`"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:11
msgid "`verified`"
msgstr "`verified`"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:11
msgid "Passed admission; waiting for a trial verdict"
msgstr "已通过审核；等待试赛结果"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:11
msgid "`awaiting_trial`"
msgstr "`awaiting_trial`"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:12
msgid "`active`"
msgstr "`active`"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:12
msgid "Plays rated matches in its season"
msgstr "在它的赛季中打计分对局"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:12
msgid "`on_the_ladder`"
msgstr "`on_the_ladder`"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:13
msgid "`superseded`"
msgstr "`superseded`"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:13
msgid "A successor passed its trial and replaced it"
msgstr "后继版本通过试赛并取代了它"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:14
msgid "`rejected`"
msgstr "`rejected`"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:14
msgid "Stopped, and the record names the reason"
msgstr "已终止，记录中写明原因"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:16
msgid "A version that passes goes `testing → verified → active`. Admission or the trial can move a candidate to `rejected`, and a later candidate that passes moves the earlier active version to `superseded`."
msgstr "通过的版本依次经历 `testing → verified → active`。审核或试赛都可能把候选版本变为 `rejected`，而后来通过的候选版本会把先前的参赛中版本变为 `superseded`。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:20
msgid "An `active` version can sit idle once its rating settles. In a closed season, the versions still `active` make up its final standings."
msgstr "`active` 版本的评分稳定后可能会闲置。在已结束的赛季中，仍为 `active` 的版本构成它的最终排名。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:23
msgid "Promotion"
msgstr "晋级"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:25
msgid "Your previous version stays `active` while the candidate goes through admission and its trial. A candidate that passes becomes `active` and supersedes the previous active version of **the same model** in the same season. If the platform rejects the candidate, the previous version stays in place."
msgstr "候选版本经历审核和试赛期间，你之前的版本保持 `active`。通过的候选版本成为 `active`，并取代**同一个模型**在同一赛季中之前的参赛中版本。如果平台拒绝了候选版本，之前的版本保持不变。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:30
msgid "Each model can have one candidate in `testing` or `verified` at a time in each season. A season can also cap how many candidates you have in flight across all your models. Only a trial pass replaces the previous version: submitting and passing admission leave it active."
msgstr "每个模型在每个赛季同一时间只能有一个处于 `testing` 或 `verified` 的候选版本。赛季还可以限制你所有模型加起来同时处理中的候选版本数。只有通过试赛才会替换之前的版本：提交和通过审核都不会改变它的参赛中状态。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:34
msgid "What the new version inherits"
msgstr "新版本继承什么"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:36
msgid "A successor starts from the predecessor's one Open rating mean with its uncertainty doubled, capped at the initial prior, and inherits that same rating whatever weight class it lands in. Its own matches then set its rating. [Ranking](ranking.md) has the numbers."
msgstr "后继版本从前一版本的那一个无差别级评分均值出发，不确定度翻倍（以初始先验为上限），而且无论落入哪个重量级，继承的都是这同一个评分。之后由它自己的对局来决定它的评分。[排名](ranking.md)给出了具体数字。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:40
msgid "A version inherits only within its season. To enter a later season you submit again, or [re-enter](seasons.md#moving-to-a-new-season) the entry with the same bytes, and the platform creates a new version for that field, which admission and a trial judge again."
msgstr "版本只在它的赛季之内继承。要参加之后的赛季，你需要再次提交，或者用相同的字节[重新报名](seasons.md#moving-to-a-new-season)该条目，平台会为那个赛季创建一个新版本，由审核和试赛重新判定。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:44
msgid "What happens to old matches"
msgstr "旧对局会怎样"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:46
msgid "The platform cancels the predecessor's queued matches, and names the successor on each one a replacement cancelled. A match a runner has already claimed or started finishes between the versions it paired and counts for them; the platform never moves it to the new version."
msgstr "平台会取消前一版本排队中的对局，并在每一场因替换而取消的对局上注明后继版本。运行器已经认领或开始的对局会在它配对的版本之间打完并计入它们；平台从不把它转移到新版本上。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:50
msgid "The predecessor's history stays available. To compare two training revisions, keep their match IDs apart: the version number and hashes tell you which version played."
msgstr "前一版本的历史仍然可以查看。要比较两次训练修订，请把它们的对局 ID 分开记：版本号和哈希会告诉你是哪个版本在打。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:53
msgid "Withdrawal and rejection"
msgstr "撤回与拒绝"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:55
msgid "The platform withdraws **queued matches** that no longer apply, for example after a promotion or an engine change. You cannot withdraw a version yourself: Soma's API has no withdrawal endpoint and no `withdrawn` status, and no DELETE call on a model removes it from the arena."
msgstr "平台会撤回不再适用的**排队中对局**，例如在晋级或引擎更换之后。你无法自行撤回版本：Soma 的 API 没有撤回接口，也没有 `withdrawn` 状态，对模型的任何 DELETE 调用都不会把它从竞技场移除。"

#: src/competing/version-life.md:59
msgid "A `rejected` version carries its reason, for example a model compatibility problem, a failed trial, or `SEASON_CLOSED` for a candidate still waiting when an administrator closed the season. Each needs a different fix, so read [rejection reasons](../reference/rejection-reasons.md) before you submit another version."
msgstr "`rejected` 版本带有它的原因，例如模型兼容性问题、试赛失败，或者管理员结束赛季时候选版本仍在等待而得到的 `SEASON_CLOSED`。每种原因需要不同的修正，所以在提交另一个版本之前先读一读[拒绝原因](../reference/rejection-reasons.md)。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:3
msgid "The arena schedules and runs matches for active versions on its own. You submit no moves over HTTP and keep no model server running: the platform runs your admitted model and adapter itself."
msgstr "竞技场自行为参赛中的版本安排并运行对局。你不需要通过 HTTP 提交走法，也不需要保持任何模型服务在线：平台自己运行你通过审核的模型和适配器。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:6
msgid "Who decides that you play"
msgstr "谁决定你上场"

#: src/competing/matches.md:8
msgid "The matchmaker picks every match. It favours versions whose ratings need more evidence, spreads play across the season's boards the pool can seat (starting with the board a version has played least), and chooses useful opponents and the seed. You never choose the board. Each seat in a match goes to a different competitor, baselines included, so an eight-seat board waits until eight competitors have versions in the pool. The matchmaker prefers comparable ratings, with some cross-class play to connect the Open ladder, and it can pick a settled version as another version's opponent."
msgstr "每一场对局都由配对器挑选。它优先照顾评分还需要更多证据的版本，把对局分散到赛季中参赛池能坐满的各张地图上（从某个版本打得最少的地图开始），并挑选有价值的对手和种子。地图从来不由你选择。一场对局中的每个席位都给不同的参赛者，基线也算在内，所以八席位的地图要等到八位参赛者在参赛池中都有版本才会开打。配对器偏好评分相近的对手，再加上一些跨重量级的对局来连通无差别级天梯，而且它可以挑一个已稳定的版本作为另一个版本的对手。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:15
msgid "A new version can have up to eight requested matches in flight during placement, and two in steady state. These caps control scheduling and guarantee no number of matches per hour. The matchmaker can also pick an opponent that is already playing other matches. A trial has one live match at a time."
msgstr "新版本在定级期间最多可以有八场已安排的对局同时处理中，稳定状态下为两场。这些上限只控制调度，并不保证每小时的对局数量。配对器也可以挑选一个正在打其他对局的对手。试赛同一时间只有一场进行中的对局。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:19
msgid "In a season played in [rounds](ranking.md#rounds-and-score-resets), every active version gets the round's number of rated matches, up to eight in flight at a time. The matchmaker serves the version with the fewest matches in the round first, and prefers opponents that still have matches to play, so an old version is not drawn as everyone's opponent. In the [finals](ranking.md#finals) the number is exact: no entry is seated past it."
msgstr "在按[轮次](ranking.md#rounds-and-score-resets)进行的赛季中，每个参赛中的版本都会得到该轮规定数量的计分对局，同时处理中的最多八场。配对器优先安排本轮对局最少的版本，并偏好还有对局要打的对手，这样旧版本不会被抽成所有人的对手。在[决赛](ranking.md#finals)中这个数量是精确的：没有哪个条目会被安排超出这个数量的对局。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:25
msgid "When the runners have lanes that nothing else needs, a season can use them to give every version more matches, least-played first, up to a number the administrators set. Idle-fill matches are ordinary rated matches. They wait behind no one: the platform only queues them into lanes that are free."
msgstr "当运行器有闲置的通道时，赛季可以用它们给每个版本增加对局，打得最少的优先，上限由管理员设定。空闲补赛是普通的计分对局。它们不用排在任何人后面：平台只把它们排进空闲的通道。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:30
msgid "No match seats two of your own models unless the season permits it, because a match between two of yours would move rating between them for free. A season can also cap how much of the queue one competitor's models hold at once, so a large portfolio cannot crowd out a small one."
msgstr "除非赛季允许，否则没有对局会让你自己的两个模型同场，因为你的两个模型之间的对局会无代价地在它们之间转移评分。赛季还可以限制一位参赛者的模型同时占据队列的比例，这样拥有大量模型的人不会挤掉只有少数模型的人。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:34
msgid "Baselines are entries the platform provides, marked with a baseline tag. The platform pairs, rates and ranks them like any other entry, and they settle the same way. Baselines also play every candidate's [trial](trial.md), which no other entry does. Admission has no \"beat the baseline\" requirement."
msgstr "基线是平台提供的参赛模型，带有基线标记。平台像对待其他参赛模型一样为它们配对、评分和排名，它们也以同样的方式稳定下来。基线还会参加每个候选版本的[试赛](trial.md)，这是其他参赛模型不做的。审核没有“打败基线”的要求。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:39
msgid "Match states"
msgstr "对局状态"

#: src/competing/matches.md:43
msgid "`pending`"
msgstr "`pending`"

#: src/competing/matches.md:43
msgid "Queued; no runner owns it yet"
msgstr "排队中；还没有运行器接手"

#: src/competing/matches.md:44
msgid "`claimed`"
msgstr "`claimed`"

#: src/competing/matches.md:44
msgid "A runner owns it and is preparing the models and execution"
msgstr "运行器已接手，正在准备模型和执行环境"

#: src/competing/matches.md:45
msgid "`running`"
msgstr "`running`"

#: src/competing/matches.md:45
msgid "Playing turns"
msgstr "正在进行回合"

#: src/competing/matches.md:46
msgid "`finished`"
msgstr "`finished`"

#: src/competing/matches.md:46
msgid "Result recorded; waiting for counting or a trial verdict"
msgstr "结果已记录；等待计分或试赛裁定"

#: src/competing/matches.md:47
msgid "`rated`"
msgstr "`rated`"

#: src/competing/matches.md:47
msgid "Counted; a trial still changes no ratings"
msgstr "已计分；试赛仍不改变任何评分"

#: src/competing/matches.md:48
msgid "`cancelled`"
msgstr "`cancelled`"

#: src/competing/matches.md:48
msgid "Withdrawn from the queue before play"
msgstr "开打前从队列中撤回"

#: src/competing/matches.md:49
msgid "`failed`"
msgstr "`failed`"

#: src/competing/matches.md:49
msgid "The runner could not complete it"
msgstr "运行器未能完成它"

#: src/competing/matches.md:51
msgid "A finished match can appear before its rating change. Refresh its detail later: counting runs after the result lands."
msgstr "一场对局可能先显示为已结束，评分变化稍后才到。过一会儿再刷新它的详情：计分在结果落地之后进行。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:54
msgid "What a match record shows"
msgstr "对局记录显示什么"

#: src/competing/matches.md:56
msgid "`GET /v1/matches/{id}` returns the game, season (its slug), seed, map, status, reason, turn count, timing, the engine digest and the Orion version. Each seat has a model ID, owner, version, class, rank, score, strikes, outcome and its rating change once it exists. `is_trial` marks an unrated trial."
msgstr "`GET /v1/matches/{id}` 返回游戏、赛季（它的 slug）、种子、地图、状态、原因、回合数、时间信息、引擎摘要和 Orion 版本。每个席位都有模型 ID、所有者、版本、重量级、名次、得分、判罚次数、结果，以及评分变化（一旦有了的话）。`is_trial` 标记不计分的试赛。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:61
msgid "`GET /v1/matches?model={model_id}` is the public history: the model's finished and rated matches, and the trials of its versions that passed, since a passed trial is part of how a version reached the ladder. The public record of a ladder holds what was played, so this listing shows no queue. `?map=` narrows a season's listing to one of its boards, and the [API reference](../reference/api.md) lists the other filters."
msgstr "`GET /v1/matches?model={model_id}` 是公开历史：该模型已结束和已计分的对局，以及它通过了试赛的版本的试赛，因为通过的试赛是版本登上天梯过程的一部分。天梯的公开记录只保存已经打过的对局，所以这个列表不显示队列。`?map=` 把赛季的列表缩小到它的某一张地图，其他筛选条件见 [API 参考](../reference/api.md)。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:67
msgid "**For your own matches, read `GET /v1/me/matches`.** It shows what the public listing leaves out: your queued pairings, your cancellations with their `withdrawn_reason` and the version that replaced you, your failures with `fault_reason`, and every trial. Each seat carries `mine`, so you can read a match between two of your own models. It pages with a cursor."
msgstr "**你自己的对局要通过 `GET /v1/me/matches` 来读取**。它显示公开列表遗漏的内容：你排队中的配对、带有 `withdrawn_reason` 和替换你的版本的取消记录、带有 `fault_reason` 的失败记录，以及每一场试赛。每个席位都带有 `mine`，所以你能看懂你自己两个模型之间的对局。它用游标分页。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:72
msgid "Cancelled and failed matches"
msgstr "已取消与失败的对局"

#: src/competing/matches.md:74
msgid "The platform cancels a queued pairing that is no longer eligible. A cancellation counts as no loss and changes no rating, and `withdrawn_reason` says why:"
msgstr "平台会取消不再符合条件的排队中配对。取消不算输，也不改变评分，`withdrawn_reason` 说明原因："

#: src/competing/matches.md:77 src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:110
msgid "`SUPERSEDED`: a successor passed its trial and replaced a seat's version, and `successor` names the new version."
msgstr "`SUPERSEDED`：后继版本通过试赛并取代了某个席位的版本，`successor` 指明新版本。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:79 src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:112
msgid "`REJECTED`: the platform rejected a seat's version."
msgstr "`REJECTED`：平台拒绝了某个席位的版本。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:80 src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:113
msgid "`BASELINE_DISABLED`: an admin disabled a baseline that held a seat."
msgstr "`BASELINE_DISABLED`：管理员停用了占据某个席位的基线。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:81 src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:114
msgid "`MAP_DISABLED`: an admin disabled the match's board."
msgstr "`MAP_DISABLED`：管理员停用了这场对局的地图。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:82 src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:115
msgid "`ROUND_ENDED`: a new round, or the finals, started before the match was played."
msgstr "`ROUND_ENDED`：对局开打之前，新一轮或决赛已经开始。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:83 src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:116
msgid "`SEASON_CLOSED`: the season closed."
msgstr "`SEASON_CLOSED`：赛季已结束。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:84 src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:117
msgid "`ENGINE_RETIRED`: the season moved to another engine."
msgstr "`ENGINE_RETIRED`：赛季换到了另一个引擎。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:85 src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:118
msgid "`SEAT_LEFT`: a seat's version left play for any other reason."
msgstr "`SEAT_LEFT`：某个席位的版本因其他原因离场。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:87
msgid "The platform withdraws only **queued** matches: one already claimed or running finishes and counts for the versions it paired."
msgstr "平台只撤回**排队中**的对局：已经认领或正在进行的对局会打完，并计入它配对的版本。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:90
msgid "A failed match is one no runner could finish. The failure is the platform's and never a seat's: your model's own mistakes during play are strikes. Its `fault_reason` names one of two causes:"
msgstr "失败的对局是没有运行器能够打完的对局。失败属于平台，从不属于某个席位：你的模型在对局中自己犯的错是判罚。它的 `fault_reason` 指明两种原因之一："

#: src/competing/matches.md:93
msgid "`LEASE_LAPSED`: a runner's lease lapsed three times. Soma's reap clock returns a lapsed match to the queue, and fails it on the third lapse."
msgstr "`LEASE_LAPSED`：运行器的租约三次失效。Soma 的回收时钟会把租约失效的对局送回队列，第三次失效时将其判为失败。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:95
msgid "`MODEL_UNAVAILABLE`: runners released the match unplayed (the common cause is a seat's model not yet on their roster) until the refusals reached the season's ceiling and the match had waited out the grace period since pairing."
msgstr "`MODEL_UNAVAILABLE`：运行器一再未打就释放了这场对局（常见原因是某个席位的模型还没进入它们的名册），直到拒绝次数达到赛季的上限，而且对局自配对以来已经等过了宽限期。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:99
msgid "The platform never invents a game score for a terminal failure. A failed or cancelled match may have no replay."
msgstr "对于最终失败的对局，平台从不编造游戏得分。失败或已取消的对局可能没有回放。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:102
msgid "Reading your results"
msgstr "解读你的结果"

#: src/competing/matches.md:104
msgid "Compare the board, opponent, score, rank and strikes before you judge a model change. A high score with a last-place rank can mean a forfeit, so check the strikes before you suspect the scoring. A draw can be an ordinary hill-score tie. [Replays](replays.md) show the decisions behind each outcome."
msgstr "在评判一次模型改动之前，先比较地图、对手、得分、名次和判罚次数。得分很高却排在最后一名可能意味着判负，所以在怀疑计分之前先看看判罚。平局可能只是普通的蚁丘得分相同。[回放](replays.md)能展示每个结果背后的决策。"

#: src/competing/matches.md:110
msgid "A finished match, at its last turn: the end reason and each seat's score are the same values the match row carries."
msgstr "一场已结束的对局，停在最后一回合：结束原因和每个席位的得分与对局记录中的数值相同。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:3
msgid "A replay records a match, so you can investigate a result and compare how models behave. Look for the first decision that changed the position: an avoidable collision, blocked spawning, lost vision or an undefended hill."
msgstr "回放记录了一场对局，你可以借它查究一个结果，并比较各个模型的行为。找出第一个改变局面的决定：一次本可避免的碰撞、被堵住的出生点、丢失的视野，或一座无人防守的蚁丘。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:7
msgid "Getting a replay"
msgstr "获取回放"

#: src/competing/replays.md:9
msgid "Read `GET /v1/matches/{id}` and use its `replay_url` if it has one. The platform signs that URL for an hour of read access. If an old link expires, fetch the match detail again for a fresh one, and keep the match ID as your stable reference."
msgstr "读取 `GET /v1/matches/{id}`，如果响应里有 `replay_url`，就用它。平台为这个 URL 签发一小时的读取权限。旧链接过期后，重新获取一次对局详情就能拿到新的；请把对局 ID 作为你的稳定引用。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:13
msgid "A null `replay_url` is normal for a queued, cancelled or failed match that never produced a replay. A successful match's detail also gives the board, seed, engine digest, Orion version and each seat's result."
msgstr "排队中、已取消或失败的对局从未生成回放，其 `replay_url` 为 null 是正常的。成功对局的详情还会给出地图、种子、引擎摘要、Orion 版本和每个席位的结果。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:17
msgid "What is stored"
msgstr "存储的内容"

#: src/competing/replays.md:19
msgid "The envelope is JSON, and holds all you need to play the match again from nothing:"
msgstr "回放文件是 JSON，包含了从零开始重放这场对局所需的一切："

#: src/competing/replays.md:21 src/platform/repositories.md:22
msgid "What it is"
msgstr "含义"

#: src/competing/replays.md:23
msgid "`match_id`, `attempt_token`"
msgstr "`match_id`, `attempt_token`"

#: src/competing/replays.md:23
msgid "Which match, and which attempt at it"
msgstr "哪场对局，以及对它的哪一次尝试"

#: src/competing/replays.md:24
msgid "`seed`, `map_id`, `map`"
msgstr "`seed`, `map_id`, `map`"

#: src/competing/replays.md:24
msgid "The board. `map` carries its rows, columns, water, hills, food and symmetry, so a replay needs nothing beside it: neither the season nor the board's entry in its maps, which an admin may since have taken out of play"
msgstr "地图。`map` 带有它的行、列、水域、蚁丘、食物和对称性，所以回放不需要别的任何东西：既不需要赛季，也不需要这张地图在赛季地图列表中的条目，管理员此后可能已经把它停用了"

#: src/competing/replays.md:25
msgid "`engine_digest`, `orion_version`"
msgstr "`engine_digest`, `orion_version`"

#: src/competing/replays.md:25
msgid "The cartridge that played it, and the runtime that ran the models"
msgstr "运行这场对局的卡带，以及运行模型的运行时"

#: src/competing/replays.md:26
msgid "`max_turns`, `strike_ceiling`"
msgstr "`max_turns`, `strike_ceiling`"

#: src/competing/replays.md:26
msgid "The limits it was played under"
msgstr "这场对局所受的限制"

#: src/competing/replays.md:27
msgid "`deltas`"
msgstr "`deltas`"

#: src/competing/replays.md:27
msgid "The action stream: `t` is the turn, `a` a list of per-seat strings, each holding that seat's directions in its ant order with `-` for a hold, and `m` the match's index in the wave that played it, always 0 on the ladder"
msgstr "动作流：`t` 是回合，`a` 是每个席位一个字符串的列表，每个字符串按该席位的蚂蚁顺序记录各自的方向，`-` 表示原地不动，`m` 是这场对局在运行它的波次中的序号，在天梯上总是 0"

#: src/competing/replays.md:28
msgid "`engine_ranks`, `scores`, `reason`, `turns`"
msgstr "`engine_ranks`, `scores`, `reason`, `turns`"

#: src/competing/replays.md:28
msgid "How it ended"
msgstr "如何结束"

#: src/competing/replays.md:29
msgid "`seats`"
msgstr "`seats`"

#: src/competing/replays.md:29
msgid "Per seat: its `seat` and `model`, both hashes, `strike_ceiling`, `strikes`, `forfeited`, and the inference it spent (`infer_us_total`, `infer_us_max`, `infer_turns`)"
msgstr "每个席位一项：它的 `seat` 和 `model`（都是哈希）、`strike_ceiling`、`strikes`、`forfeited`，以及它花在推理上的时间（`infer_us_total`、`infer_us_max`、`infer_turns`）"

#: src/competing/replays.md:31
msgid "**Read the per-seat block first when a result disappoints you.** A seat with strikes missed turns; compare `infer_us_max` with the 1,000 ms deadline to see how close it came to missing more."
msgstr "**结果不如意时，先看席位块**。有判罚的席位错过了回合；把 `infer_us_max` 和 1,000 ms 的时限比一比，看看它离错过更多回合有多近。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:34
msgid "A replay `tinybrains` writes on your machine has the same board, deltas and result, and a smaller seat block: a `label` and the turns it inferred as `seat_turns`, no `attempt_token` and no strike ceiling, since nothing on your machine claims a match or forfeits a seat."
msgstr "`tinybrains` 在你机器上写出的回放有同样的地图、动作流和结果，席位块则更小：一个 `label` 和它推理过的回合数 `seat_turns`，没有 `attempt_token`，也没有判罚上限，因为你机器上没有任何东西会认领对局，也不会判某个席位负。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:38
msgid "The envelope stores actions. The matching engine rebuilds each position by replaying them, and the same actions give the same positions every time. Playback runs no model and chooses no new moves."
msgstr "回放文件存储的是动作。对应的引擎通过重放这些动作重建每个局面，同样的动作每次都得到同样的局面。回放时不运行任何模型，也不会选择新的走法。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:41
msgid "`engine_ranks` records the game's result before the platform applies forfeit ranking. The match record's seat ranks are the official competitive result; use the engine ranks to diagnose how the game went."
msgstr "`engine_ranks` 记录的是平台应用判负排名之前的游戏结果。对局记录中的席位名次才是正式的比赛结果；引擎名次用来诊断这局游戏是怎么打的。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:45
msgid "Watching a replay"
msgstr "观看回放"

#: src/competing/replays.md:47
msgid "You can watch a replay three ways, each driving the same cartridge that played the match:"
msgstr "观看回放有三种方式，每一种驱动的都是运行这场对局的同一个卡带："

#: src/competing/replays.md:49
msgid "**The site.** A match page plays it full screen. Start here."
msgstr "**网站**。对局页面会全屏播放回放。从这里开始。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:50
msgid "**`tinybrains view replays/<file>.json`** opens a downloaded envelope in your browser, the match graph under it, with no server involved."
msgstr "**`tinybrains view replays/<file>.json`** 在浏览器中打开一个下载好的回放文件，下方是对局图表，全程不涉及任何服务器。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:52
msgid "**`tinybrains conform replays/<file>.json`** checks the replay instead of drawing it: it rebuilds the match from the envelope alone, plays it on your machine, and compares the board, the seed, the engine, the ending and every turn's actions against the recording, stopping at the first turn that differs. Run it on a replay of your own entry. A difference means two engines disagree, and that is a bug to report."
msgstr "**`tinybrains conform replays/<file>.json`** 不绘制回放，而是检查它：仅凭回放文件重建对局，在你的机器上重放一遍，并把地图、种子、引擎、结束方式和每一回合的动作与录像逐一比对，在第一个不同的回合停下。拿你自己参赛模型的回放跑一跑。出现差异意味着两个引擎不一致，这是一个应该报告的 bug。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:58
msgid "The viewer **re-simulates from the action stream**, so the engine it runs matters. A viewer running a different engine from the one that played raises no error and draws a plausible match that never happened. The envelope names its `engine_digest` so you can compare the two."
msgstr "查看器**根据动作流重新模拟**，所以它运行的引擎很重要。查看器若运行的引擎与当初对局的不同，不会报任何错误，只会画出一场看似合理却从未发生过的对局。回放文件写明了自己的 `engine_digest`，你可以拿来比对两者。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:62
msgid "Each frame the engine hands the viewer says what its turn did as well as where everything stands: each ant's id, the ants that died on that turn with the enemies that killed them, and the hills that fell. The viewer draws a death as a hollow ring with a line from every killer (two ants that kill each other draw two lines that meet halfway), and a razed hill as a dashed square, so a fight reads at a glance and a screen reader hears who lost what to whom."
msgstr "引擎交给查看器的每一帧，既说明这一回合发生了什么，也说明当前的局面：每只蚂蚁的 id、这一回合死亡的蚂蚁及击杀它们的敌人，以及被攻陷的蚁丘。查看器把一次死亡画成一个空心圆环，并从每个击杀者引一条线过来（互相击杀的两只蚂蚁画出两条在中点相接的线），把被摧毁的蚁丘画成虚线方框，这样一场战斗一眼就能看懂，屏幕阅读器也能读出谁把什么输给了谁。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:70
msgid "The replay viewer re-simulates the recorded action stream with the cartridge that played the match, so the board shows the match as it happened. The graph under it follows each seat's ants, hills or score turn by turn; hover it to scrub."
msgstr "回放查看器用运行这场对局的卡带重新模拟记录下来的动作流，所以地图上展示的就是对局当时的样子。下方的图表逐回合跟踪每个席位的蚂蚁、蚁丘或得分；把鼠标悬停在上面即可拖动进度。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:77
msgid "Using replay examples in this book"
msgstr "本书中的回放示例"

#: src/competing/replays.md:79
msgid "This book marks a planned visualiser beside each explanation a real match would help. Each example must name its replay asset, engine digest, relevant turns, player perspective and caption. The book invents no match IDs or outcomes for these placeholders."
msgstr "凡是一场真实对局有助于说明的地方，本书都在旁边标出了一个计划中的可视化组件。每个示例都必须写明它的回放资源、引擎摘要、相关回合、玩家视角和说明文字。本书不会为这些占位符编造对局 ID 或结果。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:83
msgid "Full-board playback shows what no competitor could see during play. A page explaining what a model could infer from its view needs a player-view overlay, and keeps its prose so the rule still reads without the viewer or its replay assets."
msgstr "全图回放展示的是对局中任何参赛者都看不到的东西。解释模型能从自己的视野推断出什么的页面，需要一个玩家视角的叠加层，并保留文字说明，这样即使没有查看器或回放资源，规则仍然读得通。"

#: src/competing/replays.md:87
msgid "Improving from a replay"
msgstr "从回放中改进"

#: src/competing/replays.md:89
msgid "Check strikes and output validity first. Then look at growth, movement collisions, combat support, scouting and hill defence. Compare the same behavior across several seeds and boards: one attractive victory says little about whether a revision is stronger."
msgstr "先检查判罚和输出的有效性。再看发展、移动碰撞、战斗支援、侦察和蚁丘防守。在多个种子和地图上比较同一种行为：一场漂亮的胜利说明不了一个修改版是否更强。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:3
msgid "TinyBrains estimates each active version's playing strength with TrueSkill. A ladder ranks versions by a conservative estimate, so an entry needs a high estimated mean and the matches to back it."
msgstr "TinyBrains 用 TrueSkill 估计每个参赛中版本的实力。天梯按保守估计给版本排名，所以一个参赛模型既需要较高的估计均值，也需要足够的对局来支撑它。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:6
msgid "Reading a rating"
msgstr "读懂评分"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:8
msgid "A rating has a mean `mu` and uncertainty `sigma`. The displayed value is:"
msgstr "评分有均值 `mu` 和不确定度 `sigma`。显示的值是："

#: src/competing/ranking.md:14
msgid "The initial prior is `mu = 25` and `sigma ≈ 8.333`, which displays as a rating near zero. These are policy values. A hill score of 2 does not add 2 to your rating."
msgstr "初始先验是 `mu = 25` 和 `sigma ≈ 8.333`，显示出来的评分接近零。这些是策略值。蚁丘得分 2 分并不会给你的评分加 2。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:17
msgid "Each update depends on the match ranks, ties, the opponents' estimates and the uncertainty. The hill-score margin plays no part. A surprise against a well-established opponent can carry different information from a result between two uncertain new versions."
msgstr "每次更新取决于对局名次、平局、对手的估计值和不确定度。蚁丘得分的差距不起作用。对阵一个评分已经稳固的对手时爆出的冷门，与两个不确定的新版本之间的结果，所携带的信息可能不同。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:21
msgid "One ladder, viewed by class"
msgstr "一个天梯，按重量级查看"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:23
msgid "Every version has one rating, on **Open**, the single rated ladder. A match updates that one rating. A trial updates it for neither side."
msgstr "每个版本只有一个评分，记在**无差别级**上，也就是唯一一个计分的天梯。一场对局更新的就是这一个评分。试赛不更新任何一方的评分。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:26
msgid "A weight class is a **view** of Open: your class standing is your position on the Open ladder, counting only versions in your size class. So your Open rank and your class rank can never disagree about which of two same-size models is ahead. Compare models of different sizes on Open directly, since it already spans every size; a class view only shows how you rank among your size peers."
msgstr "重量级是无差别级的一个**视图**：你在重量级中的排名，就是你在无差别级天梯上的位置，只不过只数你这个大小级别里的版本。所以对于两个大小相同的模型谁在前面，你的无差别级名次和重量级名次永远不会有分歧。比较不同大小的模型时直接看无差别级，它本来就涵盖了所有大小；重量级视图只展示你在同级别对手中的名次。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:31
msgid "The leaderboard shows rank, model ID, owner, version, class, measured size, rating, provisional flag and match count. It sorts by conservative rating, highest first, and the version ID breaks ties the same way every time. Leaderboard rank and the shared game rank two seats get in a drawn match are separate numbers."
msgstr "排行榜显示名次、模型 ID、所有者、版本、重量级、测得的大小、评分、临时评分标记和对局数。它按保守评分从高到低排序，并以版本 ID 决胜，每次结果都一样。排行榜名次和平局中两个席位共享的游戏名次是两个不同的数字。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:36
msgid "Why a result arrives before its rating change"
msgstr "为什么结果先于评分变动出现"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:38
msgid "The runner records the result first. Soma's count clock then processes finished matches, writes rating events, and marks each match `rated`. Until then, the detail can show a result with no `rating_change`."
msgstr "运行器先记录结果。随后 Soma 的计分时钟处理已完成的对局，写入评分事件，并把每场对局标记为 `rated`。在那之前，对局详情可能有结果却没有 `rating_change`。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:42
msgid "Each seat's rating change records `mu_before`, `sigma_before`, `mu_after` and `sigma_after` for the one Open rating the match updated, so you can see how a result moved the estimate without comparing two leaderboard screenshots."
msgstr "每个席位的评分变动都记录了这场对局更新的那一个无差别级评分的 `mu_before`、`sigma_before`、`mu_after` 和 `sigma_after`，所以不用比较两张排行榜截图，你就能看到一个结果如何移动了估计值。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:46
msgid "Provisional and settled"
msgstr "临时与已稳定"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:48
msgid "The provisional flag is true while `sigma > 3`, on your one Open sigma. The matchmaker also counts placement matches, and seeks at least eight before it settles a version."
msgstr "只要你那一个无差别级 sigma 满足 `sigma > 3`，临时评分标记就为真。配对器还会数定级对局，至少凑够八场才会把一个版本判定为已稳定。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:51
msgid "In a season without rounds, a settled model can go without new matches of its own. The matchmaker can still pick it as an opponent, and those results move its rating. TrueSkill dynamics apply during updates only: uncertainty does not grow as wall-clock time passes. A season played in rounds works differently, as the next section explains."
msgstr "在没有轮次的赛季里，已稳定的模型可能不再有自己的新对局。配对器仍可能把它选作对手，那些结果会移动它的评分。TrueSkill 的动态只在更新时起作用：不确定度不会随着时间流逝而增长。按轮次进行的赛季则不同，下一节会解释。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:56
msgid "Rounds and score resets"
msgstr "轮次与评分重置"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:58
msgid "Without rounds, a version submitted in the first week collects hundreds of matches while one submitted later settles after a handful, and the conservative rating rewards the older one's lower uncertainty. A season can be played in **rounds** to take a version's age out of its score. The season's rules say how often a round starts, typically weekly."
msgstr "没有轮次时，第一周提交的版本会积累数百场对局，而晚些提交的版本打几场就稳定了，保守评分则奖励了老版本更低的不确定度。赛季可以按**轮次**进行，把版本的年龄从它的评分中剔除。赛季规则规定一轮多久开始一次，通常是每周一次。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:63
msgid "At the start of each round:"
msgstr "每一轮开始时："

#: src/competing/ranking.md:65
msgid "every active version's `sigma` rises to the round's floor, so every version carries the same `3 × sigma` discount and the leaderboard reads them by `mu`;"
msgstr "每个参赛中版本的 `sigma` 都升到本轮的下限，这样每个版本承受同样的 `3 × sigma` 折减，排行榜实际上按 `mu` 排列；"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:67
msgid "a round may also draw every `mu` part of the way toward the season's mean;"
msgstr "一轮也可以把每个 `mu` 向赛季均值拉近一部分；"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:68
msgid "matches queued for the round before are cancelled with `ROUND_ENDED`, while running ones finish and count;"
msgstr "上一轮排队中的对局以 `ROUND_ENDED` 取消，进行中的对局则打完并计入成绩；"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:70
msgid "every active version then plays the round's number of rated matches, the least-played first."
msgstr "然后每个参赛中版本打本轮规定数量的计分对局，打得最少的优先。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:72
msgid "Your match count, your record and your rating history carry over; only the uncertainty and possibly the mean are reset. The leaderboard shows each version's matches in the current round beside its season total, and counts down to the next reset. A notice across the site, and one in your notifications, gives warning before each reset."
msgstr "你的对局数、战绩和评分历史都会延续；重置的只有不确定度，可能还有均值。排行榜在每个版本的赛季总对局数旁边显示它本轮的对局数，并倒计时到下一次重置。每次重置前，全站都会有一条提示，你的通知里也会有一条。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:77
msgid "Finals"
msgstr "决赛"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:79
msgid "When a season's submissions close, an administrator can start its **finals**, a last round with its own number of matches. The finals wait until every submission has been admitted, so every entry's last version plays them. They start from a reset like any round's. Then every entry plays exactly the finals' number of matches: no entry is seated past it, while baselines fill the seats and are never waited for. The season closes once every entry has played its matches and nothing is left in flight. The podium is frozen from the ratings the finals end on."
msgstr "赛季的提交截止后，管理员可以开始它的**决赛**：最后一轮，有自己的对局数。决赛会等到每个提交都审核完毕，这样每个参赛模型的最后一个版本都能参加。它和任何一轮一样从一次重置开始。然后每个参赛模型恰好打决赛规定数量的对局：没有哪个参赛模型会被安排超出这个数的席位，而基线负责填补席位，永远不会被等待。每个参赛模型都打完自己的对局、没有任何对局在进行中后，赛季就结束了。领奖台按决赛结束时的评分定格。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:86
msgid "An administrator can change the finals' number of matches while they run, for every entry at once, or end the season early."
msgstr "决赛进行中，管理员可以更改决赛的对局数，同时作用于所有参赛模型，也可以提前结束赛季。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:89
msgid "Ratings after a new version"
msgstr "新版本之后的评分"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:91
msgid "A successor that passes its trial inherits its predecessor's one Open rating mean in the same season. The predecessor is **the same model's** previous active version; your models are separate lineages and inherit nothing from each other. The platform doubles the successor's uncertainty, capped at the initial prior, so it needs new evidence, and its displayed rating can start lower than the predecessor's with the same mean."
msgstr "通过试赛的后继版本会继承同一赛季内前代版本的那一个无差别级评分均值。前代版本是**同一个模型**之前参赛中的版本；你的各个模型是彼此独立的谱系，互不继承。平台会把后继版本的不确定度翻倍（以初始先验为上限），所以它需要新的证据，它显示出来的评分在均值相同的情况下可能比前代版本的更低。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:97
msgid "The successor inherits that one rating whatever weight class it lands in. Each version keeps its own later results: the platform never moves a predecessor's in-flight match to its successor."
msgstr "无论后继版本落在哪个重量级，它继承的都是那一个评分。每个版本保留自己之后的结果：平台从不把前代版本进行中的对局转给后继版本。"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:100
msgid "Seasons and comparisons"
msgstr "赛季与比较"

#: src/competing/ranking.md:102
msgid "Read one season with `GET /v1/games/ants/leaderboard?ladder=open&season=<slug>`. Without `season`, the API answers for the game's [featured season](seasons.md#which-season-a-request-is-about). A private season's standings are its members' alone, through `/v1/private/games/ants/leaderboard`. Historical standings stay available, and after an administrator closes a season, matches already in flight can still add final updates. A rating compares you with that season's field; ratings from two seasons share no scale."
msgstr "用 `GET /v1/games/ants/leaderboard?ladder=open&season=<slug>` 读取某一个赛季。不带 `season` 时，API 回答的是这个游戏的[精选赛季](seasons.md#which-season-a-request-is-about)。私有赛季的排名只有它的成员能看到，通过 `/v1/private/games/ants/leaderboard` 读取。历史排名一直可以查看；管理员结束赛季后，已经在进行中的对局仍可能带来最后的更新。评分是把你和那个赛季的参赛者相比较；两个赛季的评分不在同一尺度上。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:3
msgid "A season is a competition for one game. A platform administrator creates it, and each version you submit belongs to one season and plays only within that field. **Seasons overlap**: a game may run several live seasons at once, public and private, and each has its own boards, baselines, participants, runners, standings and podium."
msgstr "赛季是一个游戏的一场比赛。平台管理员创建它，你提交的每个版本都属于一个赛季，并且只在这个赛季的参赛者之间对局。**赛季可以重叠**：一个游戏可以同时进行多个赛季，有公开的也有私有的，每个赛季都有自己的地图、基线、参与者、运行器、排名和领奖台。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:8
msgid "A season has a **name** its administrator gives it, such as \"Summer 2026\", and a **slug** the platform derives from the name, `summer-2026`. Every link, every route and every record addresses the season by its slug. Neither ever changes, so a link to a season keeps working."
msgstr "赛季有一个管理员起的**名称**，比如“Summer 2026”，还有一个平台从名称派生出的 **slug**，即 `summer-2026`。每个链接、每条路由和每条记录都用 slug 来指代赛季。两者都永不改变，所以指向赛季的链接会一直有效。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:12
msgid "Which season a request is about"
msgstr "请求针对哪个赛季"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:14
msgid "A read that names no season, and a submission that names none, is about the game's **featured** season: the public season a platform administrator has featured, else the newest live public season, else the newest public season. A private season is never anyone's default."
msgstr "没有指明赛季的读取请求和提交，针对的都是这个游戏的**精选**赛季：平台管理员设为精选的公开赛季；没有的话，就是最新的进行中的公开赛季；再没有，就是最新的公开赛季。私有赛季永远不是任何人的默认赛季。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:18
msgid "To read or enter any other season, name it by its slug: `?season=<slug>` on a read, and `season` in a submission's body. The site's season switcher does the same, and its form submits to the season the page is showing."
msgstr "要读取或参加其他赛季，就用 slug 指明它：读取时加 `?season=<slug>`，提交时在请求体中写 `season`。网站的赛季切换器做的是同一件事，它的提交表单提交到页面当前显示的赛季。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:22
msgid "Who may see a season, and who may enter it"
msgstr "谁能看到赛季，谁能参赛"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:24
msgid "A season is **public** or **private**, and its entry is **open** or **restricted**. A private season is always restricted. Every season object carries both as `visibility` and `entry`."
msgstr "赛季要么**公开**要么**私有**，它的参赛资格要么**开放**要么**受限**。私有赛季总是受限的。每个赛季对象都以 `visibility` 和 `entry` 带着这两项。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:27
msgid "Who sees it"
msgstr "谁能看到"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:27
msgid "Who may enter"
msgstr "谁能参赛"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:29
msgid "Public, open"
msgstr "公开，开放"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:29 src/competing/seasons.md:30
msgid "everyone"
msgstr "所有人"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:29
msgid "anyone signed in"
msgstr "任何已登录的人"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:30
msgid "Public, restricted"
msgstr "公开，受限"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:30 src/competing/seasons.md:31
msgid "its participants"
msgstr "它的参与者"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:31
msgid "Private (restricted)"
msgstr "私有（受限）"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:31
msgid "its participants, its season administrators and platform administrators"
msgstr "它的参与者、它的赛季管理员和平台管理员"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:33
msgid "An admin fixes both when creating the season, with one exception: a platform administrator may narrow a season's entry from open to restricted while it is still scheduled. It never widens again, and visibility never changes at all — a private season that turned public would publish a term's history at once, and a public one that turned private would break every link already shared."
msgstr "管理员在创建赛季时就定下这两项，只有一个例外：赛季还未开始时，平台管理员可以把它的参赛资格从开放收窄为受限。它永远不会再放宽，而可见性则完全不可更改：私有赛季一旦转为公开，会把一整个学期的历史一下子公之于众；公开赛季一旦转为私有，会让所有已经分享出去的链接失效。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:38
msgid "**A restricted season admits its participants.** Its season administrators add them, and can do so while the season runs, so a late member of a class can still enter. Each participant is a sign-in provider and a login on it. When an account already holds that identity, the row is pinned to that account at once; otherwise it waits and is pinned when the identity first signs in. A row with no login admits every identity of that provider. Removing a participant stops their further submissions at once and, in a private season, their view of it; a version already on the ladder stays. The roster is not public: only the season's administrators read it."
msgstr "**受限赛季接纳的是它的参与者**。赛季管理员添加参与者，赛季进行中也可以添加，所以一个班里晚加入的成员仍然能参赛。每个参与者是一种登录方式加上该方式下的一个登录名。如果已有账户持有这个身份，这条记录会立即绑定到该账户；否则它会等待，直到这个身份第一次登录时再绑定。没有登录名的记录接纳该登录方式下的所有身份。移除参与者会立即阻止其后续提交，在私有赛季中还会收回其查看权限；已经在天梯上的版本则会留下。参与者名单不公开：只有赛季管理员能读取。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:46
msgid "**A season may also restrict which sign-in providers may enter it.** An identity from another provider cannot enter, even where its login is listed. A refused account gets `not_a_participant`; if you hold several sign-in identities, check that you signed in with one the season admits."
msgstr "**赛季还可以限制允许参赛的登录方式**。来自其他登录方式的身份无法参赛，即使它的登录名在名单上。被拒的账户会收到 `not_a_participant`；如果你有多个登录身份，请确认你用的是赛季接纳的那一个登录。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:50
msgid "**To anyone else, a private season does not exist.** Every public route that names it answers as it would for an unknown season, and its versions and matches answer `404`. Its members read it through the signed-in copies of the public reads under `/v1/private/...`, which take the same parameters and return the same shapes, and are never cached ([HTTP API](../reference/api.md#private-seasons)). Its matches carry comments among the same people, and a comment there never shows on anyone's public profile."
msgstr "**对其他任何人来说，私有赛季并不存在**。每条指明它的公开路由都像对待未知赛季一样作答，它的版本和对局都回答 `404`。它的成员通过 `/v1/private/...` 下那些需要登录的公开读取副本来读取它，这些路由接受同样的参数、返回同样的结构，并且从不缓存（[HTTP API](../reference/api.md#private-seasons)）。它的对局可以在同一群人之间评论，那里的评论永远不会出现在任何人的公开个人主页上。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:57
msgid "Who runs a season"
msgstr "谁管理赛季"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:59
msgid "A **platform administrator** creates the season, with its window, its rules, its visibility and entry, which sign-in providers may enter and which runners play it. A platform administrator also features a season, runs its [rounds and finals](ranking.md#rounds-and-score-resets), and assigns its **season administrators**, at creation or later."
msgstr "**平台管理员**创建赛季，定下它的提交窗口、规则、可见性和参赛资格、允许参赛的登录方式，以及由哪些运行器运行它的对局。平台管理员还负责把赛季设为精选、主持它的[轮次与决赛](ranking.md#rounds-and-score-resets)，并在创建时或之后指定它的**赛季管理员**。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:64
msgid "A season administrator runs one season: its participants, its boards and baselines, its own runner keys and runners, messages to the season's people, and its audit log. They may edit its window, rules and weight classes before it opens, and they may request its close. A season administrator is an ordinary competitor everywhere else, but **may not enter a season they administer**: a submission to it is refused with `season_admin_cannot_enter`, because their standing would be judged by themselves."
msgstr "赛季管理员管理一个赛季：它的参与者、地图和基线、它自己的运行器密钥和运行器、发给赛季成员的消息，以及它的审计日志。赛季开始前，他们可以编辑它的提交窗口、规则和重量级，也可以请求结束赛季。赛季管理员在其他地方是普通参赛者，但**不能参加自己管理的赛季**：向它提交会以 `season_admin_cannot_enter` 被拒绝，因为那样他们的名次就要由自己来评判了。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:71
msgid "Who plays a season"
msgstr "谁运行赛季的对局"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:73
msgid "A season's **fleet** policy says which runners play its matches (`matches`) and which admit its submissions (`admissions`), each `own`, `platform` or `both`. `platform` is the platform's own fleet. `own` is the season's runners, started from keys its season administrators mint on the season's page; such a key serves that season for ever and no other. A platform administrator can change the policy while the season runs. While the runners a season allows are all down, its matches wait in the queue and its submissions wait in `testing`."
msgstr "赛季的**机群**策略规定由哪些运行器运行它的对局（`matches`）、由哪些审核它的提交（`admissions`），每一项都是 `own`、`platform` 或 `both`。`platform` 是平台自己的机群。`own` 是赛季自己的运行器，用赛季管理员在赛季页面上生成的密钥启动；这样的密钥永远只为这个赛季服务。赛季进行中，平台管理员可以更改这个策略。当赛季允许的运行器全都不在线时，它的对局在队列中等待，它的提交则停在 `testing` 中等待。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:80
msgid "Waiting costs a submission none of its attempts, so nothing is lost by waiting a while. But a submission is refused for running out of time if it waits long enough, and that says nothing about the model — so the season's page says outright when submissions are queued and no machine the season's policy allows has called in, and `GET /v1/status` answers the same question for the platform (`admitters` beside `admission_queue`)."
msgstr "等待不消耗提交的任何尝试次数，所以等一会儿不会有损失。但等得太久，提交会因超时而被拒绝，而这和模型本身毫无关系——所以当提交在排队、而赛季策略允许的机器没有一台报到时，赛季页面会直截了当地说明；`GET /v1/status` 则为整个平台回答同一个问题（`admission_queue` 旁边的 `admitters`）。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:86
msgid "The submission window"
msgstr "提交窗口"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:88
msgid "`GET /v1/games/ants/seasons` lists the public seasons, and `GET /v1/private/games/ants/seasons` adds the private ones you may see: each one's name and slug, state, visibility and entry, submission opening and closing times, engine identity, rules, and a summary of its boards and baselines, newest first."
msgstr "`GET /v1/games/ants/seasons` 列出公开赛季，`GET /v1/private/games/ants/seasons` 再加上你能看到的私有赛季：每个赛季的名称和 slug、状态、可见性和参赛资格、提交的开放和截止时间、引擎标识、规则，以及它的地图和基线摘要，最新的在前。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:93
msgid "State"
msgstr "状态"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:93
msgid "Submissions"
msgstr "提交"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:93
msgid "Competition"
msgstr "比赛"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:95
msgid "`scheduled`"
msgstr "`scheduled`"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:95
msgid "Not yet accepted"
msgstr "尚不接受"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:95
msgid "Waiting for the opening time"
msgstr "等待开放时间"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:96
msgid "`open`"
msgstr "`open`"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:96
msgid "Accepted, within the rules"
msgstr "接受，须符合规则"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:96
msgid "Versions may enter and play"
msgstr "版本可以参赛并对局"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:97
msgid "`settling`"
msgstr "`settling`"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:97
msgid "Closed to new submissions"
msgstr "不再接受新提交"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:97
msgid "Existing work and matches continue"
msgstr "已有的审核和对局继续进行"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:98
msgid "`closed`"
msgstr "`closed`"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:98
msgid "Not accepted"
msgstr "不接受"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:98
msgid "Historical standings kept"
msgstr "保留历史排名"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:100
msgid "The opening time is inclusive and the closing time exclusive, so submit before the closing timestamp. A submission that arrives in time can still be in admission or its trial when the window ends. The settling period lets that work finish, unless the season's close is requested first."
msgstr "开放时间包含在内，截止时间不包含，所以要在截止时间戳之前提交。及时到达的提交在窗口结束时可能仍在审核或试赛中。结算期让这些工作得以完成，除非有人先请求结束赛季。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:104
msgid "The rules a season declares"
msgstr "赛季声明的规则"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:106
msgid "A season carries a rules document that describes the whole contest. Every rule is optional. A season that declares none plays under the platform's own defaults, so two seasons on an unchanged platform can run different contests. The rules are fixed once the season opens. Who may enter is not a rule: it is the season's entry and its participants, above."
msgstr "赛季带有一份规则文档，描述整场比赛。每条规则都是可选的。没有声明任何规则的赛季按平台自己的默认值进行，所以在同一个未改动的平台上，两个赛季可以是两场不同的比赛。赛季一旦开始，规则就固定下来。谁能参赛不是规则：那是上文所说的赛季参赛资格和参与者。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:111
msgid "**How much you may enter**"
msgstr "**你能提交多少**"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:113
msgid "How many **models** you may enter into the season."
msgstr "你能向赛季提交多少个**模型**。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:114
msgid "How many of your **versions** may be in admission at once, across every model."
msgstr "你的所有模型合计，可以同时有多少个**版本**处于审核中。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:115
msgid "How many **versions** you may enter, per model or in total."
msgstr "你能提交多少个**版本**，按每个模型计或按总数计。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:116
msgid "A **cooldown** between one model's submissions."
msgstr "同一个模型两次提交之间的**冷却时间**。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:117
msgid "How many of your models may sit in one weight class: a season may declare it, and the platform does not enforce it yet."
msgstr "你有多少个模型可以处于同一个重量级：赛季可以声明这一条，但平台目前还不会强制执行。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:120
msgid "**What may be entered**"
msgstr "**什么可以提交**"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:122
msgid "Which **weight classes** the season runs. Admission takes the smallest class the season runs that fits your size, so a model measuring below a class the season skips lands in the next one up. A model that fits only a class the season does not run is rejected with `CLASS_NOT_OFFERED`."
msgstr "赛季设有哪些**重量级**。审核会取赛季设有的、能容纳你的大小的最小重量级，所以如果测得的大小低于某个赛季跳过的重量级，模型会落到再上一级。只能放进赛季未设重量级的模型会以 `CLASS_NOT_OFFERED` 被拒绝。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:125
msgid "The **ONNX surface**: an opset window, an operator allowlist, a parameter ceiling and an adapter instruction budget. The operator list can only narrow the platform's, since a wider one would admit an operator the runtime cannot execute, which would then fail at play; the opset window and the budget are the season's own numbers."
msgstr "**ONNX 范围**：opset 区间、算子允许列表、参数上限和适配器指令预算。算子列表只能比平台的更窄，因为更宽的列表会放行运行时无法执行的算子，到对局时就会失败；opset 区间和预算则是赛季自己定的数字。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:129
msgid "Whether **duplicate weights** are refused, and in what scope: weights another competitor entered anywhere in the game, weights another competitor entered this season, or weights any other model holds, yours included."
msgstr "是否拒绝**重复权重**，以及在什么范围内拒绝：其他参赛者在这个游戏任何地方提交过的权重、其他参赛者在本赛季提交过的权重，或任何其他模型（包括你自己的）持有的权重。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:133
msgid "**How the ladder plays and how it is read**"
msgstr "**天梯如何对局、如何解读**"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:135
msgid "Which **boards** the season plays, how much **cross-class** play connects the Open ladder, and how many matches a version gets. The boards are the season's own: its administrators upload them, and `GET /v1/games/ants/seasons/{slug}/maps` lists each one from the moment it arrives. Unlike the rules, the boards can change while a season runs. An administrator can put a board in play or take one out; the platform cancels a match queued on a board taken out, and one already running finishes and counts. Design for the game's limits, since the boards a season has today can change ([The maps](../games/ants/maps.md))."
msgstr "赛季使用哪些**地图**、有多少**跨级**对局把无差别级天梯连起来，以及每个版本能打多少场对局。地图是赛季自己的：由它的管理员上传，`GET /v1/games/ants/seasons/{slug}/maps` 从每张地图到达的那一刻起就把它列出来。与规则不同，地图在赛季进行中可以变化。管理员可以启用或停用一张地图；平台会取消在已停用地图上排队的对局，已经在进行的对局则打完并计入成绩。请按游戏的限制来设计，因为赛季今天有的地图以后可能会变（[地图](../games/ants/maps.md)）。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:142
msgid "Whether two of **your own models may meet**. They may not unless a season says otherwise, because a match between two of your models would move rating between them for free."
msgstr "**你自己的两个模型能否相遇**。除非赛季另有规定，否则不能，因为你的两个模型之间的对局会白白地在它们之间转移评分。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:144
msgid "How many of your models may appear on the ladder at all."
msgstr "你最多能有多少个模型出现在天梯上。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:145
msgid "The **rating** constants, what counts as settled, and whether the season closes on its own once it has settled or only when an administrator asks."
msgstr "**评分**常数、什么算已稳定，以及赛季是在稳定后自行结束，还是只在管理员要求时才结束。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:148
msgid "Read the returned `rules` before you assume any of this. `GET /v1/games/{game}/submission`, with `?season=<slug>` or for the featured season, reports the window, whether you may enter, and the limits on models, versions and cooldown _before_ you make a request, in the words the refusal would use. The submission itself answers the duplicate-weights rule, and admission judges the class and ONNX rules once it has measured your graph."
msgstr "在假定上述任何一条之前，先读返回的 `rules`。`GET /v1/games/{game}/submission`（带 `?season=<slug>`，或针对精选赛季）会在你发出请求<em>之前</em>报告提交窗口、你是否可以参赛，以及模型数、版本数和冷却时间的限制，措辞与拒绝时相同。重复权重规则由提交本身回答，重量级和 ONNX 规则则由审核在测量你的计算图之后判定。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:154
msgid "How a season ends"
msgstr "赛季如何结束"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:156
msgid "After the submission window ends, the platform closes the season on its own once every candidate has a verdict, the outstanding games and counting are done, and the active competitors' ratings meet the settling policy on Open. The submission deadline sets no fixed time for the final match. A season played to [finals](ranking.md#finals) closes instead once every entry has played the finals' matches and nothing is left in flight."
msgstr "提交窗口结束后，一旦每个候选版本都有了裁定、未完成的对局和计分都已完成、参赛中参赛者的评分在无差别级上满足稳定策略，平台就会自行结束赛季。提交截止时间并不固定最后一场对局的时间。打到[决赛](ranking.md#finals)的赛季则不同：每个参赛模型都打完决赛的对局、没有任何对局在进行中后，赛季才结束。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:162
msgid "The season's administrators or a platform administrator can also request its close. Soma's withdraw clock then marks the season closed, rejects waiting candidates with `SEASON_CLOSED`, and cancels queued matches. Matches already claimed or running can still finish and count into that season, so the standings can take those last updates after the close. A `SEASON_CLOSED` rejection records an administrative decision and says nothing about whether your model met its requirements."
msgstr "赛季管理员或平台管理员也可以请求结束赛季。随后 Soma 的撤回时钟把赛季标记为已结束，以 `SEASON_CLOSED` 拒绝等待中的候选版本，并取消排队中的对局。已被认领或正在进行的对局仍可以打完并计入该赛季，所以排名在结束之后还可能接收这些最后的更新。`SEASON_CLOSED` 拒绝记录的是一个管理决定，与你的模型是否满足要求无关。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:168
msgid "Moving to a new season"
msgstr "进入新赛季"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:170
msgid "Your models persist across seasons, and their _entries_ stay behind. A model you created last season is still yours, with its name and its whole history, but none of its entries roll forward: a new season starts with no boards, no baselines, no participants and no versions. Promotion and predecessor rating inheritance stay within one season, and the platform enrolls no competitor account in a season for you."
msgstr "你的模型跨赛季保留，它们的<em>参赛记录</em>则留在原赛季。你上赛季创建的模型仍然是你的，名称和全部历史都在，但它的参赛记录一条也不会延续：新赛季开始时没有地图、没有基线、没有参与者，也没有版本。晋级和前代版本的评分继承都只在一个赛季内有效，平台也不会替你把任何参赛者账户报名到赛季里。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:176
msgid "The new season's administrators bring its boards and baselines in, uploading them or importing them from another season. An imported board arrives switched off, and switching it on checks it again under the new season's engine. An imported baseline is admitted again under the new season's rules and lands switched off. A baseline with the same name in another season is the same opponent, starting again from the prior."
msgstr "新赛季的管理员负责把它的地图和基线带进来，可以上传，也可以从另一个赛季导入。导入的地图到达时处于停用状态，启用它时会在新赛季的引擎下重新检查一遍。导入的基线会按新赛季的规则重新审核，并以停用状态落地。另一个赛季里同名的基线是同一个对手，从先验重新开始。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:182
msgid "**You bring your entries in.** Submit new files to the season as usual, or re-enter an entry as it stood in an earlier season:"
msgstr "**你的参赛模型由你自己带进来**。像平常一样向赛季提交新文件，或者让一个参赛模型以它在早先赛季中的状态重新参赛："

#: src/competing/seasons.md:186
msgid "'/v1/submissions/reenter'"
msgstr "'/v1/submissions/reenter'"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:192
msgid "'<your model_id>'"
msgstr "'<你的 model_id>'"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:193
msgid "'<the slug of the season it enters>'"
msgstr "'<它要进入的赛季的 slug>'"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:194
msgid "'<the slug of the season it stood in>'"
msgstr "'<它原来所在赛季的 slug>'"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:199
msgid "Re-entry takes the entry's standing in `from` (its active version there, or the newest it had in play) and enters the same bytes into `season`, with nothing to upload. It is an ordinary submission from there: the new season's entry, caps, cooldown, duplicate-weights rule and window all apply, and the new `testing` version goes through [admission](admission.md) and a [trial](trial.md) again under the new season's classes, memory and engine. The answer is `201` with the new version, or `200` when that version is already in flight. The refusals are a submission's, plus `404 nothing_to_reenter` when the entry had no version in play in `from`."
msgstr "重新参赛会取该参赛模型在 `from` 中的状态（它在那里参赛中的版本，或它最新的一个在赛的版本），把同样的字节提交到 `season`，无需上传任何东西。从这里开始它就是一次普通的提交：新赛季的参赛资格、上限、冷却时间、重复权重规则和提交窗口全都适用，新的 `testing` 版本会在新赛季的重量级、记忆和引擎下再次经过[审核](admission.md)和[试赛](trial.md)。响应是 `201` 并附上新版本，若该版本已在处理中则为 `200`。拒绝原因与普通提交相同，另加一条：当该参赛模型在 `from` 中没有任何在赛的版本时，返回 `404 nothing_to_reenter`。"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:207
msgid "Historical standings"
msgstr "历史排名"

#: src/competing/seasons.md:209
msgid "The platform keeps a closed season's standings. Read one with `GET /v1/games/ants/leaderboard?season=summer-2026&ladder=open`, or filter it to a size class. Match and version records name their season too, so you can keep results from separate fields apart in your training notes."
msgstr "平台保留已结束赛季的排名。用 `GET /v1/games/ants/leaderboard?season=summer-2026&ladder=open` 读取，或按重量级筛选。对局和版本记录也写明各自的赛季，所以你在训练笔记中可以把不同赛季的结果分开。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:3
msgid "Start with the version's `reject_reason` from `GET /v1/me/versions/{id}`. A refused submission request, an admission rejection, a trial failure and a failed match are separate events, and the stage tells you what to do next."
msgstr "先看版本的 `reject_reason`，它来自 `GET /v1/me/versions/{id}`。提交请求被拒绝、审核拒绝、试赛失败和对局失败是各自独立的事件，所处的阶段决定了你下一步该做什么。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:7
msgid "Request refusals"
msgstr "被拒绝的请求"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:9
msgid "Soma refuses these requests before it records a new version."
msgstr "Soma 在记录新版本之前就会拒绝这些请求。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:11
msgid "Error or condition"
msgstr "错误或情况"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:13
msgid "`hashes_required`"
msgstr "`hashes_required`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:13
msgid "Declared hashes missing, or malformed on their face"
msgstr "没有声明哈希，或哈希的格式一眼就不对"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:13
msgid "Supply both `weights_hash` and `manifest_hash` as `sha256:<64 hex>`"
msgstr "同时提供 `weights_hash` 和 `manifest_hash`，格式为 `sha256:<64 hex>`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:14
msgid "`unknown_game`"
msgstr "`unknown_game`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:14
msgid "No game by that slug"
msgstr "没有这个 slug 的游戏"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:14
msgid "Read `GET /v1/games` for the slugs"
msgstr "通过 `GET /v1/games` 查看各游戏的 slug"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:15
msgid "`season_not_open`"
msgstr "`season_not_open`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:15
msgid "The season you named, or the featured one if you named none, is not accepting submissions"
msgstr "你指定的赛季（未指定时为精选赛季）目前不接受提交"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:15
msgid "Name the season you mean with `season`, or read its dates and wait for its window"
msgstr "用 `season` 指定你想要的赛季，或查看它的日期并等待提交窗口开放"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:16
msgid "`not_a_participant`"
msgstr "`not_a_participant`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:16
msgid "The season is restricted and you are not among its participants, or you signed in with a provider the season does not admit"
msgstr "该赛季仅限名单上的人参赛，而你不在参与者名单上；或者你登录所用的登录方式不被该赛季接受"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:16
msgid "Ask the season's organizer to add you, or sign in with the identity they listed"
msgstr "请赛季组织者把你加入名单，或用他们列出的身份登录"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:17
msgid "`season_admin_cannot_enter`"
msgstr "`season_admin_cannot_enter`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:17
msgid "You administer this season, and a season's administrators may not enter it"
msgstr "你是本赛季的管理员，而赛季管理员不能参加自己管理的赛季"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:17
msgid "Enter another season"
msgstr "参加其他赛季"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:18
msgid "`weights_already_entered`"
msgstr "`weights_already_entered`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:18
msgid "The season refuses duplicate weights, and another competitor's entry (or, in scope `user`, any other model) already holds these"
msgstr "该赛季不接受重复的权重，而另一位参赛者的参赛模型（在 `user` 范围下则是任何其他模型）已经使用了这组权重"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:18
msgid "Check the rule scope and submit an eligible entry"
msgstr "查看该规则的范围，提交符合条件的模型"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:19
msgid "`version_in_flight`"
msgstr "`version_in_flight`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:19
msgid "This model already has a testing or verified candidate in this season"
msgstr "这个模型在本赛季已有一个候选版本在审核中（testing 或 verified）"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:19
msgid "Follow that candidate to a verdict; your other models, and this model in other seasons, are unaffected"
msgstr "等那个候选版本出结果；你的其他模型，以及这个模型在其他赛季的参赛，都不受影响"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:20
msgid "`unknown_model`"
msgstr "`unknown_model`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:20
msgid "That model id is not one of yours"
msgstr "这个模型 id 不属于你"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:20
msgid "Create the model first; a submission never creates one"
msgstr "先创建模型；提交从不会自动创建模型"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:21
msgid "`model_retired`"
msgstr "`model_retired`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:21
msgid "The model takes no new versions"
msgstr "这个模型不再接受新版本"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:21
msgid "Revive it, or submit to another"
msgstr "恢复它，或提交到另一个模型"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:22
msgid "`too_many_in_flight`"
msgstr "`too_many_in_flight`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:22
msgid "You are at the season's limit for versions in admission at once"
msgstr "你同时在审核中的版本数量已达本赛季的上限"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:22
msgid "Wait for one to reach a verdict"
msgstr "等其中一个出结果"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:23
msgid "`too_many_versions`"
msgstr "`too_many_versions`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:23
msgid "You have entered as many versions as the season allows"
msgstr "你提交的版本数量已达本赛季的上限"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:23
msgid "The next season starts you fresh"
msgstr "下个赛季会重新开始计数"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:24
msgid "`cooling_down`"
msgstr "`cooling_down`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:24
msgid "The season asks for a gap between one model's submissions"
msgstr "本赛季规定同一模型两次提交之间要有间隔"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:24
msgid "The response carries the instant you may try again"
msgstr "响应中给出了你可以再次尝试的时刻"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:25
msgid "`note_too_long`, `note_word_listed`"
msgstr "`note_too_long`、`note_word_listed`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:25
msgid "The version's note is over the length, or carries a word the site lists"
msgstr "版本备注超过了长度限制，或含有本站不允许使用的词"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:25
msgid "Shorten it, or leave the note out"
msgstr "缩短备注，或不填备注"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:26
msgid "`entries_max`"
msgstr "`entries_max`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:26
msgid "You have entered as many models into this season as it allows"
msgstr "你在本赛季参赛的模型数量已达上限"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:26
msgid "Submit to a model already in the season, or retire one to free a slot"
msgstr "提交到已在本赛季参赛的模型，或让一个模型退役以空出名额"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:27
msgid "`name_required`"
msgstr "`name_required`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:27
msgid "The create call carried no name"
msgstr "创建请求没有带名称"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:27
msgid "Send a name: it is all an entry declares"
msgstr "发送一个名称：一个参赛模型要声明的只有这一项"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:28
msgid "`model_name_taken`"
msgstr "`model_name_taken`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:28
msgid "You already have a model with that name"
msgstr "你已经有一个同名模型"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:28
msgid "A name tells _your_ models apart; another competitor may hold the same one"
msgstr "名称用来区分 _你自己的_ 模型；其他参赛者可以使用相同的名称"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:29
msgid "`name_invalid`"
msgstr "`name_invalid`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:29
msgid "A rename to a name the site does not accept"
msgstr "改名时用了本站不接受的名称"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:29
msgid "Pick another"
msgstr "换一个"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:30
msgid "`reenter_invalid`"
msgstr "`reenter_invalid`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:30
msgid "A re-entry lacked `game`, `model`, `season` or `from`"
msgstr "重新参赛的请求缺少 `game`、`model`、`season` 或 `from`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:30
msgid "Send all four"
msgstr "四项都要发送"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:31
msgid "`nothing_to_reenter`"
msgstr "`nothing_to_reenter`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:31
msgid "The model you re-entered had no version in play in the `from` season"
msgstr "你重新参赛的模型在 `from` 赛季中没有参赛中的版本"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:31
msgid "Check the slug in `from`, or submit files instead"
msgstr "检查 `from` 中的 slug，或改为直接提交文件"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:32
msgid "`401` / `session_revoked`"
msgstr "`401` / `session_revoked`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:32
msgid "Session absent, invalid, expired, or revoked"
msgstr "会话缺失、无效、过期或已被撤销"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:32
msgid "Sign in again"
msgstr "重新登录"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:34
msgid "`weights_already_entered` comes from the season's `unique_weights` rule, and it is the only uniqueness conflict a submission can hit. A version has no release tag to duplicate, so no `duplicate_release` error code exists."
msgstr "`weights_already_entered` 来自赛季的 `unique_weights` 规则，也是提交可能遇到的唯一一种唯一性冲突。版本没有可供重复的发布标签，所以不存在 `duplicate_release` 这个错误码。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:38
msgid "`cooling_down` is the only refusal that depends on the current time, so two calls a second apart can get different answers. For that reason it reports the instant you may retry, and gives no yes or no."
msgstr "`cooling_down` 是唯一取决于当前时间的拒绝，所以相隔一秒的两次调用可能得到不同的答复。因此它只报告你可以重试的时刻，而不给出是或否。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:42
msgid "The upload, and what arrived"
msgstr "上传与收到的文件"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:46
msgid "`ARTIFACT_MISSING`"
msgstr "`ARTIFACT_MISSING`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:46
msgid "The graph was not in the bucket at your version's key when its thirty-minute upload window closed"
msgstr "三十分钟的上传窗口关闭时，存储桶中你这个版本的键下没有计算图"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:46
msgid "**You did not upload.** Submit again for a new version and fresh URLs, and `PUT` both files"
msgstr "**你没有上传**。重新提交以获得新版本和新的 URL，然后 `PUT` 两个文件"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:47
msgid "`MANIFEST_MISSING`"
msgstr "`MANIFEST_MISSING`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:47
msgid "The graph arrived and the manifest had not when the window closed"
msgstr "窗口关闭时计算图已到达，清单还没有"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:47
msgid "The same fix, for the second file"
msgstr "同样的修法，用在第二个文件上"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:48
msgid "`MANIFEST_MISMATCH`"
msgstr "`MANIFEST_MISMATCH`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:48
msgid "The file you uploaded does not hash to `manifest_hash`"
msgstr "你上传的文件的哈希与 `manifest_hash` 不符"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:48
msgid "Re-run `shasum -a 256` on the file you sent"
msgstr "对你发送的文件重新运行 `shasum -a 256`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:49
msgid "`MANIFEST_INVALID`"
msgstr "`MANIFEST_INVALID`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:49
msgid "The document carries no `inputs` or no `outputs`"
msgstr "文档中没有 `inputs` 或没有 `outputs`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:49
msgid "Make it an `orion:model@1.0.0` manifest, which carries both"
msgstr "把它写成 `orion:model@1.0.0` 清单，这种清单两者都带"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:50
msgid "`RESULT_NOT_ALLOWED`"
msgstr "`RESULT_NOT_ALLOWED`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:50
msgid "The manifest carries a `result` expression"
msgstr "清单中带有 `result` 表达式"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:50
msgid "The platform reads the head. Delete the expression; see [the manifest](../models/adapters.md#why-you-do-not-write-the-head)"
msgstr "策略头由平台来读。删掉这个表达式；见[清单](../models/adapters.md#why-you-do-not-write-the-head)"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:51
msgid "`DIGEST_FAILED`"
msgstr "`DIGEST_FAILED`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:51
msgid "The node re-hashed the graph and got something else"
msgstr "节点重新对计算图做哈希，得到了另一个值"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:51
msgid "The same fix as `MANIFEST_MISMATCH`, for `model.onnx`"
msgstr "与 `MANIFEST_MISMATCH` 同样的修法，用在 `model.onnx` 上"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:53
msgid "Graph and policy"
msgstr "计算图与策略"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:57
msgid "`PARSE_FAILED`"
msgstr "`PARSE_FAILED`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:57
msgid "The ONNX parses and no plan builds"
msgstr "ONNX 能解析，但构建不出执行计划"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:57
msgid "Re-export. A graph that computes its own indices cannot declare named spatial axes, so give it concrete ones"
msgstr "重新导出。自己计算索引的计算图无法声明命名的空间轴，所以请给它具体的维度"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:58
msgid "`PROBE_FAILED`"
msgstr "`PROBE_FAILED`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:58
msgid "It loads and will not run at your `probe_dims`"
msgstr "能加载，但在你的 `probe_dims` 下无法运行"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:58
msgid "Check that the declared shapes are the ones the graph takes"
msgstr "检查声明的形状是否就是计算图所接受的形状"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:59
msgid "`PROBE_TOO_SLOW`"
msgstr "`PROBE_TOO_SLOW`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:59
msgid "The probe's median, five inferences at your `probe_dims`, was over the game's turn (1,000 ms for Ants) on every attempt"
msgstr "探测的中位数（在你的 `probe_dims` 下推理五次）在每次尝试中都超过了游戏的回合时限（Ants 为 1,000 ms）"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:59
msgid "Make the graph faster at `probe_dims`. The version's `infer_us` is the last median, and `tinybrains check` measures the same probe"
msgstr "让计算图在 `probe_dims` 下跑得更快。版本的 `infer_us` 是最后一次的中位数，`tinybrains check` 测的是同一个探测"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:60
msgid "`TOO_LARGE`"
msgstr "`TOO_LARGE`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:60
msgid "`S'` (the two files' bytes) fits no class in this season's table"
msgstr "`S'`（两个文件的字节数）在本赛季的重量级表中找不到能容纳它的重量级"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:60
msgid "Measure both files and reduce the larger"
msgstr "测量两个文件的大小，缩小较大的那个"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:61
msgid "`OPSET_UNSUPPORTED`"
msgstr "`OPSET_UNSUPPORTED`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:61
msgid "Opset outside this season's window"
msgstr "opset 在本赛季的范围之外"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:61
msgid "Export within the range the season publishes"
msgstr "按赛季公布的范围导出"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:62
msgid "`OP_NOT_ALLOWED`"
msgstr "`OP_NOT_ALLOWED`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:62
msgid "Graph uses an operator this season does not allow"
msgstr "计算图使用了本赛季不允许的算子"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:62
msgid "Inspect the exported nodes, including `If`/`Loop`/`Scan` bodies, and use supported operations"
msgstr "检查导出的节点，包括 `If`/`Loop`/`Scan` 的子图，只使用支持的算子"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:63
msgid "`CLASS_NOT_OFFERED`"
msgstr "`CLASS_NOT_OFFERED`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:63
msgid "It fits only a class this season does not run"
msgstr "它只能进入本赛季不开设的重量级"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:63
msgid "Reach a class the season offers. `TOO_LARGE` is the separate reason for a model past every class"
msgstr "缩到赛季开设的重量级。`TOO_LARGE` 是另一个原因，针对超出所有重量级的模型"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:64
msgid "`PARAMS_EXCEEDED`"
msgstr "`PARAMS_EXCEEDED`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:64
msgid "More parameters than this season allows"
msgstr "参数量超过本赛季的允许值"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:64
msgid "Reduce the parameter count as well as the bytes. The count covers every value the document carries, wherever it carries it"
msgstr "除了字节数，也要减少参数量。参数量统计文档中携带的每一个数值，不论它在哪里"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:65
msgid "`TOO_SLOW`"
msgstr "`TOO_SLOW`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:65
msgid "Slower than this season's inference ceiling"
msgstr "慢于本赛季的推理上限"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:65
msgid "Rare: most seasons set none. Simplify the graph"
msgstr "少见：大多数赛季不设此项。简化计算图"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:67
msgid "A slow graph stays in its class; admission does not move it to a larger one. See [model format](../models/format.md) and [weight classes](../models/weight-classes.md)."
msgstr "慢的计算图留在它自己的重量级；审核不会把它移到更大的重量级。见[模型格式](../models/format.md)和[重量级](../models/weight-classes.md)。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:70
msgid "Adapter and interface"
msgstr "适配器与接口"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:74
msgid "`ADAPTER_INVALID`"
msgstr "`ADAPTER_INVALID`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:74
msgid "An adapter did not produce a tensor the graph takes, or produced none for a declared input"
msgstr "某个适配器没有产生计算图所接受的张量，或者对某个已声明的输入什么都没产生"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:74
msgid "Check operators, scopes, dtypes and shapes. A misspelt operator fails here: loading accepts it"
msgstr "检查操作符、作用域、数据类型和形状。拼错的操作符在这里失败：加载时是接受它的"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:75
msgid "`ADAPTER_OVER_BUDGET`"
msgstr "`ADAPTER_OVER_BUDGET`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:75
msgid "An adapter exceeds its operation budget on a reference observation"
msgstr "某个适配器在某条参考观测上超出了它的操作预算"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:75
msgid "Measure the cases and reduce the work; see [the budget](../models/adapters/budget.md)"
msgstr "测量各个用例并减少工作量；见[预算](../models/adapters/budget.md)"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:76
msgid "`HEAD_UNREADABLE`"
msgstr "`HEAD_UNREADABLE`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:76
msgid "The policy output is not a shape the referee can read"
msgstr "策略输出的形状裁判读不了"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:76
msgid "Make it rank 2 or rank 4: `[N, 5]` or `[1, 5, H, W]`. See [the two head shapes](../models/actions.md#the-two-head-shapes)"
msgstr "把它做成 2 阶或 4 阶：`[N, 5]` 或 `[1, 5, H, W]`。见[两种策略头形状](../models/actions.md#the-two-head-shapes)"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:78
msgid "`ADAPTER_OVER_BUDGET` means the adapter costs too much, and `ADAPTER_INVALID` means it is wrong; the platform keeps the two words apart on purpose. Reproduce all three reasons with [`tinybrains check`](../models/testing.md#check-it-the-way-admission-will), which measures what admission measures and names the observation and the operator that failed."
msgstr "`ADAPTER_OVER_BUDGET` 表示适配器开销太大，`ADAPTER_INVALID` 表示它是错的；平台有意把这两个词分开。这三个原因都可以用 [`tinybrains check`](../models/testing.md#check-it-the-way-admission-will) 复现，它测量的正是审核所测量的，并指出失败的是哪条观测、哪个操作符。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:83
msgid "**The word is all a version carries.** The platform stores no detail beside it, so `check` on your machine is where you find out which observation or which node it was."
msgstr "**版本只带着这一个词**。平台不在它旁边存任何细节，所以要在你自己的机器上运行 `check`，才能知道是哪条观测或哪个节点出了问题。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:88
msgid "These apply only to a manifest that declares an output named `memory` or `ant_memory`; see [Memory](../models/memory.md#what-admission-checks)."
msgstr "这些只适用于声明了名为 `memory` 或 `ant_memory` 的输出的清单；见[记忆](../models/memory.md#what-admission-checks)。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:93
msgid "The manifest declares a memory output, and its class allows no memory in this season"
msgstr "清单声明了记忆输出，而它所在的重量级在本赛季不允许记忆"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:93
msgid "Remove the output, or enter a class the season gives memory"
msgstr "删掉这个输出，或进入一个赛季给了记忆的重量级"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:94
msgid "The memory costs more than the class's cap on the smallest or the largest board"
msgstr "在最小或最大的地图上，记忆的开销超过了该重量级的上限"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:94
msgid "Shrink its shape or its dtype, or enter a larger class"
msgstr "缩小它的形状或数据类型，或进入更大的重量级"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:95
msgid "A memory output names too many dimensions, names one twice, or lacks a dtype or a shape"
msgstr "某个记忆输出命名了太多维度、把同一维度命名了两次，或缺少数据类型或形状"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:95
msgid "`memory` may name two dimensions, `ant_memory` one"
msgstr "`memory` 可以命名两个维度，`ant_memory` 一个"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:96
msgid "Fed its own memory on the reference observations, the model's call failed"
msgstr "在参考观测上喂入模型自己的记忆后，模型调用失败了"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:96
msgid "Make each memory input take exactly what its output writes, and play a match with `tinybrains`"
msgstr "让每个记忆输入恰好接受其对应输出所写的内容，并用 `tinybrains` 打一场对局"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:98
msgid "Trials and administrative outcomes"
msgstr "试赛与管理上的结果"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:102
msgid "`FORFEIT`"
msgstr "`FORFEIT`"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:102
msgid "Candidate reached the strike limit, five unless the season sets another, in a completed trial"
msgstr "候选版本在一场完整的试赛中达到了判罚上限（赛季未另行设定时为五次）"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:102
msgid "Inspect timing and adapter failures, then retest"
msgstr "检查超时和适配器故障，然后重新测试"

