#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:108
msgid "A withdrawn **queued match** carries its own word in `withdrawn_reason`, and no rejection:"
msgstr "被撤回的**排队中的对局**在 `withdrawn_reason` 中带有自己的词，而不是拒绝原因："

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:120
msgid "A withdrawn match counts as no loss and changes no rating; see [the life of a version](../competing/version-life.md)."
msgstr "被撤回的对局不算失利，也不改变评分；见[版本的生命周期](../competing/version-life.md)。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:123
msgid "When the platform fails"
msgstr "平台出故障时"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:125
msgid "A failure on the platform's side leaves the candidate `testing` and sends it back to the queue: the object store could not be reached, no runner was up, the runner that claimed it could not fetch the artifact, reach its node or report in time. A failure while the version waited for a runner spends nothing. A failure on the runner that had claimed it spends one of the three attempts, and three spent attempts end as `TIMED_OUT`. A timeout at the end of those retries proves nothing about your network. You never see the intermediate words: a version's `reject_reason` is one of the words on this page, and nothing else."
msgstr "平台一侧的故障会让候选版本留在 `testing` 状态并送回队列：对象存储无法访问、没有运行器在线、认领它的运行器没能取到模型文件、没能连上自己的节点或没能及时报告。版本等待运行器期间的故障不消耗任何东西。已认领它的运行器上的故障消耗三次尝试中的一次，三次尝试都用完则以 `TIMED_OUT` 结束。这些重试最终的超时说明不了你的网络有任何问题。你永远看不到中间的那些词：版本的 `reject_reason` 只会是本页上的某个词，不会是别的。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:133
msgid "`ARTIFACT_MISSING` and `MANIFEST_MISSING` look like platform failures and are **not** in this class. An empty bucket is your submission's state, and no amount of retrying makes bytes appear."
msgstr "`ARTIFACT_MISSING` 和 `MANIFEST_MISSING` 看起来像平台故障，但**不**属于这一类。空的存储桶是你这次提交的状态，再多的重试也变不出字节来。"

#: src/reference/rejection-reasons.md:136
msgid "A rejected candidate leaves your active version in place. Once you know the cause, submit the corrected files and their hashes as the next version. Keep the failed version and trial IDs in any report you file: the operator needs them to find the evidence."
msgstr "候选版本被拒绝后，你参赛中的版本保持不变。查明原因后，把修正后的文件及其哈希作为下一个版本提交。在你提交的任何报告中都保留失败版本和试赛的 ID：运维人员需要用它们来找证据。"

