msgid "Ask on [Discord](https://discord.gg/xr9Z2mSkxr) when a reason does not say enough, or when the fault looks like ours. A bug in a part of the platform can also go to that repository's issues on [GitHub](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains)."
msgstr "当拒绝原因说得不够清楚，或者故障看起来出在我们这边时，到 [Discord](https://discord.gg/xr9Z2mSkxr) 上提问。平台某个部分的 bug 也可以提到该仓库在 [GitHub](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains) 上的 issues。"

