msgid "These are policy settings, and they guarantee no competitor a match rate. Read [Ranking](../competing/ranking.md) before you interpret an idle or provisional entry."
msgstr "这些是策略设置，不向任何参赛者保证对局频率。在解读一个空闲或临时评分的参赛模型之前，先读[排名](../competing/ranking.md)。"

#: src/reference/limits.md:100
msgid "Where values come from"
msgstr "数值的来源"

#: src/reference/limits.md:102
msgid "Ants' `cartridge.json` declares the limits every season's board must fit (`limits.boards`, the three board rows above), turn limits, and the adapter budget. A season's boards are its own: an admin uploads them, and `GET /v1/games/ants/seasons/{slug}/maps` lists them. The engine source implements geometry and game-ending rules. The **season** fixes the size boundaries and every quota in the table above, in the database, and Soma's admission clock judges against them. The Orion templates in Soma's and Kalam's `docker/` configure opsets, trials, ratings, scheduling and the operation budget the node enforces. The [repositories page](../platform/repositories.md) names each owner."
msgstr "Ants 的 `cartridge.json` 声明了每个赛季的地图都必须符合的限制（`limits.boards`，即上面的三行地图数据）、回合限制和适配器预算。赛季的地图归赛季自己所有：由管理员上传，`GET /v1/games/ants/seasons/{slug}/maps` 列出它们。引擎源码实现几何和结束规则。**赛季**在数据库中确定大小边界和上表中的每一项配额，Soma 的审核时钟据此裁定。Soma 和 Kalam 的 `docker/` 中的 Orion 模板配置 opset、试赛、评分、排程以及节点强制执行的操作预算。[仓库页](../platform/repositories.md)列出了每一项的归属。"

#: src/reference/api.md:3
msgid "Soma serves the competitor API under `/v1`. Use the competition's browser-facing origin; the local stack proxies these routes through `http://localhost:5173`. Responses are JSON unless the route redirects or clears a session without a body."
msgstr "Soma 在 `/v1` 下提供参赛者 API。请使用比赛面向浏览器的源（origin）；本地环境通过 `http://localhost:5173` 代理这些路由。除非路由做重定向，或清除会话且不带响应体，否则响应都是 JSON。"

#: src/reference/api.md:7
msgid "The contracts below describe Soma's workflows. Everything a competitor needs is also a screen on the site; use this reference when you script against the API."
msgstr "下面的契约描述的是 Soma 的工作流。参赛者需要的一切在网站上也都有对应的页面；当你要写脚本调用 API 时，再来查这份参考。"

#: src/reference/api.md:10
msgid "**Soma caches its public reads** (the leaderboard, matches, models, versions, profiles, seasons, games, boards and the site's community pages) for up to ten minutes, and clears a cached read the moment a writer changes the data under it, so a public read is current when you get it. The reads about your own account under `/v1/me`, and the member reads under `/v1/private`, are never cached."
msgstr "**Soma 会缓存公开读取**（排行榜、对局、模型、版本、个人主页、赛季、游戏、地图，以及网站的社区页面），最长十分钟；一旦有写入改动了底下的数据，对应的缓存立即清除，所以你拿到的公开读取总是最新的。`/v1/me` 下关于你自己账户的读取，以及 `/v1/private` 下的成员读取，从不缓存。"

#: src/reference/api.md:15
msgid "Signing in"
msgstr "登录"

#: src/reference/api.md:17
msgid "Send the browser to `GET /v1/auth/{provider}` (for example `/v1/auth/github`). The provider returns through `GET /v1/auth/{provider}/callback`, and Soma sets an HttpOnly `soma_session` cookie. A session lasts 30 days, and Soma checks server-side revocation on each authenticated request. Use same-origin requests so the browser sends the cookie. `GET /v1/auth-providers` lists the providers this deployment serves, which is how the sign-in page draws a button for each."
msgstr "让浏览器访问 `GET /v1/auth/{provider}`（例如 `/v1/auth/github`）。登录服务商会经由 `GET /v1/auth/{provider}/callback` 返回，Soma 随即设置一个 HttpOnly 的 `soma_session` cookie。会话有效期 30 天，Soma 在每个需要认证的请求上都会检查服务端的撤销状态。请使用同源请求，浏览器才会带上 cookie。`GET /v1/auth-providers` 列出本部署支持的登录方式，登录页正是据此为每一种画出一个按钮。"

