#: src/reference/api.md:54
msgid "These reads are public. `game` is a slug such as `ants`. Ladder values are `nano`, `micro`, `mini`, `small`, `large` and `open`, and the default is `open`. `season` takes a season's slug, such as `summer-2026`; a number or a UUID does not work. Omit it for the game's **featured** season: the public season a platform administrator featured, else the newest live public season, else the newest public season. Seasons overlap, so name the one you mean. A private season answers here as one that does not exist; see [Private seasons](#private-seasons)."
msgstr "这些读取都是公开的。`game` 是一个 slug，例如 `ants`。天梯的取值为 `nano`、`micro`、`mini`、`small`、`large` 和 `open`，默认是 `open`。`season` 接受赛季的 slug，例如 `summer-2026`；数字或 UUID 都不行。省略它就是该游戏的**精选**赛季：平台管理员设为精选的公开赛季，否则是最新的进行中的公开赛季，再否则是最新的公开赛季。赛季之间会重叠，所以请指明你要的那一个。私有赛季在这里的回答与不存在的赛季无异；见[私有赛季](#private-seasons)。"

#: src/reference/api.md:61
msgid "Leaderboard `limit` defaults to 50, at most 200, and `cursor` to `\"0\"`. The cursor is an offset string. Follow the returned `next_cursor` until it is null. Live ratings can reorder the board between requests, so paging gives you no stable snapshot."
msgstr "排行榜的 `limit` 默认为 50，最大 200；`cursor` 默认为 `\"0\"`。游标是一个偏移量字符串。沿着返回的 `next_cursor` 翻页，直到它为 null。实时评分可能在两次请求之间改变榜单顺序，所以分页得不到稳定的快照。"

#: src/reference/api.md:66
msgid "'http://localhost:5173/v1/games/ants/leaderboard?ladder=open&limit=10'"
msgstr "'http://localhost:5173/v1/games/ants/leaderboard?ladder=open&limit=10'"

#: src/reference/api.md:69
msgid "The body has `season` (the slug), `season_name`, `closed`, `round` (the season's current [round](../competing/ranking.md#rounds-and-score-resets), `{n, kind, games}`, or null), `total`, `entries`, and `next_cursor`. Each entry includes `rank`, `version_id`, `model_id`, `model`, `owner`, `version`, `class`, `size_bytes`, `rating`, `provisional`, `matches`, `round_matches` (rated matches in the current round, null without one), `baseline` (whether it is a platform entry), `trend` (how much the rating moved on the last counted match, or null before the first), and `history` (the last twelve ratings on this ladder, oldest first, the seed at promotion included, rounded to two places: enough for a sparkline). Entries level on rating are ordered by version id, the same way every time."
msgstr "响应体包含 `season`（slug）、`season_name`、`closed`、`round`（赛季当前的[轮次](../competing/ranking.md#rounds-and-score-resets)，`{n, kind, games}`，没有则为 null）、`total`、`entries` 和 `next_cursor`。每个条目包含 `rank`、`version_id`、`model_id`、`model`、`owner`、`version`、`class`、`size_bytes`、`rating`、`provisional`、`matches`、`round_matches`（当前轮次中已计分的对局数，没有轮次时为 null）、`baseline`（是否为平台提供的条目）、`trend`（最近一场计分对局带来的评分变动，第一场之前为 null）和 `history`（这个天梯上最近十二次评分，最早的在前，含晋级时的初始评分，保留两位小数：足够画一条迷你走势图）。评分相同的条目按版本 id 排序，每次都一样。"

#: src/reference/api.md:80
msgid "A season entry includes `name`, `slug`, `state`, `submissions_open_at`, `submissions_close_at`, `closed_at`, `close_requested_at`, `visibility` (`public` or `private`), `entry` (`open` or `restricted`), `engine_digest`, `rules`, and **`weight_classes`**: the size boundaries the season plays under, which you need to read a standing, each with the memory its class allows (`memory_flat_bytes` and `memory_cell_bytes`, 0 when absent). It also carries five counts: `entries` (models in the field), `active_versions` (the ladder's size), `entered_versions` (everything ever submitted), `in_flight_versions` (how many are mid-admission), and `matches_played`, which **excludes trials** so it agrees with what `GET /v1/matches` can reach. `maps` summarises the season's boards, how many are in play and how many are not, and the seats and sides the ones in play span; `baselines` summarises its baselines the same way. `round` is the round it is in (`{n, kind, games, started_at}`, `kind` being `round` or `finals`) and `next_round` the reset waiting to start (`{n, kind, games, starts_at}`), each null without one. See [Seasons](../competing/seasons.md)."
msgstr "赛季条目包含 `name`、`slug`、`state`、`submissions_open_at`、`submissions_close_at`、`closed_at`、`close_requested_at`、`visibility`（`public` 或 `private`）、`entry`（`open` 或 `restricted`）、`engine_digest`、`rules`，以及 **`weight_classes`**：赛季所采用的大小分界，读懂排名离不开它，每一级都带有该级允许的记忆（`memory_flat_bytes` 和 `memory_cell_bytes`，没有时为 0）。它还带有五个计数：`entries`（参赛的模型数）、`active_versions`（天梯的规模）、`entered_versions`（历来提交的全部版本数）、`in_flight_versions`（正在审核中的数量）和 `matches_played`，后者**不含试赛**，因此与 `GET /v1/matches` 能查到的数目一致。`maps` 汇总赛季的地图：多少张启用、多少张未启用，以及启用的地图所覆盖的席位数和边长；`baselines` 以同样的方式汇总它的基线。`round` 是它所处的轮次（`{n, kind, games, started_at}`，`kind` 为 `round` 或 `finals`），`next_round` 是等待开始的下一次重置（`{n, kind, games, starts_at}`），没有时各为 null。见[赛季](../competing/seasons.md)。"

#: src/reference/api.md:94
msgid "A season's maps listing covers every board the season has, in play or not, because matches name them. For each it gives `map_id`, `players`, `rows`, `cols`, whether it is `enabled` (in play), `added_at` and the counted `matches` played on it. `?enabled=true` narrows it to the boards in play, and `?boards=true` adds each `board`: the map file as uploaded, unchanged, which is the same JSON a replay carries and a file `tinybrains` plays from a path. A board is public from the moment an admin uploads it."
msgstr "赛季的地图列表涵盖该赛季的每一张地图，无论启用与否，因为对局会引用它们。每张给出 `map_id`、`players`、`rows`、`cols`、是否 `enabled`（启用中）、`added_at`，以及在它上面进行过的计分 `matches` 数。`?enabled=true` 把结果收窄到启用中的地图，`?boards=true` 则为每张附上 `board`：上传时的地图文件原样不动，它与回放中携带的 JSON、以及 `tinybrains` 从路径读取并运行的文件是同一个。地图从管理员上传那一刻起就是公开的。"

#: src/reference/api.md:101
msgid "`rules` is the season's document, published whole: it is the contest you are entering. Who may enter is not a rule. `entry` says whether the season is restricted to its participants, and the roster itself, which names people, is readable only by the season's administrators."
msgstr "`rules` 是赛季的规则文档，整体公开：它就是你要参加的比赛。谁可以参赛不属于规则。`entry` 说明赛季是否仅限其参与者参加；而名单本身写着具体的人，只有赛季管理员能读取。"

#: src/reference/api.md:105
msgid "Private seasons"
msgstr "私有赛季"

#: src/reference/api.md:107
msgid "A private season is visible only to its participants, its season administrators and platform administrators. To anyone else every route answers as it would for a season that does not exist, and its versions and matches answer `404`. Its members read it through signed-in copies of the public reads: the same parameters and the same response shapes, under `/v1/private`, never cached. For a season the caller may not see, each answers exactly as the public route does."
msgstr "私有赛季只对它的参与者、它的赛季管理员和平台管理员可见。对其他任何人，每条路由的回答都与赛季不存在时一样，它的版本和对局都回答 `404`。成员通过公开读取的登录版来读它：参数相同、响应形状相同，位于 `/v1/private` 之下，从不缓存。对于调用者无权看到的赛季，每条路由的回答都与公开路由完全一致。"

