#: src/reference/api.md:157
msgid "A model detail reports its name, owner, whether it is retired, and every public version of it, newest first."
msgstr "模型详情给出它的名称、所有者、是否已退役，以及它的每一个公开版本，最新的在前。"

#: src/reference/api.md:160
msgid "A version detail reports its model, owner, game, version number, `class` and `class_max_bytes`, the memory its class allows and `memory_bytes`, `size_bytes`, `param_count`, measured `infer_us`, both hashes, `orion_version` (the runtime that admitted it), `season`, `status`, `phase`, `admit_attempt`, `successor`, `reject_reason`, `note`, the latest `trial`, `ratings`, `baseline`, `created_at` and `last_played_at`. Many fields stay null until admission produces them. `ratings` is keyed by ladder. `successor` is **the same model's** next version number, and appears only once this version is superseded."
msgstr "版本详情给出它的模型、所有者、游戏、版本号、`class` 和 `class_max_bytes`、该级允许的记忆和 `memory_bytes`、`size_bytes`、`param_count`、实测的 `infer_us`、两个哈希、`orion_version`（审核它的运行时）、`season`、`status`、`phase`、`admit_attempt`、`successor`、`reject_reason`、`note`、最近一次 `trial`、`ratings`、`baseline`、`created_at` 和 `last_played_at`。许多字段在审核产出它们之前一直为 null。`ratings` 按天梯为键。`successor` 是**同一模型**的下一个版本号，只在这个版本被取代后才出现。"

#: src/reference/api.md:168
msgid "**The public version route shows a version once it is on the ladder.** While yours is testing, verified or rejected, `GET /v1/versions/{id}` answers 404, and `GET /v1/me/versions/{id}` is where you read its phase, attempt and reason. The same split holds for matches: `GET /v1/matches/{id}` answers a finished public match and 404 for a trial or a queued pairing, which `GET /v1/me/matches/{id}` returns to its owner."
msgstr "**公开的版本路由只在版本上了天梯之后才显示它**。当你的版本还在审核中、等待试赛或已被拒绝时，`GET /v1/versions/{id}` 回答 404，要读它的阶段、尝试次数和原因，去 `GET /v1/me/versions/{id}`。对局也是同样的划分：`GET /v1/matches/{id}` 回答已结束的公开对局，对试赛或排队中的配对回答 404，而 `GET /v1/me/matches/{id}` 会把它们返回给所有者。"

#: src/reference/api.md:174
msgid "`GET /v1/matches` answers an object: `season`, `total`, `matches`, `sort` and `next_cursor`, each match a card with every seat's model, owner, rank and score. It lists finished and rated matches, newest first, and the trials of candidates that passed. Narrow it with `model` (every version of one) or `version` (one), `game`, `season`, `ladder`, `class`, `map`, `outcome`, `owner`, `players_min`, `players_max`, `vs` (two models that met), `since` and `top`, and order it with `sort`: `newest`, `closest`, `upset`, `longest` or `discussed`. Follow `next_cursor` for the next page."
msgstr "`GET /v1/matches` 回答一个对象：`season`、`total`、`matches`、`sort` 和 `next_cursor`，每场对局是一张卡片，带每个席位的模型、所有者、名次和得分。它列出已结束和已计分的对局，最新的在前，以及通过了试赛的候选版本的试赛。用 `model`（某个模型的每个版本）或 `version`（某一个版本）、`game`、`season`、`ladder`、`class`、`map`、`outcome`、`owner`、`players_min`、`players_max`、`vs`（交手过的两个模型）、`since` 和 `top` 来收窄，用 `sort` 排序：`newest`、`closest`、`upset`、`longest` 或 `discussed`。沿 `next_cursor` 翻到下一页。"

#: src/reference/api.md:182
msgid "**`GET /v1/me/matches` covers what that listing leaves out.** For your own matches it also returns queued, cancelled and failed rows and your trials, newest first by when each was played or, for one never played, created. Each row adds `withdrawn_reason` and `successor` for a cancellation, and `fault_reason` for a failure; each seat carries `mine`, so you can tell which side is yours in a match between two of your own models. It pages with `total` and a `next_cursor`."
msgstr "**`GET /v1/me/matches` 补上那个列表漏掉的部分**。对你自己的对局，它还会返回排队中、已取消和失败的行，以及你的试赛，按各自进行的时间排序，最新的在前；从未进行过的则按创建时间。每一行为取消的对局加上 `withdrawn_reason` 和 `successor`，为失败的对局加上 `fault_reason`；每个席位带有 `mine`，这样在你自己的两个模型之间的对局里，你也能分清哪一边是哪一个。它用 `total` 和 `next_cursor` 分页。"

#: src/reference/api.md:188
msgid "A match detail contains `seats`, `is_trial`, `engine_digest` and `orion_version`, `seed`, `map` (the board's id in its season), `reason`, `turns`, `played_at`, `played_ms`, `status`, the cancellation and failure fields, the ladder it counted on, and a temporary `replay_url` when a replay exists, signed for one hour. Each seat records its model and version, owner, class, rank, score, strikes, outcome and its `rating_change`. The version's `trial` field reports trial progress."
msgstr "对局详情包含 `seats`、`is_trial`、`engine_digest` 和 `orion_version`、`seed`、`map`（地图在其赛季中的 id）、`reason`、`turns`、`played_at`、`played_ms`、`status`、取消和失败相关的字段、它计分所在的天梯，以及存在回放时的临时 `replay_url`，签名有效期一小时。每个席位记录它的模型和版本、所有者、重量级、名次、得分、判罚次数、结果和它的 `rating_change`。版本的 `trial` 字段报告试赛进度。"

#: src/reference/api.md:195
msgid "`GET /v1/models/{id}` answers a null body for an unknown id rather than a 404; the version, match and profile routes answer `404 not_found`. Handle both."
msgstr "`GET /v1/models/{id}` 对未知的 id 回答一个 null 响应体而不是 404；版本、对局和个人主页路由则回答 `404 not_found`。两种情况都要处理。"

#: src/reference/api.md:198
msgid "Submitting"
msgstr "提交"

#: src/reference/api.md:200
msgid "**Ask before you post.** `GET /v1/games/{game}/submission?season=<slug>` reports your standing against that season's submission limits (how many models and versions you hold against each cap, whether a candidate of yours is already in flight, when a cooldown ends) in the words the refusal would use. One read tells you about a `409` before you hit it, except `weights_already_entered`, which needs the hash you post."
msgstr "**先问再提交。**`GET /v1/games/{game}/submission?season=<slug>` 用拒绝时会用的措辞，报告你相对于该赛季提交限制的状况（你在各项上限下持有多少模型和版本、你是否已有候选版本在处理中、冷却期何时结束）。读一次就能在撞上 `409` 之前知道它，只有 `weights_already_entered` 例外，它需要你提交的哈希。"

#: src/reference/api.md:206
msgid "`POST /v1/submissions` requires a session and this body shape:"
msgstr "`POST /v1/submissions` 需要会话，以及这样的请求体："

#: src/reference/api.md:211
msgid "\"summer-2026\""
msgstr "\"summer-2026\""

#: src/reference/api.md:212
msgid "\"<model UUID>\""
msgstr "\"<model UUID>\""

#: src/reference/api.md:213 src/reference/api.md:214
msgid "\"sha256:<64 hex digits>\""
msgstr "\"sha256:<64 位十六进制数字>\""

#: src/reference/api.md:215
msgid "\"note\""
msgstr "\"note\""

#: src/reference/api.md:215
msgid "\"optional: what changed in this version\""
msgstr "\"可选：这个版本改了什么\""

#: src/reference/api.md:219
msgid "`season` is the slug of the season the version enters, and left out it is the game's featured season. `model` is the `model_id` of an existing model of yours. Soma answers an unknown one with `404 unknown_model`; a submission never creates a model. A `note` is optional, at most a short paragraph, and refused with `400 note_too_long` or `422 note_word_listed`."
msgstr "`season` 是版本要进入的赛季的 slug，省略时是该游戏的精选赛季。`model` 是你已有的某个模型的 `model_id`。Soma 对未知的模型回答 `404 unknown_model`；提交从不会创建模型。`note` 可选，最多一小段，会以 `400 note_too_long` 或 `422 note_word_listed` 拒绝。"

#: src/reference/api.md:224
msgid "Replace the illustrative values with your model id and your hashes. The response is `201` with `version_id`, `model_id`, `model`, `version`, `status`, `season`, both hashes and `upload`. Soma records a testing version, which still has admission and its trial ahead of it before it reaches the ladder. **Posting the same two hashes again answers `200` for the same version with fresh upload URLs**, valid for what is left of the version's thirty-minute upload window; use it to recover a failed upload. See [Submitting a version](../competing/submitting.md) for a session-based example."
msgstr "把示例值换成你的模型 id 和你的哈希。响应是 `201`，带 `version_id`、`model_id`、`model`、`version`、`status`、`season`、两个哈希和 `upload`。Soma 记录下一个审核中的版本，它在上天梯之前还要经过审核和试赛。**再次提交同样的两个哈希，会对同一版本回答 `200` 并给出新的上传 URL**，有效期为该版本三十分钟上传窗口的剩余时间；用它来补救失败的上传。基于会话的示例见[提交版本](../competing/submitting.md)。"

#: src/reference/api.md:232
msgid "`POST /v1/submissions/reenter` requires a session and the body `{game, model, season, from}`. It enters your model `model` into the season `season` with its standing in the season `from` (its active version there, or the newest it had in play), over the same bytes: nothing is uploaded, and the answer carries no `upload`. The new version is `testing`, and admission and a trial judge it again under the new season's rules. It answers `201` with the new version, or `200` when that version is already in flight. It refuses a missing field with `400 reenter_invalid`, an entry with no version in play in `from` with `404 nothing_to_reenter`, and otherwise as a submission does. See [Moving to a new season](../competing/seasons.md#moving-to-a-new-season)."
msgstr "`POST /v1/submissions/reenter` 需要会话和请求体 `{game, model, season, from}`。它把你的模型 `model` 以它在赛季 `from` 中的状态（它在那里参赛中的版本，或它最近一个参过赛的版本）带入赛季 `season`，字节完全相同：不上传任何东西，回答中也没有 `upload`。新版本为 `testing`，审核和试赛会按新赛季的规则再判一次。它回答 `201` 和新版本，若该版本已在处理中则回答 `200`。缺少字段时以 `400 reenter_invalid` 拒绝，在 `from` 中没有参赛版本时以 `404 nothing_to_reenter` 拒绝，其余情况与提交相同。见[转入新赛季](../competing/seasons.md#moving-to-a-new-season)。"

