msgid "Errors and rate limits"
msgstr "错误与速率限制"

#: src/reference/api.md:264
msgid "Check the HTTP status before you read a success body. Soma refuses a request with `400` for missing hashes, a missing name or an overlong note, `401` for an invalid session, `404` for a model you do not have, `409` for season, eligibility, quota, cooldown, duplicate-weights or in-flight candidate conflicts, and `422` for a note or bio carrying a word the site lists. Error details differ depending on whether Soma or the runtime under it produced the response. The [rejection reference](rejection-reasons.md) separates request errors from later version verdicts."
msgstr "先检查 HTTP 状态码，再去读成功的响应体。Soma 拒绝请求时：缺少哈希、缺少名称或备注过长为 `400`，会话无效为 `401`，不属于你的模型为 `404`，赛季、资格、配额、冷却、重复权重或候选版本正在处理中的冲突为 `409`，备注或简介含有网站列入名单的词为 `422`。错误详情取决于响应是 Soma 还是它底下的运行时产生的，两者有所不同。[拒绝原因参考](rejection-reasons.md)把请求错误与之后的版本裁定分开说明。"

#: src/reference/api.md:271
msgid "Soma declares rate limits twice: per route, and per signed-in user on the routes with an account behind them."
msgstr "Soma 在两个层面声明速率限制：按路由，以及在有账户参与的路由上按已登录用户。"

#: src/reference/api.md:276
msgid "Every public route"
msgstr "每条公开路由"

#: src/reference/api.md:276
msgid "30 requests/second, burst 60"
msgstr "每秒 30 个请求，突发 60"

#: src/reference/api.md:277
msgid "Sign-in"
msgstr "登录"

#: src/reference/api.md:277
msgid "5 requests/second, burst 10"
msgstr "每秒 5 个请求，突发 10"

#: src/reference/api.md:278
msgid "Every session route"
msgstr "每条会话路由"

#: src/reference/api.md:278
msgid "20 requests/second, burst 40"
msgstr "每秒 20 个请求，突发 40"

#: src/reference/api.md:279
msgid "Per user, on reads: `/me`, `/models`, `/me/matches`, the submission preflight, the notification feed"
msgstr "按用户，读取：`/me`、`/models`、`/me/matches`、提交预检、通知流"

#: src/reference/api.md:279
msgid "10 requests/second, burst 20"
msgstr "每秒 10 个请求，突发 20"

#: src/reference/api.md:280
msgid "Per user, on writes: submission, model creation and editing, your profile, revoking a session, season administration"
msgstr "按用户，写入：提交、创建和编辑模型、你的个人主页、撤销会话、赛季管理"

#: src/reference/api.md:280
msgid "1 request/second, burst 5"
msgstr "每秒 1 个请求，突发 5"

#: src/reference/api.md:281
msgid "Per administrator, uploading and switching boards and baselines"
msgstr "按管理员，上传和切换地图与基线"

#: src/reference/api.md:281
msgid "5 requests/second, burst 40"
msgstr "每秒 5 个请求，突发 40"

#: src/reference/api.md:283
msgid "Back off on `429`, and respect any retry timing the response gives. These channels declare no daily submission allowance."
msgstr "遇到 `429` 就退避，并遵守响应给出的重试时间。这些频道没有声明每日提交额度。"

#: src/reference/api.md:286
msgid "Administrative routes"
msgstr "管理路由"

#: src/reference/api.md:288
msgid "None of these is a competitor action. Each needs a live session, and Soma checks the caller's standing on every request, so a removed administrator loses the route at their next call."
msgstr "这些都不是参赛者的操作。每一条都需要有效的会话，而且 Soma 在每个请求上都会检查调用者的身份，所以被移除的管理员在下一次调用时就会失去这条路由。"

#: src/reference/api.md:291
msgid "**A platform administrator** creates seasons and decides what spans the platform; anyone else gets `403 admin_only`:"
msgstr "**平台管理员**创建赛季，并决定平台范围内的事项；其他任何人都会得到 `403 admin_only`："

#: src/reference/api.md:294 src/reference/api.md:311
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: src/reference/api.md:296
msgid "Create a season: `name`, the window, `rules`, `weight_classes`, `visibility`, `entry`, `fleet`, `providers`, and optionally `admins` (handles)"
msgstr "创建赛季：`name`、提交窗口、`rules`、`weight_classes`、`visibility`、`entry`、`fleet`、`providers`，以及可选的 `admins`（用户名）"

#: src/reference/api.md:297
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/featured`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/featured`"

#: src/reference/api.md:297
msgid "Feature a public season: what every read that names no season resolves to"
msgstr "将公开赛季设为精选：所有未指明赛季的读取都会解析到它"

#: src/reference/api.md:298
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/fleet`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/fleet`"

#: src/reference/api.md:298
msgid "`{matches, admissions}`, each `own`, `platform` or `both`, while the season runs"
msgstr "`{matches, admissions}`，各为 `own`、`platform` 或 `both`，赛季进行期间可改"

#: src/reference/api.md:299
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/fill`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/fill`"

#: src/reference/api.md:299
msgid "The idle fill, while the season runs"
msgstr "空闲补赛，赛季进行期间可改"

#: src/reference/api.md:300 src/reference/api.md:320
msgid "GET, POST, PATCH"
msgstr "GET, POST, PATCH"

#: src/reference/api.md:300
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/rounds`, `.../rounds/{n}`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/rounds`、`.../rounds/{n}`"

#: src/reference/api.md:300
msgid "Rounds and the finals"
msgstr "轮次与决赛"

#: src/reference/api.md:301
msgid "POST, DELETE"
msgstr "POST, DELETE"

#: src/reference/api.md:301 src/reference/api.md:317
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/admins`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/admins`"

#: src/reference/api.md:301
msgid "Assign or remove a season administrator, by `handle`"
msgstr "按 `handle` 指派或移除赛季管理员"

#: src/reference/api.md:303
msgid "The rest of the platform desk lives under `/v1/admin/*` (announcements, the audit log, comment moderation, events, notifications, picks, posts, stories, threads, users and the word list), and `/v1/runner-keys` and `/v1/runners` hold the platform fleet."
msgstr "平台管理台的其余部分位于 `/v1/admin/*` 下（公告、审计日志、评论审核、事件、通知、精选、博客、模型文章、评论区、用户和词表），`/v1/runner-keys` 和 `/v1/runners` 则管理平台机群。"

#: src/reference/api.md:307
msgid "**A season's administrators**, and platform administrators, run one season through these routes. Any other caller is refused with `403 season_admin_only`, and a private season the caller may not see answers `404 unknown_season`, as one that does not exist would."
msgstr "**赛季管理员**和平台管理员通过这些路由运营一个赛季。其他任何调用者都会被以 `403 season_admin_only` 拒绝；调用者无权看到的私有赛季回答 `404 unknown_season`，与不存在的赛季一样。"

#: src/reference/api.md:313
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}`"

#: src/reference/api.md:313
msgid "Edit a `scheduled` season's window, rules and weight classes; never its name, visibility, entry or fleet"
msgstr "编辑 `scheduled` 赛季的提交窗口、规则和重量级；名称、可见性、参赛资格和机群永远不能改"

#: src/reference/api.md:314
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/entry`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/entry`"

#: src/reference/api.md:314
msgid "`{\"entry\": \"restricted\"}`: narrow a `scheduled` season's entry. One way, once, and never on a private season, which is restricted already"
msgstr "`{\"entry\": \"restricted\"}`：收窄 `scheduled` 赛季的参赛资格。只能单向、只能一次，而且不能用于私有赛季，它本来就是受限的"

#: src/reference/api.md:315
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/close`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/close`"

#: src/reference/api.md:315
msgid "Request the close, which the withdraw clock carries out within the minute"
msgstr "请求结束赛季，撤回时钟会在一分钟内执行"

#: src/reference/api.md:316
msgid "GET, POST, DELETE"
msgstr "GET, POST, DELETE"

#: src/reference/api.md:316
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/participants`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/participants`"

#: src/reference/api.md:316
msgid "The roster: add `{logins, provider?}` (one or many, `github` by default), remove `{id}`"
msgstr "参与者名单：添加 `{logins, provider?}`（一个或多个，默认 `github`），移除 `{id}`"

#: src/reference/api.md:317
msgid "The season's administrators"
msgstr "赛季的管理员"

#: src/reference/api.md:318
msgid "POST, PATCH"
msgstr "POST, PATCH"

#: src/reference/api.md:318
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/maps`, `.../maps/{map_id}`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/maps`、`.../maps/{map_id}`"

#: src/reference/api.md:318
msgid "Upload one board, which the game's own engine checks and Soma stores out of play; `{\"enabled\": true}` or `false` puts it in play or takes it out"
msgstr "上传一张地图，由游戏自己的引擎检查，Soma 以停用状态存储；`{\"enabled\": true}` 或 `false` 将它启用或停用"

#: src/reference/api.md:319
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/maps/import`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/maps/import`"

#: src/reference/api.md:319
msgid "`{from, maps?}`: copy another season's boards in, out of play"
msgstr "`{from, maps?}`：把另一个赛季的地图复制进来，处于停用状态"

#: src/reference/api.md:320
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/baselines`, `.../baselines/{baseline}`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/baselines`、`.../baselines/{baseline}`"

#: src/reference/api.md:320
msgid "List, upload (a `name` and the two hashes, answered with two upload URLs; admission handles it like a submission and it lands out of play), and switch a baseline"
msgstr "列出、上传（一个 `name` 和两个哈希，回答两个上传 URL；审核把它当作提交来处理，通过后处于停用状态）以及切换基线"

#: src/reference/api.md:321
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/baselines/import`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/baselines/import`"

#: src/reference/api.md:321
msgid "`{from, baselines?}`: admit another season's baselines again under this season's rules, out of play"
msgstr "`{from, baselines?}`：按本赛季的规则重新审核另一个赛季的基线，处于停用状态"

#: src/reference/api.md:322
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/runner-keys`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/runner-keys`"

#: src/reference/api.md:322
msgid "`{admissions, keys}`: whether the season's admission queue has anything to serve it (`queued`, `admitters`, `reach`), and its own runner keys with their runners; POST mints one, shown exactly once, which serves this season and no other"
msgstr "`{admissions, keys}`：赛季的审核队列是否有运行器可以处理它（`queued`、`admitters`、`reach`），以及它自己的运行器密钥和各自的运行器；POST 生成一个新密钥，只显示一次，仅服务于本赛季"

#: src/reference/api.md:323
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/runner-keys/{key}`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/runner-keys/{key}`"

#: src/reference/api.md:323
msgid "Revoke a key of this season"
msgstr "吊销本赛季的一个密钥"

#: src/reference/api.md:324
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/runners/{runner}`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/runners/{runner}`"

#: src/reference/api.md:324
msgid "Stop one runner of this season; its current match finishes"
msgstr "停止本赛季的一个运行器；它当前的对局会打完"

#: src/reference/api.md:325
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/notify`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/notify`"

#: src/reference/api.md:325
msgid "Tell the season's people something (`{subject, link?}`), and read past sends"
msgstr "向赛季的参与者发送通知（`{subject, link?}`），并读取过往的发送记录"

#: src/reference/api.md:326
msgid "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/audit`"
msgstr "`/v1/games/{game}/seasons/{slug}/audit`"

#: src/reference/api.md:326
msgid "Every administrative action on the season, newest first"
msgstr "对该赛季的每一项管理操作，最新的在前"

#: src/reference/api.md:328
msgid "Soma's workflows hold the request contracts. No route forces a match, promotes a version or withdraws your own version."
msgstr "请求契约在 Soma 的工作流里。没有任何路由能强制发起对局、晋级版本或撤回你自己的版本。"

#: src/reference/api.md:331
msgid "`GET /v1/admin-check` is an authorization probe: a reverse proxy calls it to decide whether to pass a request through to an operations console, and competitors have no use for it."
msgstr "`GET /v1/admin-check` 是一个授权探测：反向代理调用它来决定是否把请求放行到运维控制台，参赛者用不到它。"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:3
msgid "Term"
msgstr "术语"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:5
msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:5
msgid "The JSON answer for one seat's turn; in Ants, an ordered array of direction strings"
msgstr "一个席位在一个回合给出的 JSON 回答；在 Ants 中是有序的方向字符串数组"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:6
msgid "Active"
msgstr "参赛中"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:6
msgid "A version the matchmaker may schedule within its season"
msgstr "配对时钟可以在其赛季内为之安排对局的版本"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:7
msgid "One declarative program in a manifest: it turns the observation into one of the graph's input tensors"
msgstr "清单中的一段声明式程序：它把观测变成图的某个输入张量"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:8
msgid "The static and reference-case checks a candidate passes to become verified"
msgstr "候选版本要通过的静态检查和参考用例检查，通过后即进入已验证状态"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:9
msgid "Baseline"
msgstr "基线"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:9
msgid "An entry the platform provides, tagged as a baseline and uploaded into a season by its administrators; paired and rated like any other while in play, and the opponent in every trial"
msgstr "平台提供的参赛模型，标记为基线，由赛季管理员上传到赛季中；启用期间与其他参赛模型一样配对和评分，并且是每场试赛的对手"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:10
msgid "Basic board"
msgstr "基础地图"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:10
msgid "One of the five boards the Ants release ships, one of each size. They span the limits every season's board fits, and the reference set is drawn on them"
msgstr "Ants 发布版本自带的五张地图之一，每种尺寸一张。它们界定了每个赛季地图都必须落入的限制范围，参考集也取自它们"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:11
msgid "What a match is played on: a map file fixing its size, seats, terrain, hills and turn-zero food. A season's boards are its own; an admin uploads each, and it is public from upload"
msgstr "对局在其上进行的东西：一个地图文件，定下尺寸、席位、地形、蚁丘和开局食物。赛季的地图归赛季自己所有；每张由管理员上传，上传后即公开"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:12
msgid "Candidate"
msgstr "候选版本"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:12
msgid "A submitted version still testing or awaiting its trial verdict"
msgstr "已提交、仍在审核中或等待试赛裁定的版本"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:13
msgid "Cartridge"
msgstr "卡带"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:13
msgid "A game's rules, observations, scoring, generation, and replay reconstruction in a WebAssembly component"
msgstr "以 WebAssembly 组件封装的游戏规则、观测、计分、地图生成和回放重建"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:14
msgid "A version's assigned size category: Nano, Micro, Mini, Small, or Large"
msgstr "版本被归入的大小类别：Nano、Micro、Mini、Small 或 Large"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:15
msgid "Conservative rating"
msgstr "保守评分"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:15
msgid "Displayed strength estimate, `mu − 3 × sigma`"
msgstr "显示的实力估计，`mu − 3 × sigma`"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:16
msgid "datalogic"
msgstr "datalogic"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:16
msgid "The JSONLogic engine that evaluates an adapter, and the tensor operators it carries"
msgstr "对适配器求值的 JSONLogic 引擎，以及它自带的张量操作符"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:17
msgid "DataLogic Studio"
msgstr "DataLogic Studio"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:17
msgid "A JSONLogic editor and debugger, built on the same engine the arena runs an adapter on; it draws a program and runs its JSON half"
msgstr "JSONLogic 编辑器和调试器，建立在平台运行适配器所用的同一引擎上；它以图形方式展示程序，并运行程序的 JSON 部分"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:18
msgid "Engine digest"
msgstr "引擎摘要"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:18
msgid "Identity of the game component bytes used for a match"
msgstr "对局所用游戏组件字节的身份标识"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:19
msgid "Entry (season)"
msgstr "参赛资格（赛季）"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:19
msgid "Whether a season is open to anyone signed in or restricted to its participants"
msgstr "赛季是对任何已登录的人开放，还是仅限其参与者"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:20
msgid "Featured season"
msgstr "精选赛季"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:20
msgid "The public season a read or a submission that names no season is about: the one a platform administrator featured, else the newest live public season, else the newest public season"
msgstr "未指明赛季的读取或提交所针对的公开赛季：平台管理员设为精选的那个，否则是最新的进行中的公开赛季，再否则是最新的公开赛季"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:21
msgid "Fleet policy"
msgstr "机群策略"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:21
msgid "Which runners play a season's matches and admit its submissions: its own (season keys), the platform's, or both"
msgstr "由哪些运行器运行赛季的对局并审核它的提交：赛季自己的（赛季密钥）、平台的，或两者都用"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:22
msgid "Focus"
msgstr "集火"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:22
msgid "An Ants unit's count of enemies in attack range, used to resolve combat"
msgstr "Ants 中一只蚂蚁攻击范围内的敌人数量，用于判定战斗"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:23
msgid "Forfeit"
msgstr "判负"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:23
msgid "Platform-imposed last-place treatment after too many failed turn answers"
msgstr "回合回答失败次数过多后，平台强制按最后一名处理"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:24
msgid "Hill"
msgstr "蚁丘"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:24
msgid "A colony's spawn location and the objective that determines Ants score"
msgstr "蚁群的出生地点，也是决定 Ants 得分的目标"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:25
msgid "Hive"
msgstr "蚁巢"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:25
msgid "A colony's stored food, available for spawning on free hills"
msgstr "蚁群储存的食物，可用于在空闲的蚁丘上出生新蚂蚁"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:26
msgid "Initializer"
msgstr "初始化器"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:26
msgid "Stored tensor data in the ONNX graph. Its bytes are part of the file, and the file is half the size metric"
msgstr "ONNX 图中存储的张量数据。它的字节是文件的一部分，而文件是大小指标的一半"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:27 src/platform/architecture.md:16
msgid "Kalam"
msgstr "Kalam"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:27
msgid "Package that claims and executes matches and records replays"
msgstr "认领并执行对局、记录回放的包"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:28
msgid "Ladder"
msgstr "天梯"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:28
msgid "The Open rating that ranks every active version, optionally viewed filtered to one size class"
msgstr "为每个参赛中的版本排名的无差别级评分，可以按某一重量级筛选来查看"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:29
msgid "Manifest"
msgstr "清单"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:29
msgid "What you submit beside the graph: its inputs and outputs by name, dtype and shape, and one adapter per input"
msgstr "你随图一起提交的文件：按名称、数据类型和形状列出图的输入和输出，每个输入配一个适配器"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:30
msgid "Match"
msgstr "对局"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:30
msgid "One game among specified model versions, recorded from queueing through its outcome"
msgstr "指定的若干模型版本之间的一局游戏，从排队到结果全程记录"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:31
msgid "A competitor's entry: a name, and every version entered under it. Addressed by its id; a competitor may hold several"
msgstr "参赛者的参赛单位：一个名称，以及在它之下提交的每个版本。以 id 指代；一个参赛者可以持有多个"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:32
msgid "Model ID"
msgstr "模型 ID"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:32
msgid "UUID identifying one model. A node knows a version by a **different** id, derived from the version id"
msgstr "标识一个模型的 UUID。节点用一个**不同的** id 来识别版本，它由版本 id 派生而来"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:33
msgid "Observation"
msgstr "观测"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:33
msgid "The information a game gives one seat to choose its next action"
msgstr "游戏给一个席位用来选择下一步动作的信息"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:34
msgid "Open"
msgstr "无差别级"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:34
msgid "The single rated ladder, spanning every size; a weight class is a filtered view of it"
msgstr "唯一的计分天梯，涵盖所有大小；重量级是对它的筛选视图"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:35
msgid "Participant"
msgstr "参与者"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:35
msgid "An identity a restricted season admits: a sign-in provider and a login, or every identity of a provider"
msgstr "受限赛季准许参赛的身份：一种登录方式加一个登录名，或某种登录方式下的所有身份"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:36
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "定级"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:36
msgid "Early scheduling that gathers enough evidence about a new version"
msgstr "新版本早期的密集对局安排，用来收集足够的证据"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:37
msgid "Private season"
msgstr "私有赛季"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:37
msgid "A season visible only to its participants, its season administrators and platform administrators; to anyone else it does not exist"
msgstr "只对其参与者、赛季管理员和平台管理员可见的赛季；对其他任何人来说它不存在"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:38
msgid "Provisional"
msgstr "临时评分"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:38
msgid "A rating whose uncertainty exceeds the configured threshold"
msgstr "不确定度超过设定阈值的评分"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:39
msgid "Raze"
msgstr "摧毁"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:39
msgid "Destroy an enemy hill for good by surviving on it through combat"
msgstr "在战斗中存活并站上敌方蚁丘，将其永久摧毁"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:40
msgid "Replay"
msgstr "回放"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:40
msgid "The recorded initialization metadata and actions that rebuild a match"
msgstr "记录下来的初始化元数据和动作，可据此重建一场对局"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:41
msgid "RLE"
msgstr "RLE"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:41
msgid "Run-length encoding; Ants water uses alternating value/count pairs"
msgstr "游程编码；Ants 的水域用交替的值/计数对表示"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:42
msgid "Season"
msgstr "赛季"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:42
msgid "A game-specific competition with a submission window and retained standings. A game may run several at once"
msgstr "针对某个游戏的比赛，有提交窗口，排名会保留。一个游戏可以同时运行多个赛季"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:43
msgid "Season administrator"
msgstr "赛季管理员"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:43
msgid "A competitor a platform administrator assigns to run one season: its participants, boards, baselines and runners. May not enter that season"
msgstr "由平台管理员指派来运营一个赛季的参赛者：管理它的参与者、地图、基线和运行器。不能参加该赛季"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:44
msgid "Seat"
msgstr "席位"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:44
msgid "A player's position in one match; separate from account and model identity"
msgstr "一场对局中玩家的位置；与账户和模型身份无关"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:45
msgid "Seed"
msgstr "种子"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:45
msgid "Deterministic initialization input; meaningful with the matching game engine and board"
msgstr "确定性的初始化输入；只有配合对应的游戏引擎和地图才有意义"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:46
msgid "Slug"
msgstr "Slug"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:46
msgid "A season's address, derived from its name and never changed: \"Summer 2026\" is `summer-2026`"
msgstr "赛季的地址，由名称派生且永不改变：“Summer 2026” 就是 `summer-2026`"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:47
msgid "Settled"
msgstr "已稳定"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:47
msgid "Established enough under the rating and placement policy to need fewer scheduled matches"
msgstr "在评分和定级策略下已足够确定，因此需要安排的对局更少"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:48 src/platform/architecture.md:15
msgid "Soma"
msgstr "Soma"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:48
msgid "Public API, owner of the platform database schema, and five clocks: admit, pair, count (which also promotes), withdraw (which also closes seasons) and reap (which returns a lapsed lease to the queue)"
msgstr "公开 API、平台数据库模式的所有者，以及五个时钟：审核、配对、计分（兼管晋级）、撤回（兼管结束赛季）和回收（把过期的租约放回队列）"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:49
msgid "Strike"
msgstr "判罚"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:49
msgid "One failed turn answer counted toward a match forfeit"
msgstr "一次失败的回合回答，累计到一定次数即对局判负"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:50
msgid "Superseded"
msgstr "已被取代"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:50
msgid "A version replaced by a successful candidate **of the same model**, in the same season"
msgstr "在同一赛季中被**同一模型**的成功候选版本替换掉的版本"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:51
msgid "tract"
msgstr "tract"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:51
msgid "The pure-Rust ONNX runtime a node builds a plan with and runs the graph on"
msgstr "纯 Rust 的 ONNX 运行时，节点用它构建执行计划并运行图"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:52
msgid "Trial"
msgstr "试赛"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:52
msgid "An unrated match checking whether a verified candidate can play"
msgstr "一场不计分的对局，检验已验证的候选版本能否正常对局"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:53
msgid "Passed admission; a trial has not yet promoted it"
msgstr "已通过审核；尚未经试赛晋级"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:54
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:54
msgid "One submission of a model and a manifest, under one model, in one season. Version numbers restart per model and the platform assigns them"
msgstr "一次模型加清单的提交，隶属于一个模型、一个赛季。版本号按模型各自从头计数，由平台分配"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:55
msgid "Version ID"
msgstr "版本 ID"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:55
msgid "UUID identifying one version: what a seat, a rating and a replay point at"
msgstr "标识一个版本的 UUID：席位、评分和回放都指向它"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:56
msgid "Weight hash"
msgstr "权重哈希"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:56
msgid "SHA-256 of the exact ONNX file. You declare it at submission, and the node re-hashes what you uploaded against it"
msgstr "ONNX 文件本身的 SHA-256。你在提交时声明它，节点会对你上传的文件重新哈希并与之核对"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:57
msgid "Withdrawal"
msgstr "撤回"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:57
msgid "Cancellation of a queued match that is no longer eligible to play"
msgstr "取消一场已不再有资格进行的排队中对局"

#: src/reference/glossary.md:59
msgid "The [quickstart](../quickstart.md) has the entry sequence. For an exact number or error, see [limits](limits.md) or [rejection reasons](rejection-reasons.md)."
msgstr "[快速上手](../quickstart.md)有参赛的完整步骤。要查具体数字或错误，见[限制](limits.md)或[拒绝原因](rejection-reasons.md)。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:3
msgid "A competitor's loop is submit, verify, trial, compete and review. The platform splits accepting requests, deciding which games to play, playing them and running models into separate parts, so each part scales to its own load."
msgstr "参赛者的循环是：提交、验证、试赛、比赛、复盘。平台把接收请求、决定打哪些对局、进行对局和运行模型拆成独立的部分，让每个部分按各自的负载伸缩。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:7
msgid "This chapter is for contributors and local operators. You can enter a hosted competition without deploying any of it."
msgstr "本章面向贡献者和在本地运行平台的人。参加托管的比赛不需要部署这里的任何东西。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:10
msgid "The parts"
msgstr "组成部分"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:12
msgid "Part"
msgstr "部分"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:12
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:14 src/platform/contributing.md:52
msgid "Web"
msgstr "Web"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:14
msgid "The browser application: sign-in, the leaderboard, matches and replays, submission and upload, the season's own pages and the site's community pages"
msgstr "浏览器应用：登录、排行榜、对局与回放、提交与上传、赛季自己的页面，以及网站的社区页面"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:15
msgid "Public HTTP API, sessions, submissions, seasons, the runner gate and the shared schema, plus five clocks: admit, pair, count, withdraw and reap"
msgstr "公开 HTTP API、会话、提交、赛季、运行器网关和共享的数据库模式，外加五个时钟：admit、pair、count、withdraw 和 reap"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:16
msgid "Claims matches, plays turns, records results and replays. An admitting runner also runs each submission's admission for Soma to judge"
msgstr "认领对局、进行回合、记录结果和回放。审核运行器还会运行每次提交的审核，交由 Soma 裁定"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:17
msgid "Deterministic game cartridge, and its replay viewer"
msgstr "确定性的游戏卡带，及其回放查看器"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:18
msgid "Orion's `models` entity"
msgstr "Orion 的 `models` 实体"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:18
msgid "Adapter evaluation and ONNX inference, **inside whichever node needs it**"
msgstr "适配器求值和 ONNX 推理，**在任何需要它的节点内部**"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:19
msgid "`tinybrains` (the CLI)"
msgstr "`tinybrains`（CLI）"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:19
msgid "The same match loop on a laptop, with no server: for competitors, and for checking the ladder's"
msgstr "同一套对局循环，在笔记本上运行，不需要服务器：供参赛者使用，也用来检验天梯的那一套"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:20
msgid "`ants-starter`"
msgstr "`ants-starter`"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:20
msgid "The one repository a competitor clones: a working entry, its training script and the trained opponents"
msgstr "参赛者要克隆的唯一仓库：一个可以直接参赛的模型、它的训练脚本和训练好的对手"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:22
msgid "**Soma and Kalam ship no server code.** Each is a package for [Orion](https://github.com/GoPlasmatic/Orion) (channel and workflow definitions, SQL, connectors and small wasm plugins) and ships as an image of the Orion server, which loads the package at boot."
msgstr "**Soma 和 Kalam 不包含任何服务端代码**。两者都是 [Orion](https://github.com/GoPlasmatic/Orion) 的包（频道和工作流定义、SQL、连接器和小型 wasm 插件），以 Orion 服务器镜像的形式发布，服务器在启动时加载这个包。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:26
msgid "**There is no model-runner service.** A model is a governed entity of the Orion server itself: a row holding a manifest and an artifact reference (a storage connector, an object key and a `sha256:` digest). The node fetches the object, re-hashes it, reads the graph and serves it from an LRU session cache under `tract`. Only Kalam runs models: an admitting runner to admit them, every other replica to play them. The Soma node serves the site and holds the database owner, and never parses a competitor's model."
msgstr "**没有独立的模型运行服务**。模型是 Orion 服务器自身管理的实体：一行记录，保存着清单和模型文件的引用（一个存储连接器、一个对象键和一个 `sha256:` 摘要）。节点获取该对象，重新计算哈希，读取计算图，然后通过 `tract` 从 LRU 会话缓存中提供服务。只有 Kalam 运行模型：审核运行器负责审核它们，其他每个副本负责用它们比赛。Soma 节点提供网站服务并持有数据库所有者角色，从不解析参赛者的模型。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:33
msgid "Postgres stores versions, seasons, match rows, seats and rating events. Object storage holds the two submitted files and the replay blobs. The [repository map](repositories.md) names the code for each component."
msgstr "Postgres 存储版本、赛季、对局记录、席位和评分事件。对象存储保存提交的两个文件和回放文件。[仓库地图](repositories.md)指出了每个组件对应的代码。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:37
msgid "One match table between scheduling and execution"
msgstr "调度与执行之间只有一张对局表"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:39
msgid "Soma's pair clock inserts a pending match and its seats. Kalam claims that row, plays it, and finishes it with results, a replay key and the match's last frame. Soma's count clock then counts the result and marks the row rated. The row serves as both the queue item and the durable history: the platform has no message broker, and no clock calls Kalam to dispatch a match."
msgstr "Soma 的 pair 时钟插入一场待进行的对局及其席位。Kalam 认领这一行，进行对局，然后写入结果、回放键和对局的最后一帧来完成它。随后 Soma 的 count 时钟计入结果，并把这一行标记为已评分。这一行既是队列项，也是持久的历史记录：平台没有消息代理，也没有任何时钟会调用 Kalam 去分派对局。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:44
msgid "Claims carry leases and tokens, so the platform can recover a lost worker's match, and a stale worker cannot finish someone else's attempt. The clocks fence their writes with run fences and a roster epoch, so stale scheduling or rating work cannot change the field. Together they keep a competitor's history free of duplicate or misattributed results."
msgstr "认领带有租约和令牌，所以平台能收回失联工作节点手上的对局，而过期的工作节点也无法完成别人的尝试。时钟用运行栅栏和名册纪元来隔离自己的写入，所以过期的调度或评分工作无法改动赛况。两者合在一起，让参赛者的历史记录中不会出现重复或归属错误的结果。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:49
msgid "The clocks"
msgstr "时钟"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:51
msgid "Soma's five cron clocks make every competitive decision, and no other part of the platform makes one. Each clock runs as a single instance across Soma's nodes."
msgstr "Soma 的五个定时时钟做出每一项竞赛决定，平台的其他部分不做任何决定。每个时钟在 Soma 的所有节点上只运行一个实例。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:54
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "时钟"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:54
msgid "Every"
msgstr "周期"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:54
msgid "Decides"
msgstr "决定"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:56
msgid "admit"
msgstr "admit"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:56
msgid "20 s"
msgstr "20 s"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:56
msgid "Whether to admit an uploaded submission (or an admin's baseline): check the upload and the manifest and queue it for an admitting runner, then apply the platform's policy to what that runner reports"
msgstr "是否让上传的提交（或管理员的基线）通过审核：检查上传内容和清单，排队交给审核运行器，再对该运行器的报告应用平台的策略"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:57
msgid "pair"
msgstr "pair"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:57 src/platform/architecture.md:60
msgid "15 s"
msgstr "15 s"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:57
msgid "Which matches to queue: a waiting candidate's trial first, then what the ladder's demand asks for, on the season's boards in play"
msgstr "把哪些对局排入队列：先是等待中候选版本的试赛，然后是天梯需求所要求的对局，都在赛季启用中的地图上进行"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:58
msgid "count"
msgstr "count"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:58
msgid "10 s"
msgstr "10 s"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:58
msgid "Folds each finished match into ratings, and decides each finished trial: promote or reject"
msgstr "把每场结束的对局计入评分，并裁定每场结束的试赛：晋级或拒绝"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:59
msgid "withdraw"
msgstr "withdraw"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:59
msgid "60 s"
msgstr "60 s"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:59
msgid "Cancels queued matches nobody can play any more, and closes a season once it has settled"
msgstr "取消已无人能进行的排队对局，并在赛季结算完成后结束它"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:60
msgid "reap"
msgstr "reap"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:60
msgid "Returns a claimed match whose lease lapsed (its runner crashed or went quiet) to the queue, and fails it as `LEASE_LAPSED` on the third lapse"
msgstr "把租约已失效（运行器崩溃或失去响应）的已认领对局放回队列，第三次失效时将其判为失败，原因为 `LEASE_LAPSED`"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:62
msgid "A clock does its work in SQL against the shared schema. Two wasm plugins hold the arithmetic SQL is poor at, `tb.rating` (TrueSkill) and `tb.pairing` (who plays whom), and decide nothing the clock does not write. [The life of a version](../competing/version-life.md) follows a version through the clocks as a competitor sees it. `disabled` is a baseline's state alone: the baseline stays out of play until an administrator enables it."
msgstr "时钟的工作都是对共享数据库模式执行的 SQL。两个 wasm 插件承担 SQL 不擅长的运算，`tb.rating`（TrueSkill）和 `tb.pairing`（谁和谁打）；它们做出的每个决定都由时钟写入，此外不决定任何事情。[版本的生命周期](../competing/version-life.md)从参赛者的视角跟随一个版本走过这些时钟。`disabled` 是基线独有的状态：基线在管理员启用之前一直不参赛。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:70
msgid "A platform administrator creates a season for one game, with a window and its rules, and the platform addresses it by its slug everywhere. A game may run several seasons at once; a read that names none resolves the game's featured public season. A season's window sets its state (scheduled, open, then settling after submissions close), and the withdraw clock closes it once every score has settled, or when its administrators ask. Standings stay readable after the close."
msgstr "平台管理员为一个游戏创建赛季，设定时间窗口和规则，平台在所有地方都用 slug 来指代它。一个游戏可以同时运行多个赛季；没有指明赛季的读取会解析为该游戏精选的公开赛季。赛季的时间窗口决定它的状态（未开始、进行中，提交截止后为结算中），当每个评分都稳定后，或在赛季管理员请求时，withdraw 时钟结束它。结束后排名仍可查看。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:76
msgid "**A season is public or private, and its entry open or restricted.** A restricted season admits the participants its administrators list; a private one is visible only to them, its administrators and platform administrators, and to anyone else every route answers as for a season that does not exist. The same statements serve both kinds of read: a public route runs them with no viewer and is cached, and its signed-in copy under `/v1/private` runs them with the session's viewer and is not."
msgstr "**赛季分公开和私有，参赛资格分开放和受限**。受限赛季只接纳其管理员列出的参与者；私有赛季只对这些参与者、赛季管理员和平台管理员可见，对其他任何人，每个路由的回应都和赛季不存在时一样。两种读取用的是同一组语句：公开路由在没有查看者的情况下运行它们并缓存结果，而 `/v1/private` 下登录后的副本以会话的查看者身份运行它们，不缓存。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:82
msgid "**A season has its own administrators.** A platform administrator assigns them, and they run that one season (its participants, boards, baselines, runners and messages) without any platform role. A season administrator may not enter the season they run."
msgstr "**赛季有自己的管理员**。由平台管理员指定，他们只运营这一个赛季（它的参与者、地图、基线、运行器和消息），不持有任何平台角色。赛季管理员不能参加自己运营的赛季。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:86
msgid "**A season's administrators upload its boards and baselines into it, and no release ships them.** Soma checks a board file with the season's own engine, and the admit clock admits a baseline's two files like any submission. Both land switched off, and the administrator turns each on or off until the close. Every season's board must fit inside the envelope of the five basic boards in the Ants release, so a model admitted today can play any board an administrator adds later. A new season starts empty and imports another season's boards and baselines, and a competitor re-enters an entry with the same bytes, which admission and a trial judge again under the new season."
msgstr "**赛季的地图和基线由赛季管理员上传进去，没有任何发布版本附带它们**。Soma 用赛季自己的引擎检查地图文件，admit 时钟像审核任何提交一样审核基线的两个文件。两者上传后都处于停用状态，管理员可以在赛季结束前随时启用或停用。每个赛季的地图都必须落在 Ants 发布版本中五张基础地图的范围之内，所以今天通过审核的模型能打管理员日后添加的任何地图。新赛季从空白开始，导入另一个赛季的地图和基线；参赛者用一字节不差的同一份文件重新参赛，审核和试赛会在新赛季下再判一次。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:94
msgid "[Seasons](../competing/seasons.md), [The trial](../competing/trial.md) and [Ranking](../competing/ranking.md) set out the rules competitors play under."
msgstr "[赛季](../competing/seasons.md)、[试赛](../competing/trial.md)和[排名](../competing/ranking.md)列出了参赛者参赛所遵循的规则。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:97
msgid "Runners and the runner gate"
msgstr "运行器与运行器网关"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:99
msgid "A Kalam **runner** is one Orion node playing several matches at once: two unless its deployment sets more, up to sixty-four. It holds no database password and no bucket secret: it exchanges a runner key for a short-lived token, reporting how many matches it can hold, then claims, renews, finishes and releases matches through Soma's **runner gate** (`/v1/runner/*`). The gate's routes are the claim statements themselves and hold no state, and the gate's database role, `runner_gate`, reaches only the execution columns. You can put a runner on a desk anywhere, and a compromised one can at worst play poor moves. The claim carries every term the match is played under (the board, the turn deadline, the turn limit, the strike limit a seat forfeits at, and how many times a node may refuse the row), taken from the season that owns the match."
msgstr "Kalam **运行器**是一个同时进行多场对局的 Orion 节点：默认两场，部署可以设得更多，最多六十四场。它不持有数据库密码，也不持有存储桶密钥：它用运行器密钥换取一个短期令牌，同时报告自己能承接多少场对局，然后通过 Soma 的**运行器网关**（`/v1/runner/*`）认领、续约、完成和释放对局。网关的路由就是认领语句本身，不保存任何状态；网关的数据库角色 `runner_gate` 只能访问执行相关的列。你可以把运行器放在任何地方的一张办公桌上，一个被攻破的运行器最多也只能走出糟糕的棋。认领携带对局所遵循的每一项条款（地图、回合时限、回合上限、席位被判负的判罚上限，以及节点可以拒绝这一行的次数），都取自拥有这场对局的赛季。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:109
msgid "**A runner key belongs to the platform fleet or to one season.** A platform key's runners play any season whose fleet policy allows the platform; a season key, minted by that season's administrators, serves that season and no other, for matches or admissions as its policy (`own`, `platform` or `both`) allows. The gate checks the policy on every claim, so a platform administrator can hand a season to the platform fleet while it runs, and a compromised season key can at worst play its own ladder."
msgstr "**运行器密钥要么属于平台机群，要么属于某一个赛季**。持平台密钥的运行器可以打任何机群策略允许平台参与的赛季；由赛季管理员生成的赛季密钥只服务于该赛季，按其策略（`own`、`platform` 或 `both`）的允许范围进行对局或审核。网关在每次认领时都检查该策略，所以平台管理员可以在赛季进行中把它交给平台机群，而被攻破的赛季密钥最多也只能在它自己的天梯上比赛。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:116
msgid "What one entry touches"
msgstr "一次参赛会经过什么"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:118
msgid "Web or an authenticated client asks Soma to record two hashes. Soma answers with two presigned `PUT` URLs, and **the competitor uploads**: nothing on the platform fetches from the internet."
msgstr "Web 或已认证的客户端请 Soma 记录两个哈希。Soma 回应两个预签名 `PUT` URL，然后**由参赛者上传**：平台上没有任何东西会从互联网抓取文件。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:120
msgid "Soma's admission clock checks that both files arrived and that the manifest hashes to what the competitor declared, rebuilds the registration from it, and queues the version for an admitting runner."
msgstr "Soma 的 admit 时钟检查两个文件都已到达、清单的哈希与参赛者声明的一致，据此重建注册信息，并把该版本排队交给审核运行器。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:123
msgid "An admitting Kalam runner claims it through the runner gate, registers it on its own node, runs the node's admission (fetch, re-hash, read the graph, probe it), plays it over the game's reference observations, deletes it and reports what it measured. The admission clock applies the platform's policy to that report and verifies the candidate, and the pair clock queues its trial."
msgstr "一个 Kalam 审核运行器通过运行器网关认领它，在自己的节点上注册它，运行节点的审核（获取、重新计算哈希、读取计算图、探测），在游戏的参考观测上运行它，然后删除它并报告测得的结果。admit 时钟对这份报告应用平台的策略，验证这个候选版本，然后 pair 时钟把它的试赛排入队列。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:127
msgid "Each Kalam replica's roster clock registers, admits and activates the version **on its own node**, from the database. No clock ever calls a replica."
msgstr "每个 Kalam 副本的 roster 时钟根据数据库，**在自己的节点上**注册、审核并激活该版本。没有任何时钟会调用副本。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:129
msgid "Kalam claims one match row and confirms its node can serve every seat's model."
msgstr "Kalam 认领一行对局记录，并确认自己的节点能够提供每个席位的模型。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:130
msgid "Ants produces observations; one `model_infer` per seat adapts, runs and returns tensors; Kalam reads the policy head and hands Ants the actions. Kalam repeats the turn until the match ends."
msgstr "Ants 生成观测；每个席位一次 `model_infer`，完成适配、运行并返回张量；Kalam 读取策略头，把动作交给 Ants。Kalam 重复这个回合直到对局结束。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:132
msgid "Kalam uploads the replay and records the result, with the match's last frame, under its claim token."
msgstr "Kalam 上传回放，并用自己的认领令牌记录结果和对局的最后一帧。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:134
msgid "Soma's count clock counts the result or decides the trial. A trial pass promotes the version; later ordinary matches update its ratings."
msgstr "Soma 的 count 时钟计入结果或裁定试赛。试赛通过即让版本晋级；之后的常规对局更新它的评分。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:136
msgid "Soma exposes version status, match results, standings, and signed replay reads."
msgstr "Soma 提供版本状态、对局结果、排名，以及带签名的回放读取。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:138
msgid "Outside the cartridge, game state is opaque. An adapter is submitted data that the node's expression engine evaluates; a competitor uploads no workflow. **Tensors never leave the model call**, with one exception: the policy head. A result expression's document holds only the output tensors, so it cannot gather at a unit's cells. The gather is a rule of the game: Kalam performs it, and no competitor writes it."
msgstr "在卡带之外，游戏状态是不透明的。适配器是提交上来的数据，由节点的表达式引擎求值；参赛者不上传任何工作流。**张量从不离开模型调用**，只有一个例外：策略头。result 表达式的文档只包含输出张量，所以它无法按单位所在的格子取值。这一取值（gather）是游戏规则的一部分：由 Kalam 执行，没有参赛者需要写它。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:144
msgid "Releases and the engine digest"
msgstr "发布版本与引擎摘要"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:146
msgid "Every repository publishes its own artifact and commits nothing generated. **Ants publishes a GitHub release**: the component, its manifests, the basic boards and the viewer, in one archive named after the component's digest. Soma, Kalam and Web publish images from a version tag; the CLI publishes binaries and a Homebrew formula."
msgstr "每个仓库发布自己的产物，不提交任何生成出来的东西。**Ants 发布的是 GitHub 发布版本**：组件、它的清单、基础地图和查看器，打成一个以组件摘要命名的压缩包。Soma、Kalam 和 Web 从版本标签发布镜像；CLI 发布二进制文件和一个 Homebrew 配方。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:151
msgid "**One Ants release is the ladder's engine.** Soma's image declares its digest and judges boards with it, each runner plays it, the site's viewer and this book re-simulate replays with it, and the starter kit pins it for competitors. They must agree. A runner on another digest claims nothing, and a viewer built from another engine draws a plausible match that never happened. Publishing an Ants release deploys it, so a deployment under a live season pins the release its images came from."
msgstr "**天梯的引擎就是某一个 Ants 发布版本**。Soma 的镜像声明它的摘要并用它评判地图，每个运行器用它比赛，网站的查看器和本书用它重新模拟回放，入门套件为参赛者锁定它。它们必须一致。摘要不同的运行器什么也认领不到，用另一个引擎构建的查看器会画出一场看似合理却从未发生过的对局。发布一个 Ants 发布版本就等于部署它，所以赛季进行中的部署要锁定其镜像所来自的发布版本。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:157
msgid "Deployment and scaling"
msgstr "部署与伸缩"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:159
msgid "The local stack hosts Soma (its routes and its clocks) on one Orion instance using shared Postgres runtime state and Redis. **Each Kalam replica is its own Orion**: a single instance with local state and no cluster block. The stack runs no sidecars."
msgstr "本地平台把 Soma（它的路由和时钟）托管在一个 Orion 实例上，使用共享的 Postgres 运行时状态和 Redis。**每个 Kalam 副本都是独立的 Orion**：单个实例，状态在本地，没有集群配置块。平台不运行任何边车服务。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:163
msgid "Shared scheduler state coordinates Soma's clocks across hosts. Each Kalam replica keeps its own state, so several replicas play matches at once without contending for one global lock. For the same reason, each replica's own clock registers a model on it, and nothing pushes a model to a replica. A model is a per-node entity, and the database keeps the fleet in agreement."
msgstr "共享的调度器状态让 Soma 的时钟跨主机协调。每个 Kalam 副本保存自己的状态，所以多个副本可以同时进行对局，而不必争抢一把全局锁。出于同样的原因，模型由每个副本自己的时钟在该副本上注册，没有任何东西会把模型推送到副本。模型是节点各自的实体，由数据库来保持整个机群一致。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:168
msgid "**One bucket, two addresses.** Soma signs a competitor's upload for the public endpoint, and every node fetches by the internal one. SigV4 signs the host, so a single variable for both gives a URL only one side can use."
msgstr "**一个存储桶，两个地址**。Soma 为参赛者的上传按公开接口签名，而每个节点通过内部接口获取。SigV4 会把主机名一起签进去，所以两者共用一个变量，得到的 URL 只有一方能用。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:172
msgid "Every plugin and cartridge component carries an Ed25519 signature over its digest. Whoever holds the deployment's trust key mints it, and a node quarantines the channels that need a component it cannot verify."
msgstr "每个插件和卡带组件都带有一个对其摘要的 Ed25519 签名。签名由持有该部署信任密钥的人生成；节点会隔离那些依赖无法验证的组件的频道。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:176
msgid "Compose is the deployment path, locally and in production, where a second compose file puts Caddy in front and takes the database and the buckets from managed services. Nothing autoscales, and a release is deployed by hand."
msgstr "无论本地还是生产环境，部署路径都是 Compose；生产环境用第二个 compose 文件在前面放一个 Caddy，并从托管服务获取数据库和存储桶。没有任何东西会自动伸缩，发布版本靠手动部署。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:180
msgid "Boundaries to preserve"
msgstr "必须守住的边界"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:182
msgid "Only Soma's count clock writes competitive rating updates. A runner holds no database credential: the gate runs its statements as `runner_gate`, which reaches only execution fields, runner identity and the admission report, plus a column-level read of the roster that cannot see a verdict or a rating. Nodes fetch an artifact by digest, so you can prove that what plays is what Soma admitted. The platform can withdraw queued matches, but a match already running stays attributed to the versions it paired. Replays and match records keep the engine digest and the Orion version you need to investigate an outcome."
msgstr "只有 Soma 的 count 时钟会写入竞赛评分的更新。运行器不持有任何数据库凭据：网关以 `runner_gate` 身份运行它的语句，这个角色只能访问执行字段、运行器身份和审核报告，外加对名册的列级读取，看不到裁定结果和评分。节点按摘要获取模型文件，所以你可以证明参赛的就是 Soma 审核通过的那一个。平台可以撤回排队中的对局，但已经在进行的对局仍归属于配对时的那些版本。回放和对局记录保留引擎摘要和 Orion 版本，供你追查某个结果时使用。"

#: src/platform/architecture.md:190
msgid "If you change a boundary, test its producer and consumer together. A package that loads and a health endpoint that answers prove nothing about the admission, match or replay loop."
msgstr "如果你改动了某条边界，要把它的生产方和消费方放在一起测试。包能加载、健康检查接口能应答，并不能证明审核、对局或回放的流程没有问题。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:3
msgid "TinyBrains lives in sibling repositories. To compete, you keep your model in a repository of your own, apart from all of these. Use this map to inspect how the platform behaves or to contribute a change to it."
msgstr "TinyBrains 分布在几个并列的仓库中。参赛时，你的模型放在自己的仓库里，与这些仓库都无关。用这份地图来了解平台的行为，或为它贡献改动。"

