#: src/platform/repositories.md:18
msgid "The three you can read as a competitor"
msgstr "参赛者可以阅读的三个仓库"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:20
msgid "None of these runs in the platform, and all three are written for you."
msgstr "这三个都不在平台中运行，而且都是为你写的。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:22 src/platform/contributing.md:10
msgid "Where"
msgstr "位置"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:24
msgid "[cli](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/cli)"
msgstr "[cli](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/cli)"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:24
msgid "**The `tinybrains` binary**: matches, admission's checks, `conform` and the training environment, released for macOS, Linux and Windows and installed with Homebrew. `src/wave.rs` is its copy of Kalam's match loop, and `src/matchfile.rs` the match-file format"
msgstr "**`tinybrains` 二进制文件**：对局、审核的各项检查、`conform` 和训练环境，为 macOS、Linux 和 Windows 发布，用 Homebrew 安装。`src/wave.rs` 是它对 Kalam 对局循环的复刻，`src/matchfile.rs` 是对局文件格式"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:25
msgid "[ants-starter](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/ants-starter)"
msgstr "[ants-starter](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/ants-starter)"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:25
msgid "**The Ants starter kit**: a working nano entry that admits unchanged, `train.py` (the one command that retrains it), three trained opponents in `models/` and two match files. Start here: it is the one repository to clone, and every game gets a `<game>-starter`"
msgstr "**Ants 入门套件**：一个不做修改就能通过审核的 nano 参赛模型、`train.py`（重新训练它的唯一命令）、`models/` 中三个训练好的对手和两个对局文件。从这里开始：它是唯一需要克隆的仓库，每个游戏都有一个 `<game>-starter`"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:26
msgid "[ants/baselines](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/ants/tree/main/baselines)"
msgstr "[ants/baselines](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/ants/tree/main/baselines)"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:26
msgid "How the platform's entries are trained: the encoding, the teacher, the learners and the export, beside the rules they encode. It commits no model: the trained ones live in the starter, and an administrator uploads a season's baselines into the season. The starter's `requirements.txt` installs it as a library, and `train.py` runs it. The [walkthrough](../models/adapters/walkthrough.md) reads its manifest from `src/tb_baselines/planes.py`"
msgstr "平台自带的参赛模型是如何训练的：编码、教师、学习者和导出，就放在它们所编码的规则旁边。它不提交任何模型：训练好的模型在入门套件里，赛季的基线由管理员上传到赛季中。入门套件的 `requirements.txt` 把它作为库安装，`train.py` 运行它。[逐步讲解](../models/adapters/walkthrough.md)从 `src/tb_baselines/planes.py` 读取它的清单"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:28
msgid "Orion's own `models` entity does ONNX loading, the expression language and the operation budget, so there is no model-runner repository. Soma's clocks do admission, pairing, counting, withdrawal and lease reaping, so there is no match-maker repository either."
msgstr "Orion 自己的 `models` 实体负责 ONNX 加载、表达式语言和操作预算，所以没有模型运行器仓库。Soma 的时钟负责审核、配对、计分、撤回和租约回收，所以也没有对局调度仓库。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:32
msgid "Which repository owns a change?"
msgstr "改动归哪个仓库？"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:34
msgid "A rule or observation change belongs in Ants, with matching competitor docs and adapter compatibility checks. **An evaluator operator or operation-count change belongs upstream**, in datalogic. This platform cannot make it, so the operator reference points at what the engine has and keeps no list of its own. A submission check can span Soma's request contract, the admission clock's verdict and the facts the node reports: identify each responsibility before you edit."
msgstr "规则或观测的改动属于 Ants，并要配上相应的参赛者文档和适配器兼容性检查。**求值器操作符或操作计数的改动属于上游**，即 datalogic。本平台无法做这种改动，所以操作符参考只指向引擎实际拥有的内容，自己不维护列表。一项提交检查可能横跨 Soma 的请求契约、admit 时钟的裁定和节点报告的事实：动手修改前先弄清每一部分的职责。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:40
msgid "Match execution and result persistence belong in Kalam; rating math and opponent selection belong in Soma's clocks and plugins. Soma owns every database definition, whichever package consumes it. Deployment addresses and secrets belong in each image's environment, and never in package definitions."
msgstr "对局执行和结果持久化属于 Kalam；评分计算和对手选择属于 Soma 的时钟和插件。每一条数据库定义都归 Soma，无论哪个包使用它。部署地址和机密信息属于各个镜像的环境变量，绝不放进包定义里。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:45
msgid "Generated artifacts ship as releases and images"
msgstr "生成的产物以发布版本和镜像的形式交付"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:47
msgid "**No repository commits what it generates.** Each ships its own build output (Ants' `tb-ants.wasm`, `cartridge.json` and viewer bundle, and the wasm plugins), and a consumer names the artifact it takes and reads no sibling checkout. **Ants publishes a GitHub release**: its `build` workflow runs the gate on every push, and on request packs every artifact into one archive tagged after the engine it carries. Soma, Kalam and Web ship images their `Dockerfile`s build. Soma's and Kalam's packages are **authored JSON, committed whole**: channels, workflows, connectors, and in Soma the `sql/` files its workflows name. Kalam ships no SQL, because every statement a runner needs is a call to Soma's gate. Neither has a generator: `orion-server compile` resolves the authoring forms (`$from`, `$use`, `$each`, `$sql`) into what the admin API accepts."
msgstr "**没有任何仓库会提交自己生成的东西。**每个仓库交付自己的构建产物（Ants 的 `tb-ants.wasm`、`cartridge.json` 和查看器包，以及 wasm 插件），使用方指明自己要取的产物，不读取任何并列的检出目录。**Ants 发布的是 GitHub 发布版本**：它的 `build` 工作流在每次推送时运行质量门禁，并在需要时把所有产物打成一个压缩包，以它所携带的引擎为标签。Soma、Kalam 和 Web 交付各自 `Dockerfile` 构建出的镜像。Soma 和 Kalam 的包是**手写的 JSON，整体提交**：频道、工作流、连接器，以及 Soma 中其工作流所指名的 `sql/` 文件。Kalam 不带任何 SQL，因为运行器需要的每条语句都是对 Soma 网关的一次调用。两者都没有生成器：`orion-server compile` 把编写形式（`$from`、`$use`、`$each`、`$sql`）解析成管理 API 接受的形式。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:57
msgid "**Kalam does not vendor the cartridge.** Its image build fetches the component from Ants' latest release, so publishing an Ants release moves the engine the ladder plays. A deployment under a live season should pin `ANTS_RELEASE` to a tag. If you let the digest move under a live season, runners can claim none of its queued matches."
msgstr "**Kalam 不自带卡带**。它的镜像构建从 Ants 的最新发布版本获取组件，所以发布一个 Ants 发布版本就会改变天梯所用的引擎。赛季进行中的部署应把 `ANTS_RELEASE` 锁定到某个标签。如果你让摘要在赛季进行中发生变化，运行器将无法认领该赛季排队中的任何对局。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:62
msgid "Every plugin also needs a valid Ed25519 signature over its digest. The deployment mints it, because the deployment holds the trust key. Re-sign after any plugin or engine rebuild: a stale signature quarantines the channels that call the plugin, and the node stops at its boot apply."
msgstr "每个插件还需要一个对其摘要的有效 Ed25519 签名。签名由部署方生成，因为信任密钥在部署方手里。插件或引擎重新构建后都要重新签名：过期的签名会让调用该插件的频道被隔离，节点在启动应用包时就会停止。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:66
msgid "**You need no checkout to run the stack.** [Running locally](running-locally.md) gives the commands. A sibling checkout matters only when you build an image, as the build's default source."
msgstr "**运行平台不需要任何检出目录。**[本地运行](running-locally.md)给出了命令。只有在你构建镜像时，并列的检出目录才有意义，它是构建的默认源码来源。"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:69
msgid "What is not supplied yet"
msgstr "尚未提供的部分"

#: src/platform/repositories.md:71
msgid "Compose is the deployment path these repositories implement, locally and in production. None of them holds a cloud autoscaler, and a release is deployed by hand."
msgstr "这些仓库实现的部署路径是 Compose，本地和生产环境都是如此。它们都不包含云端自动扩缩容，发布版本靠手动部署。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:3
msgid "The local stack runs submission, admission, trials, matches and rankings together. To play an entry on your machine, use `tinybrains`, which needs no Compose, no database and no season; [Testing before you submit](../models/testing.md) covers it. Bring the stack up when you want the _loop_: a submission that is admitted, given a trial, promoted, paired and rated."
msgstr "本地平台把提交、审核、试赛、对局和排名放在一起运行。要在自己的机器上让参赛模型打一场，用 `tinybrains` 就行，它不需要 Compose、数据库和赛季；[提交前的测试](../models/testing.md)介绍了它。当你想要的是<em>完整闭环</em>时，再把平台启动起来：一次提交被审核通过、进入试赛、晋级、配对并评分。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:10
msgid "Install **Docker Engine with Compose v2.21 or newer** and a POSIX shell. You need two checkouts, each running one compose file:"
msgstr "安装 **Docker Engine，带 Compose v2.21 或更新版本**，以及一个 POSIX shell。你需要两个检出目录，各自运行一个 compose 文件："

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:18
msgid "**Every service is an image its own repository publishes.** Soma is `ghcr.io/tiny-brains/soma`: orion-server with the Soma package inside, which applies the schema and loads its own package. Kalam is `ghcr.io/tiny-brains/kalam`, a runner that loads its own. The cartridge has no image: each of these images, and the site's viewer, takes it from an [Ants release](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/ants/releases). To try a Soma change, build that checkout and set `SOMA_IMAGE`; to try a Kalam or web change, run with `--build`."
msgstr "**每个服务都是由它自己的仓库发布的镜像**。Soma 是 `ghcr.io/tiny-brains/soma`：内含 Soma 包的 orion-server，它应用数据库模式并加载自己的包。Kalam 是 `ghcr.io/tiny-brains/kalam`，一个加载自己的包的运行器。卡带没有镜像：这些镜像和网站的查看器都从 [Ants 发布版本](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/ants/releases)获取它。要试验 Soma 的改动，构建那个检出目录并设置 `SOMA_IMAGE`；要试验 Kalam 或 web 的改动，带上 `--build` 运行。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:25
msgid "**Every command below is run from `tinybrains/devops/`**, which holds the compose files, the setup scripts and each environment's own settings. `./tb <env> <web|runner> ...` passes the rest to `docker compose` with that environment's file, project and settings already chosen."
msgstr "**下面的每条命令都在 `tinybrains/devops/` 中运行**，这个目录存放 compose 文件、安装脚本和每个环境自己的设置。`./tb <env> <web|runner> ...` 把其余参数传给 `docker compose`，并已选好该环境的文件、项目和设置。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:29
msgid "The stack uses the pinned Orion **1.12.0** runtime, Postgres 16, Redis, MinIO and the browser application. **There is no inference sidecar**: each node runs models itself. You do not need Rust on the host."
msgstr "平台使用锁定的 Orion **1.12.0** 运行时、Postgres 16、Redis、MinIO 和浏览器应用。**没有推理边车服务**：每个节点自己运行模型。宿主机上不需要 Rust。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:33
msgid "Configure the platform"
msgstr "配置平台"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:35
msgid "One command sets up every credential:"
msgstr "一条命令就能设置好所有凭据："

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:41
msgid "It creates `dev/web/.env`, mints `POSTGRES_PASSWORD`, `SOMA_SESSION_SECRET`, `RUNNER_TOKEN_SECRET`, the models read key and `ORION_ADMIN_KEY`, pins `SOMA_IMAGE` to the newest Soma release, generates the Ed25519 plugin trust root for this machine, and signs the plugins in the Soma image (and in a Kalam image, when one is here). It is idempotent, so it is also the repair command after a new image: an unsigned component quarantines the channels that call it, and the node stops at its boot apply. `examples/web.env.example` is the contract it fills, and it writes `dev/web/.env`."
msgstr "它创建 `dev/web/.env`，生成 `POSTGRES_PASSWORD`、`SOMA_SESSION_SECRET`、`RUNNER_TOKEN_SECRET`、模型读取密钥和 `ORION_ADMIN_KEY`，把 `SOMA_IMAGE` 锁定到最新的 Soma 发布版本，为这台机器生成 Ed25519 插件信任根，并为 Soma 镜像（以及 Kalam 镜像，如果本机有的话）里的插件签名。它是幂等的，所以换了新镜像之后它也是修复命令：未签名的组件会让调用它的频道被隔离，节点在启动应用包时就会停止。`examples/web.env.example` 是它据以填写的契约，它写出的是 `dev/web/.env`。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:48
msgid "Register a GitHub OAuth App with homepage `http://localhost:5173` and callback `http://localhost:5173/v1/auth/github/callback`, and set `GITHUB_CLIENT_ID` and `GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET` in `.env`. Plain HTTP development uses a non-Secure cookie; an HTTPS deployment needs the matching cookie policy."
msgstr "注册一个 GitHub OAuth 应用，主页填 `http://localhost:5173`，回调填 `http://localhost:5173/v1/auth/github/callback`，然后在 `.env` 中设置 `GITHUB_CLIENT_ID` 和 `GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET`。纯 HTTP 开发用的是不带 Secure 标志的 cookie；HTTPS 部署需要与之匹配的 cookie 策略。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:53
msgid "Bring it up"
msgstr "启动"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:61
msgid "Two one-shots run before Soma. **`buckets`** makes the replay and models buckets, the models read key and `models/*`'s public read. **`soma-bootstrap`** creates the Orion state database, applies Soma's migrations when the platform database is empty, and registers the game, the cartridge and the engine digest its image carries. It records a digest of the migrations it applied, and refuses a schema rewrite it cannot apply. **`soma`** then loads its own package and stops if a plugin fails to verify, so any `soma` node that is up is serving; its log says so with `every [packages] artifact is applied and serving`."
msgstr "Soma 之前先运行两个一次性任务。**`buckets`** 创建回放和模型存储桶、模型读取密钥，以及 `models/*` 的公开读取权限。**`soma-bootstrap`** 创建 Orion 状态数据库，在平台数据库为空时应用 Soma 的迁移，并注册游戏、卡带和它的镜像所携带的引擎摘要。它记录下所应用迁移的摘要，并拒绝它无法应用的数据库模式改写。随后 **`soma`** 加载自己的包，若有插件验证失败就停止，所以任何处于运行状态的 `soma` 节点都在正常服务；它的日志会用 `every [packages] artifact is applied and serving` 这一行来说明。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:69
msgid "Open `http://localhost:5173`, or verify the proxy:"
msgstr "打开 `http://localhost:5173`，或者验证代理："

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:75
msgid "The local ports are Web at 5173, Soma at 8080, the Orion console at 8081 and MinIO at 9000/9001, all bound to loopback. Use one browser origin for application requests and sign-in."
msgstr "本地端口：Web 在 5173，Soma 在 8080，Orion 控制台在 8081，MinIO 在 9000/9001，全部只绑定到本机回环地址。应用请求和登录要使用同一个浏览器源（origin）。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:78
msgid "Start a runner"
msgstr "启动运行器"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:80
msgid "The platform plays no match itself. A runner from Kalam's checkout plays them, and reaches the platform only through Soma. Make yourself an administrator before you sign in:"
msgstr "平台自己不进行任何对局。对局由 Kalam 检出目录启动的运行器来打，它只通过 Soma 接触平台。登录之前，先把自己设为管理员："

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:87
msgid "It writes `github:<your numeric id>` into `SOMA_ADMIN_IDS` in `.env` (never the login, which GitHub hands on after a rename), and signing in makes that account an administrator. Then mint the runner a key on the admin **Runners** page, which shows the key once."
msgstr "它把 `github:<your numeric id>` 写进 `.env` 的 `SOMA_ADMIN_IDS`（绝不用登录名，因为改名后 GitHub 会把登录名转给别人），登录后该账户就成为管理员。然后在管理台的**运行器**页为运行器生成一个密钥，密钥只显示一次。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:91
msgid "Copy `examples/runner.env.example` to `dev/kalam/.env` and uncomment its local block: every address is `host.docker.internal`, and it already names `RUNNER_SIG_DIR=../web/keys/signatures`. Fill in the key, `TB_TRUST_PUBLIC_KEY` and the `MODELS_READ_*` pair from web's `.env`, set `KALAM_IMAGE` (the released image, or `tinybrains/kalam:dev` with `--build`) and mint the runner an `ORION_ADMIN_KEY` of its own. Then:"
msgstr "把 `examples/runner.env.example` 复制为 `dev/kalam/.env`，取消其本地块的注释：每个地址都是 `host.docker.internal`，并且已经写好了 `RUNNER_SIG_DIR=../web/keys/signatures`。填入密钥、`TB_TRUST_PUBLIC_KEY` 和 web 的 `.env` 中的那对 `MODELS_READ_*`，设置 `KALAM_IMAGE`（已发布的镜像，或配合 `--build` 使用 `tinybrains/kalam:dev`），再为运行器单独生成一个 `ORION_ADMIN_KEY`。然后："

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:99
msgid "# until \"every [packages] artifact is applied and serving\"\n"
msgstr "# 直到出现 \"every [packages] artifact is applied and serving\"\n"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:100
msgid "# the same line\n"
msgstr "# 同样的一行\n"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:103
msgid "`--profile admit` starts the **admitting runner** beside the runner. Soma runs no model, so the admitting runner admits every submission and baseline; while none is up, they wait in `testing`."
msgstr "`--profile admit` 在运行器旁边启动**审核运行器**。Soma 不运行任何模型，所以每一次提交和每个基线都由审核运行器审核；没有审核运行器在线时，它们一直停留在 `testing`。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:106
msgid "Build the runner and Soma from the same Ants release. A runner whose engine digest differs from the one Soma declared claims nothing, for ever, and looks healthy doing it."
msgstr "运行器和 Soma 要用同一个 Ants 发布版本构建。如果运行器的引擎摘要与 Soma 声明的不同，它就永远什么也认领不到，而且看上去一切正常。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:109
msgid "Sign in and make a match happen"
msgstr "登录并促成一场对局"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:111
msgid "Sign in with GitHub at `http://localhost:5173`. Use `localhost` and never `127.0.0.1`: the sign-in cookie is host-only. Create a model with the New model form on your profile, then submit through the site's own `/submit` form, which hashes both files and uploads them itself, and shows the upload commands only if a transfer fails. A game needs an open local season **with a board in play**, an eligible account, a runner, and at least one runnable opponent for the trial and regular matches."
msgstr "在 `http://localhost:5173` 用 GitHub 登录。要用 `localhost`，绝不要用 `127.0.0.1`：登录 cookie 只对该主机名有效。在你的个人主页用“新建模型”表单创建一个模型，然后通过网站自己的 `/submit` 表单提交，它会自己计算两个文件的哈希并上传，只有在传输失败时才显示上传命令。一个游戏需要一个进行中且**有启用中地图**的本地赛季、一个有参赛资格的账户、一个运行器，以及至少一个可以上场的对手来打试赛和常规对局。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:117
msgid "**A fresh stack has no season.** An administrator creates one on the admin pages, as in production; the stack seeds nothing."
msgstr "**全新的平台没有赛季**。和生产环境一样，由管理员在管理台上创建；平台不会预置任何数据。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:120
msgid "**It has no boards either.** No release ships a season's boards: an administrator uploads them on the season's page and puts each in play. A season's board is named `<size>-<terrain>-<N>p-<H>h` ([The maps](../games/ants/maps.md#how-a-board-is-made)), so a basic board goes in under a name of that shape. `tinybrains maps export ants <dir>` writes the five basic boards the release ships, and `tinybrains maps check` tells you whether Soma would accept a board of your own. Until one is in play, the pair clock pairs nothing and a candidate waits in `verified`."
msgstr "**它也没有地图**。没有任何发布版本附带赛季的地图：由管理员在赛季页面上传，再逐一启用。赛季的地图名为 `<size>-<terrain>-<N>p-<H>h`（[地图](../games/ants/maps.md#how-a-board-is-made)），所以基础地图也要以这种形式的名字放进去。`tinybrains maps export ants <dir>` 写出发布版本附带的五张基础地图，`tinybrains maps check` 告诉你 Soma 会不会接受你自己的地图。在有地图启用之前，pair 时钟什么也不配对，候选版本一直停留在 `verified`。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:127
msgid "**It has no baselines either.** The platform ships no model: an administrator uploads a season's baselines on the season's page, each a name and its two files, and `ants-starter/models` holds three. The admit clock admits a baseline as it admits a submission, and the baseline lands switched off until the administrator switches it on there. A candidate stuck in `verified` has no baseline its trial can seat: check the season's page for a baseline in play. The same files under a second name make a second opponent, and that is how a trial on a board of many seats finds enough of them."
msgstr "**它也没有基线**。平台不附带任何模型：由管理员在赛季页面上传赛季的基线，每个基线是一个名字加它的两个文件，`ants-starter/models` 里有三个。admit 时钟像审核提交一样审核基线，基线上传后处于停用状态，直到管理员在那里启用它。候选版本卡在 `verified`，是因为没有基线能坐进它的试赛：到赛季页面看看有没有启用中的基线。同样的文件换一个名字就是第二个对手，多席位地图上的试赛就是这样凑够对手的。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:134
msgid "Only an administrator can create a season, and an administrator promotes or demotes anyone else on the admin **Users** page. Follow the submitted model's phase, its trial ID, then its finished match history and leaderboard entry. That proves a working stack better than a successful health probe."
msgstr "只有管理员能创建赛季，管理员在管理台的**用户**页提升或降级其他任何人。跟踪已提交模型的阶段、它的试赛 ID，然后是它已结束的对局历史和排行榜条目。这比一次成功的健康检查更能证明平台在正常工作。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:138
msgid "Reloading and stopping"
msgstr "重新加载与停止"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:140
msgid "A package edit is a new image: rebuild it, and the node loads it on start."
msgstr "改动包就意味着新镜像：重新构建它，节点启动时会加载它。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:143
msgid "tinybrains/soma:dev"
msgstr "tinybrains/soma:dev"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:144
msgid "# after any new Soma or Kalam image\n"
msgstr "# 换了新的 Soma 或 Kalam 镜像之后\n"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:147
msgid "Loading a package applies no schema migrations. `soma-bootstrap` applies them only when the platform database is **empty**. The schema is pre-release, and a change rewrites `0001_init.sql` or `0002_sessions.sql` in place, so bootstrap refuses a rewritten schema at once; you never meet it later as a missing relation. `./scripts/dev/resync-dev-schema.sh` rebuilds a local database on the new schema and keeps the accounts and sessions."
msgstr "加载包不会应用任何数据库模式迁移。`soma-bootstrap` 只在平台数据库为**空**时才应用迁移。数据库模式还处于发布前阶段，改动是直接改写 `0001_init.sql` 或 `0002_sessions.sql`，所以引导程序会立刻拒绝被改写的模式；你不会在之后才以“缺少某个表”的形式撞上它。`./scripts/dev/resync-dev-schema.sh` 按新模式重建本地数据库，并保留账户和会话。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:153
msgid "A new engine is a new Soma image and a new runner image, built from the same release, and bootstrap declares the new digest only with `ENGINE_RELEASE=1`, which it refuses while a season is live: close the season first."
msgstr "新引擎意味着新的 Soma 镜像和新的运行器镜像，两者从同一个发布版本构建；引导程序只有在 `ENGINE_RELEASE=1` 时才声明新的摘要，而赛季进行中它会拒绝这样做：先结束赛季。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:157
msgid "Stop services with `./tb dev web stop`. A runner drains before it stops, but a forced shutdown can still leave claims for the platform to recover. Delete volumes only when you mean to discard local history."
msgstr "用 `./tb dev web stop` 停止服务。运行器会先打完手头的对局再停止，但强制关闭仍可能留下需要平台收回的认领。只有当你确实要丢弃本地历史时才删除数据卷。"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:161
msgid "When nothing plays"
msgstr "没有对局在进行时"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:163
msgid "Symptom"
msgstr "症状"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:163
msgid "Check"
msgstr "检查"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:165
msgid "Sign-in loops or returns unauthenticated"
msgstr "登录反复跳转或返回未认证"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:165
msgid "Browser origin, OAuth callback, cookie policy, and session secret"
msgstr "浏览器源、OAuth 回调、cookie 策略和会话密钥"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:166
msgid "Candidate stays testing"
msgstr "候选版本一直处于 testing"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:166
msgid "Whether both objects are in the models bucket, the registered reference observations, the admission clock, and whether an admitting runner is up"
msgstr "两个对象是否都在模型存储桶里、已注册的参考观测、admit 时钟，以及是否有审核运行器在线"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:167
msgid "Rejected `ARTIFACT_MISSING`"
msgstr "被拒绝，原因 `ARTIFACT_MISSING`"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:167
msgid "The upload step. Nothing fetches from a release: the competitor PUTs to a presigned URL"
msgstr "上传这一步。没有任何东西会从发布版本抓取文件：由参赛者 PUT 到预签名 URL"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:168
msgid "Candidate stays verified"
msgstr "候选版本一直处于 verified"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:168
msgid "Whether the season has a board in play that its baselines can seat, then the latest trial status and the pairing clock"
msgstr "赛季是否有启用中的地图且它的基线能坐进去，然后是最新的试赛状态和 pair 时钟"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:169
msgid "Pending matches never run"
msgstr "待进行的对局始终不开始"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:169
msgid "A runner is up and its key is live; its engine digest equals the one `soma-bootstrap` declared"
msgstr "有运行器在线且其密钥有效；它的引擎摘要与 `soma-bootstrap` 声明的一致"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:170
msgid "The runner logs `invalid_key`"
msgstr "运行器日志出现 `invalid_key`"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:170
msgid "The key comes from another database: mint one on this one"
msgstr "密钥来自另一个数据库：在这个数据库上重新生成一个"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:171
msgid "The runner releases every match without playing it"
msgstr "运行器不打就释放每一场对局"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:171
msgid "The runner's `kalam-roster` clock, and whether its node has the seat's model `active`"
msgstr "运行器的 `kalam-roster` 时钟，以及它的节点上席位的模型是否为 `active`"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:172
msgid "Models cannot load"
msgstr "模型无法加载"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:172
msgid "The bucket's addresses (Soma signs an upload for the public one and dials the internal one, and a runner uses `host.docker.internal`), plus the read key"
msgstr "存储桶的地址（Soma 按公开地址为上传签名、通过内部地址访问，运行器用的是 `host.docker.internal`），以及读取密钥"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:173
msgid "Matches play but cannot finish"
msgstr "对局能进行但无法完成"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:173
msgid "The runner's `RUNNER_BLOB_ENDPOINT` must equal Soma's, character for character"
msgstr "运行器的 `RUNNER_BLOB_ENDPOINT` 必须与 Soma 的逐字符一致"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:174
msgid "Results exist but ratings do not move"
msgstr "有结果但评分不变"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:174
msgid "The count clock; check whether the match was an unrated trial"
msgstr "count 时钟；看看这场对局是否是不计评分的试赛"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:175
msgid "A node stops with a quarantined channel"
msgstr "节点因频道被隔离而停止"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:175
msgid "The component's Ed25519 signature. Re-run `devops/scripts/setup/sign-plugins.sh` after any new image"
msgstr "组件的 Ed25519 签名。换了新镜像之后重新运行 `devops/scripts/setup/sign-plugins.sh`"

#: src/platform/running-locally.md:177
msgid "Read `./tb dev web logs` for the relevant service, and keep model and match IDs in reports. A cloud deployment, TLS ingress, live R2 verification and autoscaling lie outside this local setup."
msgstr "用 `./tb dev web logs` 读取相关服务的日志，报告问题时带上模型和对局 ID。云端部署、TLS 入口、真实 R2 验证和自动扩缩容都不在这套本地环境的范围内。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:3
msgid "A game cartridge defines the world competitors act in: generation, rules, observations, actions, scoring and replay reconstruction. The platform runs its WebAssembly component, and Orion's `models` entity runs competitor models. Game code must not schedule its own matches, fetch models or write ratings."
msgstr "游戏卡带定义了参赛者行动于其中的世界：世界生成、规则、观测、动作、计分与回放重建。平台运行它的 WebAssembly 组件，参赛者的模型则由 Orion 的 `models` 实体运行。游戏代码不得自行安排对局、获取模型或写入评分。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:8
msgid "Ants is the reference implementation, and it keeps every rule on this page: its [repository](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/ants) builds the component from `engine/` and the viewer from `viz/`, and publishes both as one GitHub release archive. **The local runner already takes a second game without a line of Rust.** `tinybrains` knows five function names, `cartridge.json` and the replay envelope, and reads every board, seat count and limit from the manifest, so you add a game to it with an entry in a project's `games.toml`. The _ladder_ is the harder half: Soma's clocks, Kalam's package definitions and the registration scripts still carry Ants-specific configuration, so adding a game there means checking each of those integration points. The ladder has no self-service upload flow for a game yet."
msgstr "Ants 是参考实现，并且遵守本页的每一条规则：它的[仓库](https://github.com/Tiny-Brains/ants)从 `engine/` 构建组件、从 `viz/` 构建查看器，并把两者作为一个 GitHub 发布版本压缩包一起发布。**本地运行器已经可以接入第二个游戏，而不需要写一行 Rust**。`tinybrains` 只认识五个函数名、`cartridge.json` 和回放封包，每张地图、席位数和限制都从清单里读取，所以只要在项目的 `games.toml` 里加一个条目，就能把一个游戏加进去。更难的那一半是<em>天梯</em>：Soma 的时钟、Kalam 的包定义和注册脚本仍然带着 Ants 专有的配置，所以在天梯上添加游戏意味着逐一检查这些集成点。天梯目前还没有游戏的自助上传流程。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:18
msgid "**Adding a game deploys nothing.** A finished cartridge is a signed component and two manifests, with no service to build, size or supervise. If shipping your game seems to need anything else, raise it before you work around it."
msgstr "**添加游戏不需要部署任何东西**。一个完成的卡带就是一个签过名的组件加两份清单，没有任何服务需要构建、扩容或看护。如果发布你的游戏似乎还需要别的什么，先提出来讨论，不要绕过去。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:22
msgid "The five functions"
msgstr "五个函数"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:24
msgid "Export these operations in the game's own `tb.<game>` namespace. Each is a pure JSON-to-JSON function; one component exports all five and dispatches on the name."
msgstr "在游戏自己的 `tb.<game>` 命名空间里导出这些操作。每一个都是纯粹的 JSON 到 JSON 函数；一个组件导出全部五个，并按名称分发。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:27
msgid "Function suffix"
msgstr "函数后缀"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:27
msgid "Input and result"
msgstr "输入与结果"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:29
msgid "`worldgen`"
msgstr "`worldgen`"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:29
msgid "Seeds and a board object (one for the wave, or one per seed) to the initial packed wave state"
msgstr "种子与地图对象（整个波次一个，或每个种子一个）→ 初始的打包波次状态"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:30
msgid "`observe`"
msgstr "`observe`"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:30
msgid "Wave state and opaque seat references to per-seat observations"
msgstr "波次状态与不透明的席位引用 → 每个席位的观测"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:31
msgid "`step`"
msgstr "`step`"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:31
msgid "Wave state and actions to updated state, completion flags, and replay deltas"
msgstr "波次状态与动作 → 更新后的状态、完成标志和回放增量"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:32
msgid "`finish`"
msgstr "`finish`"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:32
msgid "Wave state to per-match ranks, integer scores, ending reasons, and the board each ended match was played on"
msgstr "波次状态 → 每场对局的名次、整数得分、结束原因，以及每场已结束对局所用的地图"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:33
msgid "`replay-decode`"
msgstr "`replay-decode`"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:33
msgid "A replay envelope and a turn (or a `from`/`to` range) to reconstructed frames"
msgstr "回放封包与一个回合（或 `from`/`to` 范围）→ 重建出的帧"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:35
msgid "Declare exact input fields in the plugin manifest, and treat Ants' `engine/plugin.toml` as the complete worked contract; this table abbreviates it. Three details of the shape came out of running it against a real Orion:"
msgstr "在插件清单里准确声明输入字段，并把 Ants 的 `engine/plugin.toml` 当作完整的实例契约；上表只是它的缩写。接口形状上有三个细节，是在真实的 Orion 上跑过之后才定下来的："

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:39
msgid "**`replay-decode`, with a hyphen.** Orion refuses a function label outside `[a-z][a-z0-9-]*`, so the underscore spelling fails to load."
msgstr "**`replay-decode`，用连字符**。Orion 拒绝不符合 `[a-z][a-z0-9-]*` 的函数标签，所以下划线的写法无法加载。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:41
msgid "**`observe` takes a flat list of references**, each carrying its own match index and seat, which the cartridge matches and echoes onto the view without inspecting. The list is flat because the caller rebuilds it from the _live_ seats each turn, and a nested index would shift the moment a match ended."
msgstr "**`observe` 接收一个扁平的引用列表**，每个引用各自带着对局索引和席位，卡带据此匹配并原样回显到观测视图上，不做检查。列表之所以扁平，是因为调用方每回合都从<em>仍在进行</em>的席位重建它，而嵌套的索引会在某场对局一结束时就发生错位。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:45
msgid "**Actions may be positional**, aligned with the last `observe`, because a workflow cannot zip two arrays. Accept an explicit `{m, seat, action}` form as well, for a caller that omits a seat."
msgstr "**动作可以按位置给出**，与上一次 `observe` 对齐，因为工作流无法把两个数组 zip 起来。同时也要接受显式的 `{m, seat, action}` 形式，供省略了某个席位的调用方使用。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:48
msgid "Operate on a **wave of matches**, including waves whose matches finish at different turns. Return no observations for a finished match: there is no terminal message, and nothing tells a model that it lost. Match results must give one-based ranks, with ties allowed, and integer scores. `finish` is the platform's only semantic dependency on your game, and the ladder decides what a rank means for it."
msgstr "要以**一个波次的对局**为单位运作，包括各场对局在不同回合结束的波次。已结束的对局不再返回观测：没有终止消息，也没有任何东西告诉模型它输了。对局结果必须给出从 1 开始的名次（允许并列）和整数得分。`finish` 是平台对你的游戏唯一的语义依赖，而名次意味着什么由天梯决定。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:54
msgid "**The ladder sends a wave of one.** Kalam claims a single match row and plays it, so only the local runner, and a cartridge that wants it, exercise the wave dimension. Keep the ABI wave-shaped anyway: matching a seat by `(m, seat)` instead of its position makes an echoed reference safe, and it costs nothing when `m` is always 0."
msgstr "**天梯发送的波次只含一场对局**。Kalam 认领一行对局并把它打完，所以只有本地运行器，以及想用它的卡带，才会真正用到波次这一维度。即便如此也要保持 ABI 的波次形状：按 `(m, seat)` 而不是按位置来匹配席位，回显的引用才是安全的，而在 `m` 恒为 0 时这不花任何代价。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:59
msgid "State and determinism"
msgstr "状态与确定性"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:61
msgid "All state must round-trip through the packed wave value. The sandbox keeps nothing between invocations, so anything you do not encode is gone next turn."
msgstr "所有状态都必须经由打包的波次值往返。沙箱在两次调用之间什么都不保留，所以凡是你没有编码进去的东西，下一回合就没了。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:64
msgid "**Make it opaque and compact**: a packed binary encoding, base64'd, in place of readable JSON. Nothing outside the cartridge may decode it, so \"the platform never parses game state\" holds by construction."
msgstr "**让它不透明且紧凑**：用打包的二进制编码再经 base64，而不是可读的 JSON。卡带之外的任何东西都不能解码它，于是“平台从不解析游戏状态”在构造上就成立了。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:67
msgid "**Give it no version field.** A wave never spans two cartridge versions, so the digest that produced the encoding versions it."
msgstr "**不要给它版本字段**。一个波次从不跨越两个卡带版本，所以生成这个编码的摘要就是它的版本。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:69
msgid "**Size it against the plugin ceilings** below. The state crosses the sandbox boundary twice per call, so a compact state raises throughput."
msgstr "**按下文的插件上限控制它的大小**。状态每次调用都要穿越沙箱边界两次，所以状态越紧凑，吞吐量越高。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:72
msgid "**Game state is integer-only: no floating point in game logic.** Integers make the platform's build and the browser's agree bit for bit, so a replay can be an action stream instead of a hundred times as many frames. Scores are integers for the same reason. The sandbox enforces the rest: a component's world has **no imports** (no clock, no randomness, no filesystem, no sockets), so every random draw derives from the seeds the caller hands `worldgen`. Ants checks the integer rule at source level (`tools/deny.sh`), because nothing in Rust enforces it."
msgstr "**游戏状态只用整数：游戏逻辑里没有浮点数**。整数让平台的构建和浏览器的构建逐位一致，回放因此可以是一条动作流，而不是多上百倍的帧。得分是整数也是同样的原因。其余的由沙箱强制：组件的世界**没有任何导入**（没有时钟、没有随机数、没有文件系统、没有套接字），所以每一次随机抽取都源自调用方交给 `worldgen` 的种子。Ants 在源码层面检查整数规则（`tools/deny.sh`），因为 Rust 里没有任何东西强制它。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:79
msgid "Your tests should cover seed repeatability, state round trips, player symmetry, observation privacy, action ordering, end conditions, ties and replay reconstruction. Before you claim portable replay fidelity, you also need a cross-host conformance run between the platform and a browser; the Ants reference implementation does not supply that browser run yet."
msgstr "你的测试应当覆盖种子可重复性、状态往返、玩家对称性、观测隐私、动作顺序、结束条件、并列以及回放重建。在宣称回放可以跨平台忠实还原之前，你还需要在平台与浏览器之间做一次跨宿主的一致性运行；Ants 参考实现目前还没有提供这个浏览器端的运行。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:84
msgid "Boards, if your game has them"
msgstr "地图（如果你的游戏有的话）"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:86
msgid "Ants generates nothing at match time. Its boards are **files**, one JSON file per board carrying its grid, its water, its hills and its turn-zero food, and **the component carries none of them**. `worldgen` takes the board whole, as an object, for every match it opens. It has no catalogue to look a name up in and nothing to choose from, so it refuses a call without a board. Design for three consequences:"
msgstr "Ants 在对局时不生成任何东西。它的地图是**文件**，每张地图一个 JSON 文件，装着它的网格、水域、蚁丘和第 0 回合的食物，而**组件不带任何一张地图**。`worldgen` 为它开启的每一场对局接收完整的地图对象。它没有可以按名字查找的目录，也没有可供选择的东西，所以没有地图的调用会被拒绝。设计时要考虑三个后果："

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:92
msgid "**A board is never an engine-digest change.** An administrator uploads a season's boards to it; Soma stores them with the season and sends the board to the runner with every match it claims. No release or repository holds them, and a season can take a board into play or out of it while it runs, on the engine it opened with."
msgstr "**地图永远不会改变引擎摘要**。管理员把赛季的地图上传到赛季里；Soma 随赛季保存它们，并在运行器认领每一场对局时把地图一并发过去。没有任何发布版本或仓库保存它们，而赛季可以在进行当中、在开赛时的引擎上，把一张地图投入使用或撤下。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:96
msgid "**Symmetry is an assertion.** A generator can make fairness true by construction; a file someone edited cannot. Every board passes a validator before any match plays on it: terrain, hills and turn-zero food closed under the board's own shift; a shift that returns home in as many steps as there are seats; every square of land reachable from every other; the same number of hills a seat; no hill on water or walled in. A refusal is `caller_input`, because the same board can never succeed. **The platform runs the same validator at upload**: Soma loads the component and calls `worldgen` on every board an administrator uploads, and again whenever an administrator puts one in play, so an unplayable board fails there and never fails a match paired on it."
msgstr "**对称性是一条断言**。生成器可以在构造上保证公平；经人手编辑过的文件做不到。每张地图在任何对局用它开打之前都要通过校验器：地形、蚁丘和第 0 回合的食物在地图自身的平移下封闭；该平移走过与席位数相同的步数后回到原点；每一格陆地都能从其他任何一格到达；每个席位的蚁丘数量相同；没有蚁丘落在水域上或被围死。拒绝归为 `caller_input`，因为同一张地图永远不可能成功。**平台在上传时运行同一个校验器**：Soma 加载组件，对管理员上传的每张地图调用 `worldgen`，并在管理员把地图投入使用时再调用一次，所以无法开打的地图会在那里失败，而不会让配对到它上面的对局失败。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:104
msgid "**The cartridge declares what a board may be.** `limits.boards` in the manifest bounds the seats, each side and the squares, and Soma refuses an upload outside it. The bound is also admission's promise: you must draw the reference observations that admission proves every adapter against on boards that span it, because a season can add a board after Soma admitted a model. Ants ships five **basic boards** in its release, one of each size, from two seats to eight and from the smallest side to the largest. It derives `limits.boards` from them and draws the reference set on them, so the two cannot disagree."
msgstr "**卡带声明地图可以是什么样**。清单里的 `limits.boards` 限定席位数、每条边长和格子数，超出它的上传会被 Soma 拒绝。这个界限同时也是审核的承诺：审核用来验证每个适配器的参考观测，必须取自覆盖整个界限的地图，因为赛季可以在 Soma 审核通过某个模型之后再添加地图。Ants 的发布版本里带有五张**基础地图**，每种尺寸一张，从两个席位到八个，从最短的边到最长的。它从这些地图推导出 `limits.boards`，并在它们上面生成参考观测集，所以两者不可能不一致。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:112
msgid "**The competitor still does not choose.** On the ladder, the pair clock chooses the board from the season's boards in play and assigns the seed with it. The platform reads no further into a board than its header (`id`, `players`, `rows`, `cols`); everything else in the file is the cartridge's. The generator stays, as the tool that writes the files. Ants keeps it in a crate beside the engine, outside the component's source, and its gate regenerates every basic board and compares bytes, so a hand-edited board fails the build."
msgstr "**参赛者仍然无法选择**。在天梯上，配对时钟从赛季正在使用的地图里选出地图，并随之分配种子。平台对地图的读取止于头部（`id`、`players`、`rows`、`cols`）；文件里的其他一切都属于卡带。生成器仍然保留，作为写出这些文件的工具。Ants 把它放在引擎旁边的一个 crate 里，在组件源码之外，而它的构建门禁会重新生成每一张基础地图并逐字节比较，所以手工编辑过的地图会让构建失败。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:119
msgid "A game whose configurations are not boards still gets one in `worldgen`: whatever set-up it plays, as a file with a header the platform can read, and a `limits.boards` that says what it may be."
msgstr "即使一个游戏的配置不是地图，`worldgen` 也同样会收到一张：无论它玩的是什么样的设定，都写成一个带有平台可读头部的文件，再配上一个说明它可以是什么样的 `limits.boards`。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:124
msgid "A replay is the action stream, so re-simulating it needs the position it started from. **Make the envelope carry its own board**: `finish` returns the board each ended match was played on, and the envelope stores it beside the seed and the turn limit. The replay then stays viewable whatever happens later to the season or to the board's place in it."
msgstr "回放就是动作流，所以重新模拟它需要知道起始局面。**让封包自带地图**：`finish` 返回每场已结束对局所用的地图，封包把它和种子、回合上限存在一起。这样无论赛季之后发生什么，无论这张地图在赛季中的去留如何，回放都始终可以查看。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:129
msgid "**Test against an envelope the platform wrote.** Ants keeps a real one as a fixture, because a round-trip test that builds its own envelope keeps passing while the writer and the reader drift apart."
msgstr "**用平台真正写出的封包来测试**。Ants 保留了一个真实的封包作为测试夹具，因为自己构造封包的往返测试，在写入方和读取方渐行渐远时仍会一直通过。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:132
msgid "**Give the viewer a range.** Decoding re-simulates from turn zero, so a scrubber asking frame by frame is quadratic; `from`/`to` walks the match once."
msgstr "**给查看器一个范围**。解码是从第 0 回合开始重新模拟的，所以逐帧请求的进度条是平方级的开销；`from`/`to` 只把对局走一遍。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:134
msgid "**Put in a frame what the viewer must not work out for itself.** Ants' frames name, per seat, the squares that turn revealed for the first time, so the viewer can draw what each seat has explored without re-implementing vision. They also carry each ant's id, the ants that died on that turn with the enemies that killed them, and the hills that fell with the seat that took them, so the viewer draws a strike and a razing from the record and re-reads no rule to find one."
msgstr "**把查看器不该自己推算的东西放进帧里**。Ants 的帧按席位列出该回合首次揭示的格子，所以查看器不必重新实现视野就能画出每个席位探索过的范围。帧里还带着每只蚂蚁的 id、该回合死亡的蚂蚁及击杀它们的敌人，以及被攻陷的蚁丘及攻下它的席位，所以查看器直接按记录画出击杀和蚁丘的摧毁，不必重读任何规则去推断。"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:140
msgid "The two manifests"
msgstr "两份清单"

#: src/platform/adding-a-game.md:142
msgid "The **plugin manifest** describes the Orion ABI, component path, namespaced functions and input fields. `name` is a lowercase reverse-domain identifier with at least two labels, and every function is `<name>.<label>`. The field table is a contract Orion checks: Orion refuses to activate a plugin version whose schema an active workflow no longer satisfies (a renamed field, or a field that has become required), names the workflow, and keeps the previous version serving. Ants authors `engine/plugin.toml` and generates `plugin.json` from it."
msgstr "**插件清单**描述 Orion ABI、组件路径、带命名空间的函数和输入字段。`name` 是小写的反向域名标识符，至少两段，每个函数都写作 `<name>.<label>`。字段表是 Orion 会检查的契约：如果某个插件版本的结构定义已不再被某个在用的工作流满足（字段改名，或字段变成了必填），Orion 会拒绝激活它，指出那个工作流，并让上一版本继续服务。Ants 手写 `engine/plugin.toml`，再由它生成 `plugin.json`。"

